window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3101,"title":"Chapter 3101 The Amazing Girl (1)","paragraphs":["3101 The Amazing Girl (1)","Feng Wu asked, “Why should we leave now?”","Chu Qu whispered to her, “The enemy is too strong. We need His Royal Highness.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Fighting these weaklings would be a humiliation to Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu waved him off. “Don’t worry, you have me.”","Chu Qu wanted to cry because he thought Feng Wu was only a Level 2 Spiritual King.","Feng Wu marched off before he could say anything. He had no choice but to follow.","However, they looked at one another, and everybody seemed uncertain.","Could they get out of this place in one piece?","They reached the cells without being stopped.","“Where’s Chen Ziyun?” Feng Wu frowned a little.","Bai Ning was with them the whole time and had remained silent until now. She said, “Chen Ziyun is on the left.”","They saw a corridor wide enough for two adults to walk side by side, and there were individual cells on both sides of the corridor.","The cells were planned out the same way as the entire fortress.","Prisoners of the Military Academy were on the left, and those of Imperial College were on the right.","Dozens of prisoners were held here at the moment, and they were all looking at Feng Wu.","Bai Ning said, “This is a jail for felons. All the prisoners here have been sentenced to at least decades in prison.”","Feng Wu said, “Decades?” Chen Ziyun had to be locked up for that long because he said something that Dongfang didn’t like?","What a bully!","“Xiao Wu... Xiao Wu...” They heard Chen Ziyun’s voice.","The lively teenager was coiled up in a corner and whimpering like a kitten.","Feng Wu immediately saw the blood and whip marks on Chen Ziyun’s face and clothes.","She was infuriated.","“Hey! Who are you people? Who gave you permission to come in?” The warden ran out of his room, holding a whip.","He had a full beard and was a tall, strong man who was at least a Level 5 Spiritual King.","Feng Wu led the team, so he scolded her, “Get out! Do you want to be killed?!”","He then raised his whip at Feng Wu.","He saw they were all Imperial College students, so he did so without hesitation.","A Level 5 Spiritual King!","Chu Qu and the others turned pale.","The warden was famous for his cruelty.","However, the whip never landed on Feng Wu, because she grabbed the tip of the whip first.","The whip was stretched to its limit.","The warden held the handle, and Feng Wu held the tip.","The warden looked at Feng Wu in surprise. Wasn’t the girl a student? She should be a weakling. How could she catch the whip?","He saw that the others were also watching them in astonishment.","He was displeased.","A warden couldn’t be defeated like this!","Infuriated, he tried to pull the whip back with all his might.","However, he realized in frustration that he couldn’t move the whip even an inch!"]},{"number":3102,"title":"Chapter 3102 The Amazing Girl (2)","paragraphs":["3102 The Amazing Girl (2)","How did this happen?","The warden was astonished.","He was a Level 5 Spiritual King, and she was only a student. How could she fight like his equal?","Just then, Feng Wu let go of the whip.","There was a loud thump.","The momentum made the warden stumble backward.","With a loud thump, he smashed into the bars.","Ouch!","The pain brought tears to his eyes.","Feeling paralyzed by the pain, he glared at Feng Wu. “You...”","Feng Wu didn’t say another word and only threw something at Chu Qu.","It was a set of keys.","The warden involuntarily reached for his belt, where his keys hung.","There was nothing there.","Feng Wu had given them to Chu Qu.","Chu Qu looked at the girl in amazement.","When did she get hold of the keys? Why hadn’t he seen anything?","He wasn’t alone. No one else had seen it.","Feng Wu’s movements had been too fast for them to follow.","Feng Wu glanced at Chu Qu. “Open the door.”","“How dare you?!”","They heard an angry voice from behind.","Chang Wen went to get help after Feng Wu smacked him away.","Dongfang Ziyun was the first person he went to.","She happened to be with Zhu Hongyu, one of her suitors, so he came with her.","Dongfang Ziyun looked arrogantly around the room until her gaze landed on Feng Wu’s face.","She marched into the prison as if she owned the place.","Feng Wu was a little surprised to see her.","Jun Linyuan had smacked her pretty hard, hadn’t he?","Elder Dongfang had to carry her away.","“You’re back on your feet fast enough,” Feng Wu said curiously.","Dongfang Ziyun flushed, and she glared at Feng Wu.","The others were all confused. Had Miss Dongfang Ziyun been ill?","Feng Wu said innocently, “You were injured pretty badly. Are you sure you don’t need some more rest?”","Dongfang Ziyun was exasperated.","Zhu Hongyu asked curiously, “You know Ziyun was injured. Do you know what happened?”","Feng Wu asked, “You don’t?”","Of course he didn’t. Dongfang Ziyun would never tell the truth because the truth was that the crown prince had smacked her away.","“Shut up!” Dongfang Ziyun glared at Feng Wu. “Stop talking about my injury! Mind your own business!”","Feng Wu smirked.","How aggressive.","The girl had just threatened her as if she could intimidate Feng Wu.","Dongfang Ziyun’s eyes glinted.","“Feng Wu, you’ve injured Chang Wen and taken away the keys. This is a prison break!” She finally found her chance. “Take Feng Wu down!”","Her plan was to throw Feng Wu in prison, and after that, it would be up to her.","As for the crown prince... Through her aunt’s connections, she learned that the crown prince was in seclusion.","She wouldn’t miss this opportunity to kill Feng Wu.","Dongfang Ziyun smiled maliciously and pointed at Feng Wu. “Take her down! If anyone resists, kill them!”"]},{"number":3103,"title":"Chapter 3103 The Amazing Girl (3)","paragraphs":["3103 The Amazing Girl (3)","Feng Wu looked at Dongfang Ziyun in silence.","She had fought many people, but Dongfang Ziyun stood out as the most stupid of them all.","Had she invested so much in refinement that she didn’t know how to interact with other people?","Dongfang Ziyun turned to the warden. “I’ll leave her to you.”","The warden looked at Dongfang Ziyun in shame.","Dongfang Ziyun frowned. “Do it!”","The warden wanted to cry.","Do it?","Feng Wu had just kicked his ass. What was he supposed to do now?","Dongfang Ziyun was still urging him, so the warden had no choice but to say, “Feng Wu, go inside the cell.”","Feng Wu looked at him as if he was an idiot.","The warden almost blushed.","Feng Wu said, “Did you ask me to lock myself up?”","The warden said, “Yes!”","Feng Wu said, “Is Dongfang Ziyun your mom? You’re so obedient.”","The people around them sucked in their breaths.","The warden’s face turned scarlet red, and Dongfang Ziyun ground her teeth.","“How dare you insult me?! Feng Wu, I’ll kill you!”","She had wanted to let other people do it. That way, the crown prince wouldn’t blame her in the future, but she didn’t expect Feng Wu to have such a sharp tongue. She couldn’t stand it anymore.","How could a student be so arrogant?!","Dongfang Ziyun drew out the soft-bladed sword around her waist and pointed at Feng Wu’s throat.","“Die!”","Although she spent most of her time on refinement, she still kept up with the basic cultivation training. After 20 years, she was a Level 4 Spiritual King.","She believed she was capable enough to take down a student.","Of course, she was about the only one who thought that way.","No one knew how Feng Wu did it. By the time they saw what had happened, her hand was already on the hilt of Dongfang Ziyun’s sword.","Dongfang Ziyun was petrified.","She thought she could easily defeat Feng Wu, but the latter had suppressed her.","Zhu Hongyu was shocked.","He cried out, “Stop!”","But it was too late.","Feng Wu swiped the blade across Dongfang Ziyun’s throat.","It almost looked like Dongfang Ziyun cut her own neck open.","“Shit!”","“No!”","“Stop!”","Feng Wu moved away, and a mist of blood came out of Dongfang Ziyun’s throat.","Everybody stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","How incredible!","That girl was the only Supreme Level medicine refiner in the fortress!","Zhu Hongyu was so frightened that he thought his heart would stop.","He rushed to Dongfang Ziyun’s side and held her in his arms. “Ziyun! Ziyun! Are you alright?!”","Blood kept coming out of her neck, and it was a terrifying scene.","Zhu Hongyu glared at Feng Wu. “Have you lost your mind?!","“Don’t you know she’s the only Supreme Level medicine refiner in the fortress!","“She’s Elder Dongfang’s niece!","“If anything happens to her, you’re dead!","“You’re still dead even if she’s alright!”","Zhu Hongyu carried Dongfang Ziyun away after threatening Feng Wu."]},{"number":3104,"title":"Chapter 3104 It’s Her","paragraphs":["3104 It’s Her","Everybody fell silent because they were still in shock.","“You – you...”","The warden, Sun Yu, Chu Qu, the prisoners and Chen Ziyun were all dumbfounded.","Chu Qu tugged at Feng Wu’s sleeve. “Xiao Wu, will Miss Dongfang Ziyun die?”","Feng Wu said, “I don’t know.”","She didn’t know?!","Chu Qu and the others almost lost their strength.","Their faces were so white, and they thought the sky would cave in.","While Zhu Hongyu carried Dongfang Ziyun away, two other men arrived.","The warden cried out, “Lord Dai! Lord Mo!”","They were the highest-ranking officials of this prison.","Lord Dai was from the Military Academy, and Lord Mo was from Imperial College. They were both Spiritual Overlords and about the same level as Elder Wu.","They came as fast as they could but were still a little too late.","They ran into Zhu Hongyu with Dongfang Ziyun in his arms.","“You...” Lord Dai immediately saw the bleeding girl.","Blood was splattered all over Zhu Hongyu’s chest and face, and the girl’s face was almost covered with blood.","However, Lord Dai still recognized Dongfang Ziyun.","“Miss Dongfang?!”","Lord Dai couldn’t believe his eyes.","Hardly anything could shake him this way.","She was Elder Dongfang’s favorite niece and a necessary member of the Military Academy if they wanted to defeat Imperial College.","The Military Academy had a Supreme Level medicine refiner, but Imperial College didn’t. Therefore, the latter had to get their medicine from the Military Academy and felt rather inferior.","However, their important member had just been...","“What happened?!” Lord Dai bellowed.","Everybody jumped.","Sun Yu and Chu Qu looked at each other in terror.","Holy crap!","Oh god...","Lord Dai was nicknamed “Tiger.” He was as short-tempered as he was ruthless. Xiao Wu had offended the wrong man.","The warden was from the Military Academy, and Feng Wu had just beaten him up. Naturally, he wouldn’t speak up for her.","“It’s her! It’s her!” He pointed at Feng Wu. “She killed Miss Dongfang!”","Kill?!","The word made Lord Dai’s stomach lurch.","He frowned and turned to glare at Feng Wu.","“You?”","Zhu Hongyu also nodded. “Yes, it’s her!”","There was nothing more to say.","Lord Dai reached for Feng Wu.","“Stop!”","Lord Mo stepped out and stopped Lord Dai’s attack.","Everybody was shocked.","The warden, Feng Wu’s friends, and even the prisoners couldn’t believe their eyes.","Th – this...","Were the two officials fighting each other?","Lord Dai glowered at Lord Mo. “Out of my way!”"]},{"number":3105,"title":"Chapter 3105 Under His Armpit","paragraphs":["3105 Under His Armpit","Lord Mo noticed that the fingers on Lord Dai’s right hand were crooked like an eagle’s claw.","If he attacked Feng Wu, she wouldn’t stand a chance.","Had Lord Mo met Feng Wu before?","He had.","He had seen her only a few hours before in the Dayless Woods.","Elder Helian had gathered a group of elders to rescue Feng Wu, but instead of doing that, they only saw how intimate the crown prince and Feng Wu seemed.","Lord Dai hadn’t been there because the Military Academy only sent Elder Dongfang and Dongfang Ziyun.","After they returned to the fortress, Elder Helian told them never to mess with Feng Wu. Not only that, they had to respect her as much as they could.","As for the reason... Lord Mo knew it was because of the relationship between Feng Wu and His Royal Highness.","He didn’t like the arrangement, but had to protect her anyway.","He felt rather conflicted, yet he still stood between Lord Dai and Feng Wu.","Lord Dai stared at him. “Are you going to keep doing this?”","Lord Mo said, “I have to.”","He then added, “Feng Wu is with His Royal Highness. Even if she made a mistake, only His Royal Highness can discipline her. We don’t have that right.”","Of course, Lord Dai wouldn’t believe him.","“If you won’t get out of my way, fight me!”","Lord Dai charged at Lord Mo, and the latter had to react.","In a matter of seconds, they exchanged hundreds of blows.","No one dared to stay close, and they kept moving away from them.","The poor prisoners had nowhere to hide, and the wind kicked up by the battle nearly shaved them bald.","Lord Dai and Lord Mo were roughly on the same level, and their battle reached an impasse.","Feng Wu kept her eyes on them and soon noticed that when Lord Dai fought, his spiritual essence would slow down a little when it flowed past a point about 10cm below his armpit.","It was very slight.","Even Lord Mo hadn’t realized it, but Feng Wu had.","She told Lord Mo, “Punch him in the spot 10cm below his armpit.”","Lord Mo wouldn’t listen to her.","He only saw Feng Wu as a girl whom the crown prince favored. What could she possibly know?","But Lord Dai didn’t see it that way.","Feng Wu’s words were like a thunderclap in his ears.","How could she know where his weakness was?","Who was she? Who told her that?","Lord Dai involuntarily tried to shield the spot that Feng Wu mentioned.","It was too deliberate to ignore.","Lord Mo found it odd.","Did Lord Dai just dodge the attack?","That was to say...","Lord Dai picked up his speed and tried to end this battle before anything else went wrong.","However, his behavior revealed his plan.","Lord Mo immediately saw through his actions.","The spot 10cm below Lord Dai’s left armpit was indeed his weak spot.","No matter how Feng Wu had learned that, once that was revealed, Lord Dai became less intimidating.","When he tried to cover that spot, his other parts became more vulnerable."]},{"number":3106,"title":"Chapter 3106 - Self-Defense","paragraphs":["3106 Self-Defense","Feng Wu!","Lord Mo glanced at Feng Wu again, amazed by her ability.","Still, the most important thing right now was to defeat Lord Dai before he injured Feng Wu.","At that thought, Lord Mo moved faster.","Before long, he took Lord Dai by surprise.","Thump!","Lord Mo punched Lord Dai 10cm under his armpit.","The punch wouldn’t have made much impact if it hadn’t landed on that spot.","“Ah!”","Lord Dai cried out in pain, and his face drained of all color.","Putting a hand over that spot, he bent over and couldn’t stand straight.","With Feng Wu still behind him, Lord Mo kept his cold gaze on Lord Dai, in case the latter tried to jump at Feng Wu.","Lord Dai waved his hand, indicating that the fight was over.","It was too painful.","The two schools had always competed against each other, but they never wanted to destroy the other side.","Lord Mo stopped attacking Lord Dai right away.","Lord Dai adjusted his breathing to ease the pain, and he gave Feng Wu a bewildered look. How did the girl know about his weak spot?","Feng Wu seemed to read his mind, so she smiled at him. “That’s because I’m a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.”","Semi-Divine medicine refiners were like gods in the field, and they only needed to glance at somebody to know what was wrong with them. To ordinary people, they were as good as fairies that could bring people back from the dead.","Everybody was dumbfounded when Feng Wu said that.","They didn’t know what to say.","Somebody mumbled, “Will she ever stop bragging?”","Everybody nodded.","That was right!","They would sing her praises if she said she was a Supreme Level medicine refiner, but a Semi-Divine one was simply over the top!","Lord Dai was so frustrated that he couldn’t speak a word.","He almost couldn’t contain the rage in his chest.","He could spit fire with his eyes.","Lord Dai pointed at Dongfang Ziyun, who was still lying in Zhu Hongyu’s arms. “What about this? Did you kill her?!”","Feng Wu said, “Watch your language. She wanted to kill me, and what I did was self-defense.”","Lord Dai snorted and asked the warden, “Is that true?”","The warden shook his head. “No!”","Lord Dai glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu shrugged. “What weapon did I use?”","The warden didn’t know how to answer that question.","Everybody looked at the ground where the soft-bladed sword lay.","Dongfang Ziyun had wrapped it around her waist as her belt and would draw it out when needed. It had the Dongfang family emblem on it and was easy to spot.","“That’s Miss Dongfang’s weapon,” the warden said hesitantly.","Lord Dai suddenly had a bad feeling.","Feng Wu put her hands behind her back, feeling completely at ease.","She glanced at the warden and smiled. “Who drew the weapon first? Warden, so many people were watching. You must tell the truth.”","The warden had wanted to make something up, but he paled when he looked around."]},{"number":3107,"title":"Chapter 3107 She’ll Define Herself","paragraphs":["3107 She’ll Define Herself","The warden gave up on that idea when he realized who was watching him.","Apart from the people of the two schools, there were also the prisoners.","He had treated these people rather badly, and they would never help him with his lie.","Feng Wu couldn’t have picked a better spot.","He almost felt that she had chosen this place on purpose.","Seeing the look in Lord Dai’s eyes, the warden said, “Miss Dongfang attacked first.”","Lord Dai’s face darkened.","Feng Wu said unhurriedly, “Why did Miss Dongfang want to kill me?”","The warden said, “Because you were instigating a jailbreak!”","Feng Wu smiled at him. “Was I?”","She explained the definition to the others.","“What is a jailbreak?","“It refers to breaking prisoners out of jail through violent means.”","Feng Wu asked Lord Dai, “Did I do that?”","The warden gritted his teeth. “You stole my keys.”","Feng Wu laughed. “You’re the warden. Isn’t it your responsibility to guard the keys?”","The warden blushed.","Lord Dai stared at Feng Wu. “You didn’t, but you were going to and almost made it! Are you going to deny that?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes, I am.”","Somebody snickered, but it was soon muffled.","Lord Dai stared at Feng Wu. “Why is that?”","Feng Wu glanced at the warden. “Do you remember the definition? Repeat it for me.”","The warden involuntarily followed the order. “It refers to breaking prisoners out of jail through violent means.”","He then realized it was Feng Wu who had given him the order.","Feng Wu nodded. “Lord Dai, even the warden knows the answer. Why don’t you?”","Lord Dai stared at Feng Wu and waited for her to explain further.","The others looked at her as well.","She was like the sun, and no one could ignore the radiance she gave off.","Lord Mo’s opinion of her began to change.","When Elder Helian had gathered the elders to rescue some random girl who was trapped in the Dayless Woods because of her own reckless actions, Lord Mo had disliked the girl for it.","However, he had to follow the order.","In the Dayless Woods, she clung to His Royal Highness and wouldn’t let go. Lord Mo found it highly inappropriate.","When he saw how severely Feng Wu had injured Dongfang Ziyun, he felt he had had enough of the girl.","However, what happened after that completely changed his mind.","She was smart, far-sighted and unperturbed. Lord Mo’s opinion of her had certainly changed.","Could there be something special about her?","Therefore, Lord Mo still had some doubts about Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was smiling at Lord Dai, a man who outranked her by far.","She didn’t know what Lord Mo thought of her, but she had never found it necessary to explain herself.","She would define herself."]},{"number":3108,"title":"Chapter 3108 Sharp Tongue","paragraphs":["3108 Sharp Tongue","Feng Wu kept her gaze on Lord Dai. “It refers to breaking prisoners out of jail through violent means. Prisoners. Remember that word.”","She then gestured at Chu Qu to set Chen Ziyun free.","Chu Qu wondered if Lord Dai would kill him for it, but he still followed Feng Wu’s order.","He helped Chen Ziyun out of his cell.","Chen Ziyun was clever enough to see what was going on.","He immediately put on a show, making his injuries seem much more severe than they really were.","As soon as Chu Qu put his arm around Chen Ziyun, he fell onto Chu Qu.","Chu Qu shouted, “Captain Chen! Captain Chen! Are you alright?!”","Chen Ziyun clung to Chu Qu, who half-dragged him out of the cell.","There were obvious whip marks on Chen Ziyun’s clothes, and the bloodstains were quite astonishing.","Feng Wu had given him a Supreme Level Golden Crow pill, so he wasn’t all that severely injured, but he certainly looked the part.","Feng Wu was furious.","Lord Dai said, “He just came out of a jail cell. Doesn’t that make him a prisoner?”","Feng Wu laughed. “He’s locked up, so he’s a prisoner. Lord Dai, as the leading official of this jail, you aren’t very smart.”","Lord Dai was embarrassed.","If Lord Mo hadn’t injured him, he wouldn’t have let her say such things.","He held back his rage because he wasn’t Lord Mo’s match now.","Feng Wu smirked. “Since you’ve called Chen Ziyun a prisoner, warden, please tell us what a prisoner is.”","The warden panicked and glanced at Lord Dai.","Lord Dai glared at him. “Speak!”","Feng Wu chuckled.","Some people refused to be sensible unless they were forced to.","Lord Dai was just like that. He was forced to reason with Feng Wu.","The warden had to explain what a prisoner was. “A prisoner is someone who is serving a sentence in prison because they’ve broken the law.”","Feng Wu said. “Good. Tell me. What law did my friend break? What was his sentence? Why is he serving it? Why was he whipped? Speak!”","The warden shuddered and looked into the distance.","Zhu Hongyu had carried Dongfang Ziyun away, and no one could help him.","Lord Dai said, “Answer her!”","The warden was speechless.","What was he supposed to say?","Dongfang Ziyun told them to lock the boy up and torture him. However, that couldn’t be openly discussed.","Feng Wu smiled. “What an interesting facility you’ve got here. You can arrest and torture people for no reason. Doesn’t that mean you can drag people here and kill them just because you don’t like them?”","Lord Dai flushed.","“Young lady, it’s not what you think.”","Feng Wu smirked. “It’s not? You’ve done it, haven’t you?”","Lord Dai was speechless. The girl had a sharp tongue."]},{"number":3109,"title":"Chapter 3109 Interrogation","paragraphs":["3109 Interrogation","Lord Dai had to put some pressure on the warden. “If you won’t say anything, let one of your men explain it.”","There were ten men who worked under the warden.","The warden panicked a little because he knew he couldn’t cover for Dongfang Ziyun anymore. She was probably dead anyway, so he didn’t need to worry about her coming after him.","At that thought, the warden said loudly, “It was Miss Dongfang! She put him here!”","Feng Wu asked, “What about his wounds?”","“They’re her doing, too!” The warden said loudly. “She told us to torture and interrogate Chen Ziyun.","“Yes, it was her. She gave the order.”","Feng Wu smiled. “What did you try to get out of him?”","The warden hesitated.","Feng Wu said, “Answer me.”","The warden said, “Miss Dongfang said Chen Ziyun was your minion. We should break his leg just to humiliate you!”","Feng Wu was furious but didn’t let it show. She only smirked. “What crime did Chen Ziyun commit?”","The warden didn’t dare speak a word.","Feng Wu said, “Speak!”","Seeing that Lord Dai had no intention of stopping Feng Wu, the warden had no choice but to say, “Miss Dongfang said Chen Ziyun slandered His Royal Highness.”","Slander?","Feng Wu smiled. “How did he do that?”","The warden cringed a little. “Chen Ziyun said Miss Feng Wu would be the crown prince’s future wife...”","Everybody fell silent, and all eyes were on Feng Wu.","It was a rather tricky accusation.","One could argue either way, and it all depended on how serious it was.","Lord Dai stared at Feng Wu. “Miss Feng Wu, are you the crown prince’s future wife?”","If the answer was yes, then Chen Ziyun hadn’t slandered the crown prince.","If the answer was no, Chen Ziyun hadn’t really been wronged.","Lord Mo rubbed his nose. That was a tricky question. How was the girl supposed to answer it?","“I don’t know if Miss Feng Wu is the crown prince’s future wife, but...”","Lord Mo stepped in. “Lord Dai, you didn’t go to the Dayless Woods last night, did you?”","Lord Dai was looking for an opportunity to scold Feng Wu, and he frowned when he heard Lord Mo’s question.","“Something big happened last night!” someone said from the doorway.","Elder Helian had arrived.","He glanced at Lord Dai. “I gave the order to your Elder Dongfang, but your school didn’t send any elders!”","Lord Dai didn’t want to talk to Elder Helian, but he didn’t have another choice.","He asked, “What order?”","Elder Helian said, “His Royal Highness was confronting Sakiya and told all the elders to be ready for combat. We were supposed to assemble in the center of the Dayless Woods. Didn’t Elder Dongfang tell you?”","Lord Dai’s stomach lurched.","The crown prince had summoned them, but Elder Dongfang withheld that information.","That was a serious matter.","He looked at Lord Mo."]},{"number":3110,"title":"Chapter 3110 Is Miss Dongfang Dead?","paragraphs":["3110 Is Miss Dongfang Dead?","Lord Mo nodded. “All the elders of Imperial College went to the Dayless Woods, but your school only sent Elder Dongfang and Miss Dongfang Ziyun.”","Lord Dai couldn’t understand why Elder Dongfang did that.","Elder Helian said, “Everybody who went there knows how His Royal Highness treated Xiao Wu. They wouldn’t let go of each other!”","Feng Wu blushed.","To further convince the others, Elder Helian snorted. “After we left, they spent the night alone!”","Feng Wu was astonished!","Elder Helian said, “They were holding hands when they returned this morning, and so many people saw them. Ask around, and you’ll know what their relationship is like!”","Elder Helian sounded like he was Feng Wu’s father.","He even asked Feng Wu, “Kiddo, am I right?”","Feng Wu only blushed.","Lord Dai could find out from anyone, so he knew Elder Helian wasn’t lying.","Future wife or not, Feng Wu was involved with the crown prince now.","In that case, Chen Ziyun had done nothing wrong, and Dongfang Ziyun had abused her power.","Lord Dai was troubled, but he wouldn’t let Feng Wu off the hook.","He stared at Feng Wu. “What’s your relationship with His Royal Highness?”","Instantly!","Whoosh!","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","Yes, answer the question.","What was their relationship?","Everybody wanted an answer.","Before, Feng Wu would tell them they were only friends, but she had to save Chen Ziyun.","She hesitated.","She could feel all eyes on her, and she became rather shy.","Lord Dai smirked, waiting for an answer.","Feng Wu said, “Well...”","Lord Dai said, “Let’s change the question, then. Did you say you’re a Semi-Divine medicine refiner?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right!”","Lord Dai said, “Prove it. If you can prove that, I’ll believe that His Royal Highness has feelings for you.”","The others agreed with him. If Feng Wu was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner, anything was possible.","That was easy!","Feng Wu was about to demonstrate her medical skills, when she heard angry footsteps.","They were so loud that the ground shook.","Everybody turned around, angry at the intruder.","However, they didn’t dare say a word when they saw who it was.","It was Elder Dongfang!","Dongfang Ziyun’s aunt!","She was carrying Dongfang Ziyun in her arms.","Elder Helian’s heart sank.","D*mn it!","Was Dongfang Ziyun dead?"]},{"number":3111,"title":"Chapter 3111 Grandma Dongfang?!","paragraphs":["3111 Grandma Dongfang?!","Elder Helian’s heart sank a little, and he wondered if Dongfang Ziyun really was dead.","If that were the case, they would have a much bigger problem.","At that thought, Elder Helian stepped forward and shielded Feng Wu from Elder Dongfang’s gaze.","Elder Dongfang glared at him like she would burn a hole in him.","“Out of my way!” Elder Dongfang bellowed.","“Can’t do that,” said Elder Helian.","Elder Dongfang put Dongfang Ziyun in Zhu Hongyu”s arms. She then pushed Elder Helian out of her way.","Elder Helian panicked a little.","Xiao Wu was a treasure, both to the crown prince and to Imperial College. He couldn’t allow anything to happen to her.","He reached out and dragged Feng Wu closer, letting her stand behind him.","Elder Dongfang ground her teeth. “Feng Wu, look what you’ve done!”","Feng Wu asked innocently, “What did I do?”","Elder Dongfang glared at her and took a deep breath. She had to control her rage, or Dongfang Ziyun would die.","“You almost killed her!” Elder Dongfang stared at Feng Wu. “Do you deny that?”","Feng Wu seemed surprised. “You should get your facts straight. I was only defending myself, and all these people can testify to that. I’ll sue you if you keep slandering me.”","Elder Dongfang almost spat out a mouthful of blood.","Elder Helian was obviously on Feng Wu’s side.","“Xiao Wu, don’t admit to things you didn’t do. If someone tries to make you say otherwise, I’ll fight to the death for you. Don’t worry. Even if I’m dead, His Royal Highness will protect you. You’re his treasure!”","Feng Wu blushed but didn’t say anything.","However, those words affected Elder Dongfang.","She had tried to intimidate Feng Wu with her power, but now, she realized Feng Wu had the crown prince behind her.","So many people saw what happened in the Dayless Woods, and word would soon get out.","Lord Dai looked at Elder Dongfang, hoping to hear her deny it since she had been to the Dayless Woods.","However, Elder Dongfang never said a word.","Lord Dai’s heart sank.","That was to say. Elder Helian was right, and Feng Wu really was the crown prince’s treasure.","That was...","Elder Dongfang tried to reason with Feng Wu. “Alright. We’ll forget about your crime for the time being. Self-defense or not, you have to admit you inflicted that wound on Ziyun’s neck, don’t you?”","“Hey, Grandma, don’t make things up. I didn’t do anything!” Feng Wu retorted.","Elder Dongfang thought she would stop breathing.","Why was the girl so frustrating?","What was the matter with the crown prince? Why didn’t he favor a nice girl like Ziyun?","Elder Dongfang took a few deep breaths to control her rage.","However, her cheeks still trembled with her anger.","“Fine. You don’t need to take responsibility. Help Ziyun now.” That was Elder Dongfang’s real objective."]},{"number":3112,"title":"Chapter 3112 Please Help Her","paragraphs":["3112 Please Help Her","“Help her?”","Feng Wu gave Elder Dongfang an amazed look. “Me? Save her?”","The other people around them were equally baffled.","That didn’t seem right.","Elder Dongfang stared at Feng Wu and said coldly, “Yes! You have to save her!”","Feng Wu shook her head. “I don’t think that’ll happen.”","Elder Dongfang glared at her. “Are you going to watch her die?!”","Feng Wu said, “Of course not, but isn’t Miss Dongfang the only Supreme Level medicine refiner in the fortress?”","Those words sent Elder Dongfang’s rage to a new level.","To make it worse, the others all agreed with Feng Wu.","Lord Dai said, “What can Feng Wu possibly do?”","The others nodded.","If Elder Helian had a tail, he would be wagging it nonstop.","The more time he spent with Feng Wu, the more adorable he found her.","Elder Dongfang had always been such a proud woman, but now...","He couldn’t imagine seeing her like this.","Elder Dongfang had never been so embarrassed before.","To save her niece, she had to put her pride aside.","She stared at Feng Wu. “What will it take to let you treat her?”","Feng Wu said, “But I don’t know anything...”","Elder Dongfang said, “Cut it out! You’re a Semi-Divine medicine refiner, and no one can change that!”","Everybody stared at Elder Dongfang in astonishment.","A Semi-Divine medicine refiner?","Feng Wu?!","Wasn’t she only thirteen or fourteen?","She hadn’t graduated yet!","Had Elder Dongfang lost her mind?","Elder Helian was thrilled to hear that, but Lord Dai wasn’t all that happy.","Only moments ago, he had asked Feng Wu to prove she was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner, but Elder Dongfang had just done it for her.","“That can’t be true...” said Lord Dai.","“Yes, it can!” Elder Dongfang glared at Lord Dai. “I was there when she made the Semi-Divine potion. Not a pill, but a potion! Do you know what that means?!”","Elder Dongfang ignored the ghastly pale Lord Dai and stared at Feng Wu. “Do you deny you’re a Semi-Divine medicine refiner?!”","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","Feng Wu’s friends were especially shocked.","They almost forgot to blink.","D*mn!","If that was true, they had just made a very powerful ally!","They thought they were going to faint.","Everybody watched Feng Wu, waiting for a reply.","Feng Wu sighed and turned to Elder Dongfang. “You’re an elder on the same level as Elder Helian. Do you see how well-behaved Elder Helian’s students are? As for yours...”"]},{"number":3113,"title":"Chapter 3113 200,000?","paragraphs":["3113 200,000?","Elder Dongfang was told off!","Feng Wu had scolded the most senior elder of the Military Academy.","The old lady outranked her by far!","The grumpy Elder Dongfang had to fight back her rage and beg Feng Wu for help. However, her tone didn’t soften at all.","“Feng Wu, are you going to help her or not?!”","She even threatened Feng Wu. “If you refuse, I’ll go to the school masters! I’ll even go to the general! You won’t sound so righteous then!”","Feng Wu found those words idiotic.","She thought, Does she know the general is my godfather?","I even have a note from His Majesty.","Grandma, do you think you’re better connected than me?","However, when she saw Dongfang Ziyun and her bloody neck, she felt sorry for the girl.","At the end of the day, Feng Wu was too kind to watch somebody die in front of her.","She glanced at Elder Dongfang. “I guess I can help her.”","“Do it now!” Elder Dongfang urged her.","Feng Wu shrugged.","Elder Dongfang asked, “What?”","Feng Wu said, “Pay up.”","Elder Dongfang said, “What?!”","Feng Wu said, “Do you think you can use the services of a Semi-Divine medicine refiner for free? I’m not that kind.”","Asking to be paid for one’s service was the most natural thing.","Elder Dongfang didn’t expect to hear that from Feng Wu.","“You don’t sound like a student of Imperial College at all!” Elder Dongfang glared at Feng Wu. “Doesn’t your school see money as the most worthless thing?!”","What?!","Feng Wu stared at Elder Helian.","Elder Helian rubbed his nose.","He glared at Elder Dongfang.","Why did she have to bring that up?","Feng Wu found Elder Helian’s demeanor rather frustrating.","Money was the most worthless thing? Without money, how could the school support itself?","Feng Wu dragged Elder Helian to the side and lowered her voice. “How many mines do we have? What about the Military Academy?”","Elder Helian asked, “How do you know we have mines?”","Feng Wu glared at him. “Don’t beat around the bush!”","Elder Helian smiled wryly even as he told the truth. “They have four, while we have a very old one...”","Feng Wu stared at him as if he was an idiot.","Elder Helian stammered, “They’ve been luckier than us.”","Feng Wu ignored Elder Helian and walked up to Elder Dongfang, sticking out two fingers.","Elder Dongfang frowned. “20,000 essence crystals?”","Feng Wu grinned.","Elder Dongfang asked, “200,000?”","She frowned a little.","Everybody was shocked.","Holy crap!","Feng Wu had asked for an exorbitant price!","It would cost Elder Dongfang a fortune this time!","200,000 essence crystals!","Sun Yu and Chu Qu were almost in tears.","When they explored the outer layer, they would consider themselves very lucky if they found one or two essence crystals on one trip. Xiao Wu had just asked for 200,000.","200,000 essence crystals!"]},{"number":3114,"title":"Chapter 3114 Two Mines","paragraphs":["3114 Two Mines","200,000 essence crystals!","Chu Qu and Sun Yu wanted to embrace each other and cheer loudly.","Being students of Imperial College, they knew how poor their school was.","Each essence crystal meant a lot to them.","The Military Academy was much wealthier, and they had always envied them.","Elder Helian was even more excited than they were.","As an elder of the school, he knew their financial situation. The school barely had enough money to give out rewards.","The rewards in the exchange center came from the Junwu Empire.","Both schools had their own properties, such as the mines.","The Military Academy had four mines of various sizes, which was where their elders and students cultivated.","Those mines helped students to graduate faster so that they could go to the middle ring to look for essence crystals. It was a very efficient arrangement.","Without such resources, Imperial College was impoverished.","When Feng Wu stuck out two fingers, Elder Helian was thrilled.","What a clever girl!","Elder Dongfang glared at Feng Wu.","She ground her teeth. “200,000?!”","200,000 essence crystals?!","Sun Yu and the others nearly screamed.","But to their surprise, Feng Wu shook her head.","Why?","Was it 200,000?","Was it 20,000?","Sun Yu and the others were disappointed.","Elder Dongfang smirked.","She was right!","Feng Wu’s arrogance was only for show. She wouldn’t dare go to the general!","Elder Dongfang couldn’t be any more wrong.","Feng Wu spoke again.","“200,000 essence crystals? Who told you that was what I wanted?” Feng Wu said in amazement.","Elder Dongfang gritted her teeth. “Then why did you stick out two fingers?”","Feng Wu said, “I’m talking about essence crystal mines.”","Her voice was loud enough for everybody to hear.","Everyone sucked in their breaths.","“What?! What did Feng Wu say?”","“Essence crystal mines? Did she say mine? I’m not deaf, am I?”","“Yes, she said mines!”","Immediately, everyone gave Feng Wu strange looks.","Elder Helian was astonished.","Elder Dongfang’s face went ghastly pale, and she couldn’t utter a word.","The prisoners thought they were dreaming.","Feng Wu crossed her arms with a calm smile on her face.","“It hurts...”","Dongfang Ziyun was still in Zhu Hongyu’s arms.","Her bleeding hadn’t stopped. If she wasn’t treated, she would eventually bleed out.","Elder Dongfang glared at Feng Wu. “What did you say?!”","Feng Wu shrugged.","Elder Dongfang ground her teeth. “There’s no way I’ll agree to that!”","Feng Wu said indifferently, “I see.”","Elder Dongfang said, “Ask for something else!”"]},{"number":3115,"title":"Chapter 3115 The Most Important Thing","paragraphs":["3115 The Most Important Thing","Feng Wu said succinctly, “Not going to happen.”","Elder Dongfang ground her teeth. “Feng Wu, do you know what you’re talking about?”","Feng Wu said, “I know.”","Elder Dongfang looked like her eyes were going to bleed. “Aren’t you afraid of the general hearing about this?”","Feng Wu shrugged. “Do you think you have a better patron than I do?”","Elder Dongfang was speechless.","She never thought Feng Wu would mention her patron in public.","Feng Wu was referring to the general, her godfather, but Elder Dongfang thought she was referring to the crown prince.","Of course, the old lady had no such patron, and she was so frustrated.","Elder Dongfang said, “I can give you 200,000 essence crystals.”","Holy crap!","She really had that many essence crystals?","Sun Yu and the others stared at Feng Wu in excitement.","So did Elder Helian.","He wanted to tell Feng Wu that 200,000 essence crystals were enough, and she should know when to stop.","However, Feng Wu’s demeanor was so intimidating that no one dared move closer.","Even Elder Dongfang was dwarfed in comparison.","She had never felt so frustrated before.","However, Feng Wu shook her head. “200,000 essence crystals? Is that how cheap Dongfang Ziyun’s life is?”","If Dongfang Ziyun were lucid now, she would have been furious.","Elder Dongfang glared at Feng Wu. “I’ll never give you two mines!”","Feng Wu said, “I see.”","Elder Dongfang took a few deep breaths.","She felt both angry and helpless.","Just then, Zhu Hongyu cried out, “Ziyun! Ziyun! Are you alright? Ziyun!”","Somehow, Dongfang Ziyun was convulsing, and white foam gathered around her mouth.","Feng Wu glanced at her and sighed. “I see you’re going to miss out on the last chance to save her.”","Elder Dongfang said, “Are you still not going to help her?!”","Feng Wu sighed. “I’m a Semi-Divine medicine refiner. I have my price.”","Elder Dongfang fought back her rage. “One mine! I won’t give you anything else!”","One mine?!","The crowd went wild.","Sun Yu and his friends couldn’t begin to imagine how many essence crystals there were in a mine.","They only knew that the school was going to be rich.","Elder Helian was the one who knew how many essence crystals they could get out of a mine.","That was why he was stunned.","Imperial College had tried everything but couldn’t obtain a mine.","However, Feng Wu had just gotten them a new one all on her own.","Were essence crystals the most important thing in a mine? No.","A mine was important because it could benefit one’s cultivation.","The effect of cultivating inside a mine was quite different from cultivating outside.","Inside a mine, one could make twice the progress in half the time.","As for Elder Dongfang...","Everybody from the Military Academy stared at her in astonishment.","The mines belonged to the school. They weren’t Elder Dongfang’s personal property. How could she give one away?","That wouldn’t be allowed.","But the situation was quite unique at the moment.","However, Feng Wu looked at Elder Dongfang."]},{"number":3116,"title":"Chapter 3116 Semi-Divine Medicine Refiner","paragraphs":["3116 Semi-Divine Medicine Refiner","Feng Wu frowned. “One mine? I don’t think that’s enough.”","Elder Helian was almost in tears. He wanted to grab her arm and tell her it was enough. One mine would be more than enough.","Meanwhile, Lord Dai stepped out. “Elder Dongfang, how can we give a mine away? That doesn’t sound appropriate.”","Elder Dongfang ignored them and only stared at Feng Wu. “One mine. If you accept it, I’ll give it to you. If not, just let Dongfang Zi Ling die. After that, the Military Academy will bear Imperial College an irreconcilable grudge, and my sect won’t stop until the Feng family is destroyed!”","Feng Wu smiled at her. “Are you threatening me now?”","Elder Dongfang said calmly, “No, I’m begging you.”","Elder Helian tugged at Feng Wu’s sleeve and whispered, “Kiddo, you should take the offer while you can. Dongfang can’t give us two mines. Her school will kill her for that.”","If the Military Academy fired Elder Dongfang for that, the Imperial College wouldn’t get anything.","After all, the mines weren’t Elder Dongfang’s personal property.","Feng Wu felt a little sorry, but one mine was already a sweet deal.","She said, “Fine. One mine, then. Elder Helian, you should seal the deal now.”","Elder Dongfang stared at her. “Save my niece first.”","Feng Wu said, “I’ll do it while you hand over the mine.”","She would be doing it for nothing if Elder Dongfang went back on her word after Dongfang Ziyun was saved.","Elder Dongfang was furious, but when she saw that Dongfang Ziyun was barely breathing, she had no choice but to seal the deal now.","Lord Dai tried to intervene, but he didn’t say anything in the end when he saw the state Dongfang Ziyun was in.","He knew that if he opposed the idea and Dongfang Ziyun died, Elder Dongfang would blame everything on him, and he didn’t want to take that responsibility.","Therefore, Lord Dai gestured at a guard to sneak out and deliver the message to the other elders.","The elders were the most frequent users of the mines; only a handful of the most outstanding graduates could cultivate there.","Feng Wu walked up to Dongfang Ziyun.","Zhu Hongyu glared at Feng Wu, but Feng Wu didn’t even look at him.","She took out an ointment and asked Zhu Hongyu to put it on the wound on Dongfang’s neck.","Once that was done, Zhu Hongyu asked, “What’s next?”","Feng Wu asked, “What do you mean?”","Zhu Hongyu frowned. “How should we treat her next?”","Feng Wu glanced at Elder Dongfang and saw that she was still in the middle of sealing the deal, so she sat down and said indifferently, “Just wait.”","Zhu Hongyu said angrily, “Is that how a Semi-Divine medicine refiner should behave? Don’t you know the importance of saving lives?”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “I see you know I’m a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.”","Zhu Hongyu was speechless."]},{"number":3117,"title":"Chapter 3117 Where Did He Go?","paragraphs":["3117 Where Did He Go?","If Feng Wu were an elderly Semi-divine medicine refiner, Zhu Hongyu would worship her as if she were an immortal being. He would probably kneel at her feet. However, Feng Wu was only a teenager.","Zhu Hongyu couldn’t help but see her as an ordinary girl and forget who she really was.","He had no choice but to fight back his frustration.","Before long, Elder Helian came back to Feng Wu, holding some paperwork. He said excitedly, “Xiao Wu, look!”","!!","Feng Wu spotted it right away, but when she saw how thrilled Elder Helian was, she snapped at him. “Have you sealed the deal?”","“Yes! It’s done! Mine No. 3 is ours!” said Elder Helian. “I know it’s the worst of the four mines, but...”","Feng Wu asked, “What? You accepted the worst mine?”","Elder Helian said, “Well...”","Feng Wu checked the paperwork and saw that the mine really was the worst one. She rolled her eyes at Elder Helian.","She said, “I see money indeed means very little to you.”","Elder Helian blushed, but he hadn’t been able to bring himself to ask for more.","He felt they didn’t deserve that mine because he felt that Feng Wu had inflicted that wound on Dongfang.","Feng Wu said, “You can forget your guilt. Do you see Dongfang’s symptoms? Does she look like she’s been poisoned?”","“Yes, she does!” Elder Helian nodded.","Feng Wu said, “That sword belongs to Dongfang Ziyun herself.”","That meant...","“What?!” Elder Helian cried out. “She put poison on her blade! She wanted to kill you!”","Feng Wu nodded. “It doesn’t take much for a Supreme Level medicine refiner to neutralize the poison.”","Elder Helian lost his temper. “She tried to poison you, and you’re still helping her? D*mn it! If I had known, I would never have let her off the hook so easily!”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him again. “It’s not over yet. After she recovers, she’ll try her best to kill me.”","Elder Helian said, “She wouldn’t dare!”","Feng Wu said, “She’ll never stop trying until she’s dead. Ask Elder Dongfang. She’ll tell you what her niece is like.”","Elder Helian looked at Elder Dongfang.","Elder Dongfang acted as if she didn’t know anything.","Elder Helian bellowed, “If she’s like that, we don’t need to help her at all!”","Feng Wu said, “We need the mine, don’t we? Don’t worry. If she attacks me again, I’ll beat her until she’s barely alive, and we’ll have another mine. She’ll be like our renewable energy source.”","Elder Helian immediately calmed down.","He almost felt sorry for Elder Dongfang.","Elder Dongfang’s face darkened.","Her cold glare landed on Feng Wu.","She could hear the treat in Feng Wu’s tone.","If Dongfang Ziyun offended Feng Wu again, Feng Wu would definitely carry out her word.","How frustrating!","Feng Wu reminded Elder Helian, “There’s no time to get angry now. You should start working now.”","Elder Helian carefully rolled up the paper and put it in his sleeve. “What work?”","Feng Wu sighed. “Don’t you realize Lord Dai has slipped away? Where do you think he’s going?”","Where did he go?"]},{"number":3118,"title":"Chapter 3118 Guard Mine No. 3","paragraphs":["3118 Guard Mine No. 3","At first, Elder Helian didn’t know what Feng Wu was talking about, but Lord Mo did.","He and Lord Dai had worked together for many years and knew each other only too well.","“He didn’t go to Mine No.3, did he?!”","Elder Helian’s heart sank when he heard what Lord Mo said.","He looked over his shoulder in astonishment.","Feng Wu looked him in the eye and nodded.","Elder Helian wondered how the girl knew so much.","Feng Wu added, “If they remove the essence crystals from the mine in advance...”","“They can’t do that!”","Elder Helian shouted.","Elder Dongfang narrowed her eyes.","That was indeed her plan.","She had communicated with Lord Dai by exchanging a few looks, but somehow, this girl had guessed it.","How did she know that?!","How could she know what the Military Academy wanted to do?","Feng Wu smirked. “I know how malicious people can be.”","Meanwhile, Elder Helian had already dashed off.","Lord Mo also went to get the other elders.","They had to guard their mine!","Mine No. 3 belonged to Imperial College now!","Feng Wu’s reminder had been timely, because when Elder Helian arrived at the mine, the Military Academy was trying to move things out.","Elder Helian was furious.","Elder Dongfang was so cunning!","He didn’t want to take too much from the Military Academy and had chosen the worst mine, but this was how they repaid him!","He charged at them and took out the paperwork. “Nobody touches a thing!”","The elders of Imperial College gradually arrived.","They were all dumbfounded, including Elder Wu.","They had just come back from the Dayless Woods and were going to cultivate, when they received the order to guard Mine No. 3.","Wasn’t that the Military Academy’s mine? Why should they guard it?","They were shocked by what they saw.","Holy crap!","Since when was it Imperial College’s mine?","Were they dreaming?","Mine No. 3 had been discovered a long time ago and was located to the southwest of the fortress.","The Military Academy had used it to help so many capable members!","As a result, they had 10,000 more Spiritual Overlords than Imperial College.","The elders of the Imperial College had been so envious.","But now, Mine No. 3 belonged to Imperial College!","Was this really happening?","Lord Mo told them that Feng Wu had won it from Elder Dongfang.","Wait —","They had only heard of Feng Wu’s name for the first time the night before.","Wasn’t she the crown prince’s little mistress?","Didn’t he keep her around like a pet?","How did she win a mine?","At first, the elders thought Feng Wu had won the crown prince’s heart because of her pretty face, and didn’t like her at all.","But things had changed now.","Lord Mo saw how dumbfounded the elders were. Moreover, only Elder Wu seemed to have a good impression on Feng Wu."]},{"number":3119,"title":"Chapter 3119 The Sack","paragraphs":["3119 The Sack","That wouldn’t do!","The girl had made great contributions to Imperial College.","Lord Mo had only briefly described what happened at first, but now, he told the others in detail how Feng Wu had outwitted Elder Dongfang until the old lady almost had a stroke.","The others were dumbfounded.","Even Elder Wu, who knew Feng Wu well, couldn’t believe what he heard.","They had obtained a new mine just like that.","Feng Wu made it seem too easy.","It almost felt like a dream.","They weren’t alone. The elders of the Military Academy were also shocked.","Lord Mo’s words were for elders on both sides.","Why?","Obviously, he wanted to show off.","“Do you see the new student of my school? She’s amazing! Do you have anyone as good as she is? Do you?”","The elders of the Military Academy were speechless.","They didn’t want to accept the reality.","The news was hard to swallow.","With the paperwork, there was nothing they could do. If anything, they still had some dignity left.","They would never forget Feng Wu’s name again.","“Elder Gu, Elder Wu, Elder Yue, please get up.” Lord Mo smiled at the three elders of the Military Academy as he asked them to leave.","The three unfortunate elders were scheduled to cultivate here today and had been in the middle of their cultivation when the mine suddenly became Imperial College’s. They didn’t know how to vent their frustration.","“If you want an explanation, I suggest you go to your Elder Dongfang,” said Elder Helian with a smile.","What else could they say?","They had to leave in frustration, and went to talk to Elder Dongfang.","Elder Wu said, “I think Miss Dongfang will be in a lot of trouble.”","Lord Mo rubbed his chin and smiled. “I wonder if Miss Dongfang will know when to stop.”","If she wouldn’t stop and kept making trouble, Feng Wu would probably profit from it again. They couldn’t wait to see that happen.","The event of guarding Mine No.3 was kept among the elders, and the Spiritual Kings hadn’t heard about it yet.","After the elders left the prison, Feng Wu was ready to leave, too.","Elder Dongfang said coldly,","“Feng Wu, you really are a piece of work.” Her tone was threatening.","Feng Wu wouldn’t give her what she wanted.","She stopped and smiled at Elder Dongfang. “Are you threatening the only Semi-Divine medicine refiner in the fortress and even the entire empire?”","Elder Dongfang was speechless.","She thought she was going to have a heart attack.","No one could change the fact that Feng Wu was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","Feng Wu and her friends were ready to leave.","A thought struck Feng Wu, and she told Chu Qu, “Don’t forget to bring that along.”","Chu Qu was still excited.","All he could think of was the mine, and when he heard Feng Wu, he asked in confusion, “What do you mean?”","“The sack!” Feng Wu reminded him.","Chu Qu had grown tired from standing, so he sat down on the sack. Did he realize what he was sitting on?"]},{"number":3120,"title":"Chapter 3120 Military Badges","paragraphs":["3120 Military Badges","Chu Qu pouted.","He couldn’t understand why he had to carry the big sack around.","However, he remembered Feng Wu said the sack contained some presents for them.","What could they possibly be?","!!","When he sat on the sack, he didn’t think it contained anything important.","However, Feng Wu had said so, and he would carry the sack.","Chu Qu threw the sack over his shoulder and asked, “Boss, where are we going now?”","The others all looked at her.","Where should they go next?","They didn’t seem to have a specific destination.","Feng Wu smiled. “The exchange center, obviously.”","She rolled her eyes at Chu Qu and the others. They were still students, so she had to help them graduate and become majors first.","There had been more badges in the sack, but Feng Wu gave some to Feng Xun and Xuan Yi.","Despite their background, Feng Xun and Xuan Yi had to work their way up the military ranks just like everybody else.","They were both commanders, and the badges Feng Wu gave them could help them rise to senior colonels.","Feng Wu had even asked Feng Xun about Jun Linyuan’s rank.","Feng Xun rolled his eyes at her. “Do you think Boss Jun has any difficulty if he wants to kill the Spiritual Saints of the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Feng Wu said, “No.”","Feng Xun asked, “What about Spiritual Overlords?”","Feng Wu said, “That’ll be even easier.”","Feng Xun said, “Then what do you think his rank is?”","Feng Wu asked, “What is it?”","Feng Xun said, “The highest, obviously!”","What else could Feng Wu say?","What could she do?","She could only exchange envious looks with Feng Xun, and the topic was over.","Of course, Feng Wu could keep all the badges for herself, but that wouldn’t be practical.","First of all, one could only rise by so many ranks at one time.","Secondly, she couldn’t think only about herself. Her friends should grow with her.","Therefore, she made the most reasonable arrangement and helped the others as best as she could.","The others were perplexed when Feng Wu mentioned the exchange center.","Chu Qu was the first to raise the question. “Why the exchange center? We’re all students, and we don’t have enough points to exchange for anything.”","Of the nine friends here, Chen Ziyun, Sun Yu and Chu Qu were the most lively ones. Apart from Feng Wu, the other five were rather quiet.","They were Wang Nian, Wang Xiao, Li Shaochu, Li Zhan and Li Si.","They had all participated in the competition against the Military Academy.","Right now, they were all giving Feng Wu strange looks.","They were far from ready to graduate.","“I think Captain Chen is almost there.” They all turned to Chen Ziyun.","Chen Ziyun smiled wryly. “To graduate, we’ll need at least 30,000 points, and I only have 20,000. I have a long way to go.”","He shook his head. “I’ll work hard in the outer ring after I recover. I want to graduate as quickly as possible.","The others shook their heads. If Chen Ziyun needed at least another year, graduating would be even harder for them.","Feng Wu smiled but didn’t tell them anything in advance."]},{"number":3121,"title":"Chapter 3121 Feng Wu, You’re a Loser","paragraphs":["3121 Feng Wu, You’re a Loser","They soon arrived at the exchange center.","It was the only exchange center in the fortress, and cultivators of all levels, including the Spiritual Overlords, would come here to redeem points. The place was quite crowded.","The entire building was devoted solely to exchange services.","The military ranks were exchanged in the east, and the resources were exchanged in the west.","!!","Right now, there were dozens of people in the lobby.","Before Feng Wu could say anything, somebody greeted her.","“Hey, isn’t it Feng Wu?”","Feng Wu looked up and saw it was Senior Sister Lan.","What an unfortunate coincidence.","But actually...","It wasn’t a coincidence at all.","Senior Sister Lan had nothing to do lately and had been hanging around in the exchange center just to wait for Feng Wu.","Chen Ziyun had forced Senior Sister Lan to sign the waiver on the badges, and she hated Feng Wu for that. She wanted to know if Feng Wu had died in the Dayless Woods.","People would come back from the woods to redeem points here all the time, and she could gather a lot of information there.","Hence, Senior Sister Lan had been waiting for news of Feng Wu’s death.","During her stay here, she made a new friend.","Her name was Shan Jingfei, and she was a current student. As for her cultivation level... Well, the other party was a Level 3 Spiritual King, and Senior Sister Lan didn’t think much of her at all.","However, Shan Jingfei disliked Feng Wu as much as she did.","Having spent some time together badmouthing Feng Wu, the two of them became friends.","On that particular day, Senior Sister Lan and Shan Jingfei were hanging out in the lobby with their arms joined.","After the long wait, Senior Sister Lan finally saw Feng Wu.","The sight of Feng Wu shocked her.","Feng Wu was alive and laughing!","Shan Jingfei’s face darkened as well.","In the past few days, Shan Jingfei began to believe Senior Sister Lan’s brainwashing and thought Feng Wu was dead.","Feng Wu didn’t expect to meet the two girls here either.","“It’s you.” Feng Wu nodded indifferently before she ignored them. She told Chu Qu, “Let’s find a corner to open that sack and split the things inside.”","The sack?","Shan Jingfei and Senior Sister Lan looked at the sack in Chu Qu’s hand.","Feng Wu had found this random sack, and it was as old as a rag. The cloth was so worn that it looked like something that belonged to a beggar.","“Did you pick it up in the Dayless Woods?” Senior Sister Lan asked arrogantly.","Feng Wu nodded. “Yes.”","It was full of badges she had found near the spider.","“This is good stuff,” Feng Wu said seriously.","Senior Sister Lan laughed. “Feng Wu, you’re such a loser!”","Feng Wu was perplexed.","Senior Sister Lan said, “Do you carry this sack around in the Dayless Woods like a little beggar and beg for other people’s protection? Is that how you get out? Is that why the bag is so worn?”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Before she could say anything, Shan Jingfei chuckled. “Sister Lan, don’t say such things. Feng Wu is a girl, and you’ll hurt her feelings.”"]},{"number":3122,"title":"Chapter 3122 What Mine?","paragraphs":["3122 What Mine?","Before she could say anything, Shan Jingfei chuckled. “Sister Lan, don’t say such things. Feng Wu is a girl, and you’ll hurt her feelings.”","Senior Sister Lan chuckled. “I see.”","What a load of bullsh*t!","Feng Wu found Senior Sister Lan’s reaction rather idiotic.","!!","However, Senior Sister Lan didn’t seem like she was going to stop any time soon. She only raised her voice when she saw Feng Wu wouldn’t talk to her.","She looked around and found the person she needed.","“Isn’t that Senior Brother Jiang? Senior Brother Jiang!","“Min, I didn’t know you were here!","“Song Yao, you’re here, too!”","Somebody had spread the news that Feng Wu was in the exchange center, and many people gathered around.","Many of them were Feng Wu’s old acquaintances.","Sheng Changtian, Yang Wan, and Song Yao were all here.","They were thrilled to see Feng Wu.","Yang Wan took Feng Wu’s hand and was almost in tears.","Feng Wu asked in concern, “Are you getting better?”","Yang Wan had been severely injured.","Yang Wan nodded. “I’m alright now. Thank you for saving my life.”","Feng Wu smiled. “Don’t worry about it.”","Feng Wu had saved Yang Wan’s life?","Senior Sister Lan didn’t like the sound of that.","“Feng Wu, did you help Yang Wan? She’s from the Military Academy! Why did you do that?”","Yang Wan was displeased and glared at Senior Sister Lan. “Why can’t the Imperial College help me? Have you forgotten about the regulations we’ve memorized? Outside this fortress, the two schools should work as one!”","Senior Sister Lan paled.","She had said the wrong thing.","Still, she glared at Feng Wu. “Fine, you’ve saved some lives. Why did you get so close to the Military Academy? You’ve betrayed Imperial College! You must have sold our secrets to the Military Academy!”","Feng Wu really didn’t know what to say because the accusation was preposterous.","Sun Yu and Chu Qu looked at each other in amazement.","As current students, they always respected graduates like Senior Sister Lan.","Before, they had always found the graduates unapproachable and beyond their reach.","They wouldn’t even look a graduate in the face when they met on the street.","However, Senior Sister Lan’s behavior made them look down on her.","She acted like a shrew, and the most unreasonable kind.","Sun Yu summoned up his courage and glared at Senior Sister Lan. “Xiao Wu never betrayed Imperial College! She just won a mine from the Military Academy for us!”","“That’s right!” Chu Qu was also brave enough to refute the senior sister. “Xiao Wu is awesome, and she’s done great things for Imperial College! You’re making things up! Xiao Wu won us a mine!”","Everybody around them was astonished, and they all stared at Feng Wu.","“A mine?”","“Really?”","“It can’t be. She’s only a student. What mine? A coal mine?”"]},{"number":3123,"title":"Chapter 3123 Lieutenant Colonel Jiang","paragraphs":["3123 Lieutenant Colonel Jiang","Chu Qu blushed when he saw that the others didn’t believe him.","“It’s not a coal mine! It’s an essence crystal mine!” Chu Qu raised his voice.","Everybody fell silent for a second.","They all thought Chu Qu was an idiot, and burst out laughing.","“An essence crystal mine?”","“Don’t make me laugh! I’m having cramps!”","“How can anyone be so stupid? He can’t even tell a proper lie!”","They all laughed as loudly as they could.","No one could hold back.","They might believe Chu Qu if he was talking about tens of thousands of essence crystals, but he was talking about a mine.","“Even the elders can’t do that! Who does she think she is?” Senior Sister Lan clicked her tongue. “You people are so pathetic!”","Shan Jingfei then whispered something in her ear, and Senior Sister Lan’s eyes lit up.","She remembered something.","Looking around, she found the person in the crowd.","“Senior Brother Jiang! Senior Brother Jiang!”","Senior Brother Jiang wasn’t an ordinary graduate.","He graduated from Imperial College ten years ago and was currently a lieutenant colonel and a Level 5 Spiritual King.","Senior Brother Jiang was here.","Someone in the crowd had told him to come here.","Shan Jingfei thought she saw Zuo Qingluan in the crowd, but when she looked again, Zuo Qingluan wasn’t there.","She rubbed her eyes and wondered if she had been mistaken.","Meanwhile, Zuo Qingluan was staring at Feng Wu while hiding in the crowd; her cold gaze reminded one of a lurking snake.","She was like a snake that could jump up at any moment and bite with her venomous fangs.","Feng Wu didn’t know Zuo Qingluan was around. She just wanted to redeem her points, but these people had surrounded her, and she couldn’t get away.","She couldn’t even talk to other people.","How annoying.","Feng Wu was about to lose her temper, when Senior Sister Lan invited Senior Brother Jiang over.","Jiang stood in front of Feng Wu and looked at her.","Senior Sister Lan told Jiang, “This is Miss Feng Wu. I heard she has a habit of bullying Miss Dongfang. She even made Miss Dongfang cry.”","Here in the fortress, “Miss Dongfang” specifically meant Dongfang Ziyun.","was madly in love with her.","When Feng Wu came back, Jiang had taunted her because of Dongfang Ziyun.","“I remember you!” Chu Qu patted his own forehead with a shudder.","He told Feng Wu, “Xiao Wu, he was so mean to you. He’s not a good person!","“When you were still in the Dayless Woods, this man bragged about how you would die in the woods.","“He also said you were only a student, and it would take you at least ten years to become a lieutenant colonel.","“And there’s more...”","Chu Qu had a good memory, and he repeated everything Jiang said about Feng Wu.","This Jiang gave Feng Wu a headache.","She didn’t want any trouble, but these people just wouldn’t leave her alone.","Did she look so easy to pick on?"]},{"number":3124,"title":"Chapter 3124 Badges Returned","paragraphs":["3124 Badges Returned","Before Feng Wu said anything, Jiang frowned and stared at her. “You made Dongfang cry?”","He omitted the “Miss,” as if he and Dongfang Ziyun were closer than other people.","Feng Wu frowned. “You’re in love with her, then.”","Jiang didn’t try to hide his emotions. “Yes! I won’t marry anyone else!”","Feng Wu said, “I see...”","Before she could finish, Sun Yu yelled, “According to Senior Sister Lan, that’s betraying Imperial College! Senior Brother Jiang, you can’t do that.”","Feng Wu looked at Sun Yu in satisfaction. Her friend always knew when to say the right thing.","The others chimed in, booing and hooting.","Feng Wu wasn’t alone anymore. She was surrounded by friends.","Senior Sister Lan felt rather embarrassed.","Jiang sneered at Feng Wu. “You’re smart. You know how to fan the flames.","“But, those are all petty tricks.","“When facing my absolute power, you’re completely vulnerable.","“I’m Jiang Chutian, a lieutenant colonel and a Level 5 Spiritual King.” Jiang smirked at Feng Wu. “What about you?”","Senior Sister Lan said, “She became a Level 2 Spiritual King during the battle in the arena earlier.”","Jiang sneered at Feng Wu. “A Level 2 Spiritual King? You don’t have nearly enough power to show off.”","He then looked at Feng Wu’s friends behind her.","“Students nowadays think so highly of themselves.” Senior Brother Jiang looked at the students as if they were ants. He didn’t try to hide his disdain.","Sun Yu and Chu Qu were furious when they saw the look in Jiang’s eyes.","They couldn’t stand the shame and frustration.","They wanted to graduate and gain a higher rank. It would be like slapping Senior Brother Jiang in the face.","Senior Sister Lan joined in at that point.","“Senior Brother Jiang, that’s all she can do. She’s not qualified to graduate. We can only take her seriously when she graduates,” Senior Sister Lan said mockingly.","She was a major at the moment.","“Why do you think she can’t graduate?” Yang Wan glared at Senior Sister Lan. “She can do it!”","Yang Wan then took an exquisite box out of her sleeve and handed it to Feng Wu. “Here are the badges of the Dongsang assassins you killed. I’ve kept them for you. Here you are.”","Senior Sister Lan’s face darkened.","She thought Yang Wan was deliberately working against her.","Just then, another person squeezed through the crowd. It was Senior Brother Min, who had fought alongside Feng Wu.","He also gave his badges to Feng Wu. “Here are some more badges from the Dongsang assassins you killed. I’ve also kept them for you. Please take them.”","Because Chen Ziyun had forced Senior Sister Lan to sign the waiver, she couldn’t take any. The badges were shared between Chen Ziyun and Senior Brother Min.","Chen Ziyun wouldn’t take any either, so Senior Brother Min took all of them.","However, he was a kind man and kept the badges without redeeming them. He wanted to give them back to Feng Wu when she returned.","Feng Wu had never thought..."]},{"number":3125,"title":"Chapter 3125 Open the Sack","paragraphs":["3125 Open the Sack","She never thought the badges she gave away would return to her at a critical moment like this.","Weren’t badges hard to get?","Senior Sister Lan’s face darkened, and she snorted. “So what if they saved all their badges for you? There’s only enough to let you graduate. As for becoming a major, dream on!”","Only enough to graduate?","!!","Feng Wu looked up at Senior Sister Lan, who was sneering at her.","She turned to Jiang and saw that he was smirking as well.","She turned her head and saw Shan Jingfei this time. She even spotted Zuo Qingluan in the crowd.","Feng Wu and Zuo Qingluan’s eyes met.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t look away.","Her eyes were malicious, and there was a smirk on her face. She was waiting to see Feng Wu make a fool of herself.","Feng Wu turned around to look at her friends.","The concern in their eyes comforted Feng Wu.","She smiled at Chu Qu. “Time to get up.”","Chu Qu said, “What?”","He had gotten tired and sat on the sack again.","Hearing what Feng Wu said, he immediately got up.","Feng Wu gave him a long look before she said indifferently, “Open the sack.”","Chu Qu said obediently, “Sure.”","He opened the sack without another word or unnecessary actions.","When the sack was opened, no one took a look because they weren’t interested.","However, Chu Qu jumped to his feet as if his butt was on fire.","“Holy crap!”","The lobby was quiet, and Chu Qu’s voice could tear the roof off.","It startled everybody.","Sun Yu had to grab Chu Qu to stop him from falling.","“What’s wrong?” What was going on?","Chu Qu pointed at the sack with a shaking finger. “Look! Look in the sack!”","What made him so excited?","The sack was only slightly open, and one had to be very close to see what was inside.","Senior Sister Lan frowned. “He’s only pretending to be excited. He’s making it look like the sack is full of the badges of our enemies!”","Chu Qu looked at her in amazement.","Senior Sister Lan grew uneasy when she saw that look, and wondered what it was about.","Meanwhile, the others learned the answer.","Sun Yu opened the sack wider.","Now that it was fully open, everybody could see what was inside.","Military badges!","Military badges of the Dongsang Kingdom!","It wasn’t just a few of them.","It was a full sack of badges!","Everybody who saw this froze on the spot, as if they were under a spell.","Nobody made a sound.","Everyone thought they were seeing things.","It was either that or the world had gone insane.","“Maybe it’s only badges on the surface.” Senior Sister Lan tried to convince herself.","“Even if that’s the case, it’s still a lot of badges. She’ll have enough to become a lieutenant colonel,” said someone next to Senior Sister Lan.","Jiang was waiting to see Feng Wu make a fool of herself, but things had turned out quite differently. He frowned.","Chu Qu was the most excited of them all.","He could barely form a coherent sentence.","“I... I... I sat on the sack! More than once!”"]},{"number":3126,"title":"Chapter 3126 Sharing the Prize","paragraphs":["3126 Sharing the Prize","Chu Qu grabbed Sun Yu and pointed at the sack. “I sat on it several times! Oh my god!","“My butt has never touched something so valuable!","“I sat on a pile of badges! I can brag about it for the rest of my life!”","Sun Yu gave Chu Qu an indescribable look. He was right. He could indeed brag about it for the rest of his life.","Meanwhile, everybody was looking at Feng Wu with utmost respect, especially people like Sun Yu, who had followed her here from the prison.","In the competition against the Military Academy, they had seen how capable Feng Wu was. She single-handedly defeated five opponents.","But now, she had risen to a new level.","She broke into prison, almost killed Dongfang Ziyun, and confronted Elder Dongfang and got an essence crystal mine from her.","Here in the exchange center, she had just produced a sack full of badges from their enemies.","She was amazing!","A whole sack!","“It’s just on the surface.” Senior Sister Lan smirked. “Badges have different levels, and shoulder plates look like badges, too. Maybe a lot of them are shoulder plates.”","Just like the Junwu Empire, the Dongsang Kingdom had students as well.","Student shoulder plates were worthless.","“No, that’s not the case.” Shan Jingfei took a step forward, glanced at the sack, and whispered to Senior Sister Lan, “They’re all military badges... All of them.”","Senior Sister Lan’s face went livid.","Feng Wu laughed inwardly. Feng Xun had picked up the badges one by one. Of course he wouldn’t fill the sack with shoulder plates.","They were all military badges, and the valuable kind.","Senior Sister Lan cleared her throat. “So what if they’re all military badges? Ordinary ones aren’t worth much.”","Sun Yu glanced at her. “Senior Sister Lan, you’re only a major, aren’t you? I don’t think you should talk about your rank like that.”","Senior Sister Lan almost choked.","She wondered where Feng Wu’s friends learned how to fight back. Why were they all so frustrating?","Senior Sister Lan smirked. “Who knows what’s underneath the surface? It’s probably full of junk.”","Feng Wu turned the sack upside down without saying a word.","The valuable badges fell in a pile on the floor.","Everyone looked at Feng Wu in astonishment.","Why did Feng Wu look like she was pouring out stones?","Her movements were so rough!","People sucked in their breaths.","“Those aren’t ordinary badges!”","“Most of them are lieutenant colonel ones!”","“I see colonel ones, too!”","“Holy crap! There are senior colonel badges!”","...","Everybody sounded shocked, but no one dared to try and take the badges.","If anybody tried such a thing in the exchange center, they would be stripped of their rank and would be kicked out of Peace Grassland.","Meanwhile —","Jiang’s face had practically turned green.","He had just been questioning Feng Wu, and had said that it would take her at least ten years to become a lieutenant colonel.","But now...","She had more than enough badges to become a general!","Oh god!","Would he have to address Feng Wu as General Feng?","Jiang felt like crying.","To his surprise, Feng Wu did something else.","She started calling names. “Ying Yuan, Senior Brother Min, Song Yao, Yang Wan...”"]},{"number":3127,"title":"Chapter 3127 Xiao Wu, That Won’t Do","paragraphs":["3127 Xiao Wu, That Won’t Do","She started calling out names. “Ying Yuan, Senior Brother Min, Song Yao, Yang Wan...”","When she saw Sheng Changtian, she added his name. “Sheng Changtian.”","Sheng Changtian said, “Yes?”","He looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment, not knowing what she wanted to do.","Feng Wu waved her hand in a generous manner. “Go!”","Go where?","“Go grab a handful of badges. Take as many as you can, but you only have one go.”","Feng Wu had gotten this inspiration from her previous life.","She remembered how some generous firms would put cash in a box during the year-end party and let their employees take a handful from it. They could keep everything they grabbed in one go. It must have been a great feeling!","What?","The others were all baffled.","Grab a handful?","That was so generous!","Sheng Changtian didn’t know what to say.","When they first met, he thought Feng Wu was as weak as an ant.","The memory made him want to slap himself.","To make it a fair game, Feng Wu let Chu Qu put all the badges back into the sack.","While Chu Qu held the sack open, Sun Yu scooped the badges into it.","If someone didn’t know better, they would think the two boys were loading potatoes.","Nobody was redeeming their points because they had all gathered around.","Many people even brought their friends.","Such generosity probably only happened once in a hundred years.","After the badges were back in the sack, Feng Wu gestured at those that she had just named, telling them to form a queue.","As for Senior Sister Lan and the others...","Feng Wu glanced at them in amazement. After the initial shock, why hadn’t they slipped away?","What were they thinking?","She didn’t have time to deal with them. She was busy.","When Yang Wan recovered from her astonishment and realized she wasn’t dreaming, she tried to turn down the offer. “Xiao Wu, I can’t take them.”","Feng Wu said, “You can.”","Yang Wan blushed. “You saved my entire team, and we were only holding onto the badges for you. You don’t need to give us any reward. It’s us who should repay you for what you did.”","The others all nodded and agreed with her.","Feng Wu said earnestly, “Don’t worry about it. I picked them up in the woods. I hardly needed to do anything.”","Feng Xun was walking toward her at that moment and almost slipped.","Yes, they had picked them up, but it had been a lot of work!","He had trembled under the Sacred Imperial Spider’s covetous gaze the entire time he was picking up the badges. It had been hard work.","Seeing how serious Feng Wu was, those people finally realized Feng Wu genuinely wanted to give them some badges.","Their good deeds had paid off.","Hence, they lined up and grabbed the badges in turn.","The badges were quite sizable, so they couldn’t take much with one hand. There was just about enough to raise their ranks by one level.","It all depended on their luck. The most fortunate ones could get badges of colonels or senior colonels.","After Yang Wan and the others took the badges, they happily went to redeem their points. Feng Wu turned to her friends.","She had been observing Sun Yu and the others when the rest were doing the lucky draw.","She had her own plans."]},{"number":3128,"title":"Chapter 3128 I’ll Be a Colonel for Now","paragraphs":["3128 I’ll Be a Colonel for Now","She wanted to help her friends, but she didn’t want to let ungrateful people take advantage of her. Therefore, she would only help those people whom she deemed simple and kind.","She was relieved to see that there was no envy on her friends’ faces.","“I’ll be calling some more names.”","This time, it was Feng Wu’s team members’ turn.","!!","Each member could take two handfuls of badges.","Feng Wu knew very well who her good friends were.","Among them, Chen Ziyun, Chu Yun and Sun Yu could take three handfuls.","As for what badges they could get, it all depended on their luck.","After giving away the badges, she had less than half a sack left.","All those people had redeemed their points.","Yang Wan and her team members all rose by one rank and had almost all become lieutenant colonels.","Chen Ziyun and his seven friends all graduated.","Other than that, they all became majors.","They didn’t redeem all their points because they weren’t in a hurry. They hadn’t gained enough accomplishments yet, and rising higher would only give them empty titles.","Therefore, they all kept their points for cultivation resources.","In the end, it was Feng Wu’s turn.","She dragged the sack to the exchange counter.","There were three counters. Counter one and three had female staff, while counter two had a male staff member.","Feng Wu immediately chose the one in the middle.","She knew how women could turn against each other and how men tended to be friendly toward her. It was so rare for her to meet kind girls, so she cherished all her female friends. On the other hand, boys were usually nice to her.","Senior Sister Lan’s face darkened.","Why?!","She was also part of the team. Why could Ying Yuan, Senior Brother Min, Chen Ziyun and everybody else get those badges? Why was she left out?","That wasn’t fair!","She stared at Feng Wu, hoping the latter would feel guilty for this and suddenly call her name.","That never happened.","She decided Feng Wu was doing it on purpose and was trying to humiliate her.","The idea filled Senior Sister Lan with hatred.","The lieutenant colonel sitting behind counter two was called Ning Jingqiu, and he watched Feng Wu as she approached him with her half a sack of badges.","In fact...","Everybody had watched when Feng Wu shared the badges with her friends, and Ning envied those people so much that he wished he were Feng Wu’s friend.","His two female colleagues behind the counters looked like they wanted to dig holes in Feng Wu’s skin with their eyes.","“Ahem.”","Ning Jingqiu cleared his throat and adjusted his facial expression before he beamed at Feng Wu.","“Hello, Miss Feng Wu.”","Feng Wu was surprised. “How do you know my name?”","Ning Jingqiu chuckled. “You’ve attracted quite a bit of attention here. It’s hard not to know your name.”","The girl was already a beauty. With an amazed look on her face, she looked adorable. Ning Jingqiu immediately became her fan.","“How can I help you?” His smile was sincere.","“I’d like to redeem all these badges for points. After that, I’ll rise to, well...” Feng Wu gave it some thought and said, “I think I’ll become a colonel for now.”","Lieutenant Colonel Jiang almost spat out a mouthful of blood.","For now?","What was that supposed to mean?","Did she mean she could even become a senior colonel or a general, but she decided to stop at colonel for the time being?"]},{"number":3129,"title":"Chapter 3129 Little Feng Xun, Come Here","paragraphs":["3129 Little Feng Xun, Come Here","Did she mean she could even become a senior colonel or a general, but she decided to stop at colonel for the time being?","The others all gave Feng Wu strange looks.","Even Ning Jingqiu was shocked.","“A colonel? For now?” Ning Jingqiu looked at Feng Wu’s shoulder badge to double-check that she was indeed a student.","!!","When her friends redeemed their badges, they only had enough points to raise their ranks by one level.","Feng Wu simply gave him the entire sack. “Turn them into points first, please.”","Ning Jingqiu was speechless when he saw the half-sack of badges.","He rubbed his nose and asked curiously, “If you don’t mind me asking, where did you get these badges?”","Everybody pricked up their ears.","They were so curious.","Feng Wu said, “I found them and picked them up.”","Had she been telling the truth all along?","The people around them listened with flickering eyes.","They wanted Ning Jingqiu to ask her where she found them. They wanted to get some, too!","Ning Jingqiu then asked the question everybody wanted to ask.","“May I ask where you found these badges?”","He felt abashed asking that question, and his fair cheeks turned pink.","Feng Wu didn’t mind at all. She waved her hand and said, “In the Sacred Imperial Spider’s woods.”","The Sacred Imperial Spider’s woods?","That name sounded familiar.","“Holy cow! Isn’t that the territory of one of the seven beast kings?”","“The Sacred Imperial Spider is a peak Spiritual Overlord, isn’t it?”","“It’s probably a Spiritual Saint already.”","“OMG!”","“That’s so scary! How did she find those badges?!”","Many people looked at Feng Wu in amazement and waited for her answer. Feng Wu could tell they wanted her to show them the way.","She wasn’t going to do that. If the Sacred Imperial Spider was displeased, it could eat all these people. She wasn’t joking.","Feng Wu looked up and saw a familiar face in the crowd.","“Little Feng Xun! Over here!”","She waved at her brother.","Little Feng Xun?","The others didn’t realize whom Feng Wu was talking to at first, but when they turned around, they were shocked to see Young Lord Feng, the son of General Feng.","Although families weren’t taken into account here in Peace Grassland, and everybody earned their ranks in the same way, one’s background wouldn’t really be ignored.","He was General Feng’s son!","Wait!","What did Feng Wu just call Young Lord Feng?","Little Feng Xun?","She sounded as if she was talking to a kid, but Young Lord Feng was the heir of an important family. Surely he would get angry.","While the others were worried for Feng Wu, Feng Xun rushed to her side.","“Xiao Wu, what are you doing here?” Feng Xun looked at his sister in excitement.","Whenever he ran into his sister, she was always so pretty!","“She’s my sister! Mine!” thought Feng Xun.","The others couldn’t believe the proud look on Feng Xun’s face.","Senior Sister Lan and Lieutenant Colonel Jiang’s faces darkened.","Not only did Feng Wu find so many badges, she was also so close to Young Lord Feng. How did that happen?","Jiang had been trying to make his way into the crown prince’s social circle, but his efforts had been futile so far."]},{"number":3130,"title":"Chapter 3130 She Has Enough Points Left to...","paragraphs":["3130 She Has Enough Points Left to...","Jiang had been trying to join the crown prince’s social circle, but couldn’t find his way in.","That was because the crown prince didn’t socialize with random people!","Jiang’s plan was to introduce himself to Feng Xun instead. If he could become the young lord’s man, he would indirectly become His Royal Highness’s man.","For that, Jiang approached Helian Zehang.","!!","Who was Helian Zehang? He was a colonel and a Level 7 Spiritual King. He was very capable, and Jiang had been fawning on him.","Helian Zehang’s grandfather was Elder Helian.","Jiang was trying to become familiar with Elder Helian through Helian Zehang. From there, he would make his way to Feng Xun and eventually reach the crown prince.","He wanted to slowly make his way up the social ladder like a snail.","He didn’t mind taking longer since it was his life’s goal.","Feng Xun had just shown up.","Jiang had been trying to become familiar with Young Lord Feng.","However, he saw Feng Wu and Feng Xun standing together with their arms around each other’s shoulders. They seemed so close.","Jiang felt a prickling sensation on his back. He wondered if Feng Wu had gotten to Young Lord Feng first.","The idea made his face lose all color because he had just offended Feng Wu.","He had to make that grudge go away. Jiang racked his brain and soon formed a plan.","By the looks of it, Feng Wu should be one of Young Lord Feng’s women. He knew what to do.","He hurried off to make preparations.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu introduced Feng Xun to everyone. “This is Feng Xun. He was the one who picked up all the badges. If you want to thank somebody, thank him. Ask him whatever you want.”","After that, Feng Wu left Feng Xun with the crowd while she went to Ning Jingqiu to redeem her points.","She still remembered the exchange rate.","A Dongsang major’s badge was worth 600 points.","A Dongsang lieutenant colonel’s badge was worth 3,600 points.","A Dongsang colonel’s badge was worth 12,800 points.","A Dongsang senior colonel’s badge was worth 48,000 points.","After some calculations, Feng Wu had a million points in total.","Ning Jingqiu’s face almost turned green.","He stared at Feng Wu. “Guess what? Even the elders aren’t as rich as you are.”","Feng Wu said, “Why are you so surprised? I have a good brother.”","Ning Jingqiu was silent for a while before asking, “Are you sure you only want to be a colonel? With your points, you can easily become a senior colonel.”","The points also had a fixed exchange rate.","To graduate, one needed 5,000 points. A major needed 6,000 points, a lieutenant colonel 36,000 points, a colonel 128,000 points, and a senior colonel 480,000 points.","That was to say, one needed ten Dongsang badges to exchange for one Junwu military rank of the same level.","Feng Wu was also a little astonished by her million points.","She tilted her head and gave it some thought.","Of course, she could become a senior colonel, but she was only a Level 5 Spiritual King, and a senior colonel’s mission could get her killed.","The thought made Feng Wu shake her head. “A colonel will do. I can handle that rank, but anything higher will be too difficult. I only have so many teeth.”","Huh?","Ning Jingqiu couldn’t understand what she meant, but he knew Feng Wu only wanted to become a colonel.","Before long, Feng Wu was officially a colonel, and her shoulder badge was so handsome.","She still had ample points left. There was enough to..."]},{"number":3131,"title":"Chapter 3131 825,000 Points","paragraphs":["3131 825,000 Points","She had as many as 825,000 points left!","Ning Jingqiu looked at Feng Wu in envy and astonishment again.","He wondered if Elder Helian had as many points as Feng Wu.","“Talk about inequality...” Ning Jingqiu grumbled inwardly.","When Feng Wu finished redeeming her points, the exchange center finally quieted down.","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead, feeling very sleepy.","She only realized then that it had been a while since she slept.","She had spent ten days making the Semi-Divine spirit pill for Jun Linyuan. After coming to Peace Grassland, she had to fight in the Spiritual King arena for an opportunity to send the pill to Jun Linyuan. When that was over, she went to the Dayless Woods.","So many things happened in those woods.","Lord Pan, the Sacred Imperial Spider, the Peacock King, Mr. Sakiya and Jun Linyuan were all there. Then, she had to rescue Chen Ziyun before coming here.","Feng Wu rubbed her stomach. She was starving.","She then rubbed her eyes. She could really use some sleep right now.","Between eating and sleeping, she chose the latter without hesitation.","However, where should she sleep?","Feng Wu finally realized something: She hadn’t found a place to stay since arriving at the fortress.","When she asked Feng Xun, he said, “You can go to Boss Jun. He has an entire courtyard.”","Feng Wu shook her head. That wouldn’t do. A young man and a young woman shouldn’t stay all by themselves. It would affect her reputation, and she still wanted to get married someday.","Feng Wu said, “I’m a colonel now. Don’t I have a place of my own?”","Feng Xun thought about it and said, “Actually, that’s true. Your rank qualifies you to have a house of your own. Would you like to see it now? Shall I walk you there?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s great!”","The fortress was divided into east and west wings.","The east side was the Military Academy’s living quarters, whereas Imperial College’s living quarters were on the west side.","From the south to the north, the west wing was divided into four sections: the portal, the students’ section, the field officers’ section, and the generals’ section.","With Feng Wu’s rank, she belonged to the field officers’ section now.","Chen Ziyun and the others excitedly accompanied Feng Wu.","They also graduated today and had become field officers.","A pair of eyes followed Feng Wu and her friends all the way until they were out of sight.","Those eyes were filled with animosity.","In the field officers’ section.","Chen Ziyun and his team members all went to the majors’ quarters.","Senior Brother Min and his friends went to the lieutenant colonels’ quarters.","Ying Yuan was already a lieutenant colonel because he was a Level 4 Spiritual King, but he didn’t use the points to improve his rank this time. Rather, he saved them for later.","Feng Wu and Feng Xun were both colonels now, so they headed for the colonels’ quarters together.","Here, each individual had their own house, but they were townhouses only.","“This is yours.” Feng Xun found Feng Wu a house close to his and let Feng Wu go inside. “It’s No. 119, and the door is locked with inscriptions. You...”","Just then, a sound came out of Feng Xun’s shoulder badge.","Feng Xun frowned, because it was the sound of an urgent mission.","Feng Wu patted him on the arm. “Your mission is more important. Go back to your work. I’ll take care of myself.”","Feng Xun looked around, trying to find someone to help with Feng Wu’s accommodation paperwork, but everyone was busy."]},{"number":3132,"title":"Chapter 3132 What’s the Girl’s Background?","paragraphs":["3132 What’s the Girl’s Background?","He could only tell Feng Wu in a hurry, “We’re colonels, and the person in charge of our quarters is Yang Zhihu, a senior colonel. You should report to him.”","Feng Wu rubbed her dry eyes. “I see. Go back to your work. I’ll be alright.”","Feng Xun was still a little worried. “Are you sure?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes, I’m sure.”","!!","Feng Xun couldn’t stop worrying. “Yang Zhihu is a capable man, but he can be narrow-minded at times, and he’s keen on saving face. Just watch out for his ego, and you’ll be fine.”","Feng Wu was so sleepy that she could hardly keep her eyes open. She gave Feng Xun a little shove. “Just go.”","Feng Xun said, “You can’t go in without a key. Go to Yang Zhihu first.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Feng Xun’s team was waiting for him, and he had to leave.","As for Feng Wu...","The door was locked with inscriptions, and ordinary people couldn’t open it.","However, Feng Wu took out the Phoenix Pen and casually drew something in the air. “Open.”","The door opened as commanded.","The house was about 100 square meters in size with a wooden interior. There wasn’t much decor, but the room was spotless. The floor was burlywood as well.","The only furniture was a bed and a table.","There was nothing else.","The bed had a clean, white sheet on it.","Feng Wu didn’t feel so sleepy until she saw the bed.","She rubbed her eyes, went to the bed, and threw herself on the pillow.","She was so sleepy.","She fell asleep as soon as she closed her eyes.","Yang Zhihu was in his office.","He was dumbfounded when the exchange center notified him that a new colonel was coming.","Why was there suddenly a new colonel?","He had never heard of that name before.","Yang Zhihu waited and waited, but the girl with that name never arrived. Three days passed.","Yang Zhihu didn’t know what to do.","He was still holding the key to that empty house.","Did that mean Feng Wu was missing?","Yang Zhihu frowned and wondered who that Feng Wu was. Where did she go?","He decided to take a look at the girl’s file.","However —","“Her file? I don’t have it,” the officer in charge of the files told Yang Zhihu.","Yang Zhihu asked, “How’s that possible? Is it a top secret?”","The officer was his good friend, so he told Yang Zhihu, “Talk to Elder Heng. He may have the answer.”","Elder Heng was Elder Wu and Elder Mo’s colleague and was also under Elder Helian’s command.","Yang Zhihu was very curious, so he went to see Elder Heng.","“Who?” Elder Heng was happily playing with an essence crystal. He immediately straightened his back when Yang Zhihu mentioned the name.","“A girl named Feng Wu,” Yang Zhihu complained. “I don’t know what her background is, but she suddenly became a colonel. I never saw her name in the lieutenant colonels’ quarters.”","Yang Zhihu was quite talkative around his superior. He went on and on. “I went to the majors’ quarter, but she wasn’t there. I even looked through the files of the elders, but none of them have that surname. Elder Heng, that’s so strange...”","Elder Heng looked at Yang Zhihu as if he was an idiot."]},{"number":3133,"title":"Chapter 3133 Feng Wu?","paragraphs":["3133 Feng Wu?","Elder Heng found his young subordinate quite foolish. “Don’t you know who Feng Wu is?”","Yang Zhihu said, “Should I know that name?”","Elder Heng asked, “Do you really not know who she is?”","Yang Zhihu was even more bewildered. He had only been in the Dayless Woods for two weeks. Why did it feel like he had come back to a different world?","!!","Seeing that Yang Zhihu really had no idea, Elder Heng told him, “As for who Feng Wu is... Look.”","He simply showed Yang Zhihu the fist-sized essence crystal.","Yang Zhihu was confused. “Aren’t essence crystals usually the size of a fingernail? Why is this one so big?”","Elder Heng said, “It’s from our mine.”","Yang Zhihu didn’t believe him. “How can that be? Our essence crystals always have a yellow tint and are of inferior quality. None of them are this big.”","Elder Heng laughed. “That was before! Your information is outdated!”","Yang Zhihu said, “What?”","Elder Heng said, “The Imperial College has a new essence crystal mine now!”","He was so pleased that he couldn’t stop smiling.","Yang Zhihu was astonished.","The news of the discovery of a new essence crystal mine could shake the entire empire. How could he not have heard it?","“A new essence crystal mine? Did Elder Helian find it?” Yang Zhihu lowered his voice.","Elder Heng said, “It’s not a new mine. We got it from them...”","He pointed in the direction of the Military Academy.","He was usually quite serious, but Yang Zhihu was one of his own, so he didn’t try to hide his feelings and laughed heartily.","Yang Zhihu didn’t understand.","He didn’t get Elder Heng’s hint.","Elder Heng finally put it in plain words. “It’s not a newly discovered mine. We took it from the Military Academy. It’s mine No. 3.”","Yang Zhihu stopped laughing and stared at Elder Heng. “Sir, that’s not funny at all. Please don’t make fun of me.”","Elder Heng looked at him. “Do you think I’m joking?”","Yang Zhihu said, “Of course!”","Elder Heng said seriously, “I’m not joking.”","Yang Zhihu knew Elder Heng was telling the truth when he became serious.","Hence...","“Really?! Is that true?!” Yang Zhihu almost jumped to his feet. “Why was the Military Academy so generous? Why did they give us that mine? Did the general give that order?”","Elder Heng shook his head with a smile. “It was the work of a genius in our school.”","“A genius?” Yang Zhihu thought about the talented members of his school. “Was it Feng Xun? Xuan Yi?”","Elder Heng shook his head.","“Was it Yan Han?”","Elder Heng said, “Yan Han has talent in inscriptions, but she has nothing to do with this.”","Yang Zhihu asked, “Was it Wang Zhaole?”","Elder Heng said, “The answer is still no.”","Yang Zhihu asked, “Who was it, then? I’m running out of options.”","Elder Heng said, “You mentioned that name when you came here.”","Yang Zhihu was confused. Whose name did he mention when he came?","“I didn’t mention any name.”","Elder Heng looked at his capable subordinate in resignation. “Weren’t you looking for Feng Wu’s file?”","“Yes, I was...” Yang Zhihu finally realized what Elder Heng meant, and he stared at the latter in astonishment. “Feng Wu?!”","As a senior colonel, he shouldn’t reveal his emotions so freely, however..."]},{"number":3134,"title":"Chapter 3134 She’s Jealous","paragraphs":["3134 She’s Jealous","He was shocked beyond description.","Elder Heng smiled and nodded at him.","Yang Zhihu was shocked and confused. “I was only away for half a month. Why does it feel like the world has turned upside down? Who on earth is this Feng Wu?”","Elder Heng chuckled. “I don’t know the answer. What did you say you wanted?”","!!","“Her file. I want to see her file.”","“Her file? I want to see that, too, but I can’t. Elder Helian took it away, saying it was top secret.”","Yang Zhihu asked, “Can it be that important? But...”","He suddenly turned pale, and Elder Heng looked at him in bewilderment.","Yang Zhihu frowned and told Elder Heng why he was after the file. “Feng Wu has become a colonel, but it has been three days, and she still hasn’t reported to me.”","Elder Heng said, “Three days? How can she be absent for three days? Did you look for her?”","Yang Zhihu shook his head.","That thought never crossed his mind. He had only wanted to teach the disobedient newcomer a lesson.","Elder Heng said, “That’s not good. She’s Elder Helian’s favorite now!","“I also heard she’s somehow connected to the crown prince. People have been saying she’s His Royal Highness’s future wife.”","“What?!” Yang Zhihu’s knees nearly buckled.","He looked at Elder Heng, almost bursting into tears.","Elder Heng said anxiously, “Why did you wait so long?!”","Yang Zhihu really wanted to cry.","Nobody told him she could be the crown prince’s future wife!","If he had known, he wouldn’t have waited three days before coming here!","Elder Heng said, “Don’t tell other people about her relationship with the crown prince. His Royal Highness may not like it.”","Yang Zhihu said, “I know. What should I do now?”","Elder Heng said, “Find her now!”","Yang Zhihu said, “Yes, of course! I’m on it!”","The crown prince’s future wife had won a mine for Imperial College. What kind of amazing girl was she?","Yang Zhihu told his deputy and everybody in the colonels’ quarters to look for Feng Wu together.","They had to find her!","Deputy Xu didn’t mind because it was part of his job, but the others weren’t as willing.","Yan Han was particularly unhappy.","She was a capable girl from an influential family. Her grandfather was a member of the elders, and she was an expert in inscriptions. Here in the colonels’ quarters, where there were only a few female members, she was treated like a princess.","Usually, Yang Zhihu would treat her differently, but when he passed her just now, he walked so fast that he only had time to stuff a stack of papers in her hands and shout, “Find Feng Wu! Now!”","Yan Han almost burst into tears at that moment.","She was supposed to be the princess of the colonels’ quarter. Who was this Feng Wu? Why was everybody making such a big deal about her?","When Yan Han saw the portrait in her hands, she was filled with astonishment, rage and jealousy!","She touched every inch of Feng Wu’s portrait.","She had never seen such a beautiful face before.","Even in the portrait, the girl seemed to have flawless skin.","...","Yan Han was so dumbfounded that she stood there for a long while.","“She can’t look like this. No one can be this pretty. It’s not possible,” she told herself."]},{"number":3135,"title":"Chapter 3135 Who Did It?!","paragraphs":["3135 Who Did It?!","Yan Han was so jealous that she almost cried.","Yang Zhihu had run past her, but he turned around and yelled at her again. “Yan Han, don’t just stand here! Find little Feng Wu!”","Yang Zhihu ran off after that.","Yan Han was speechless.","!!","Little Feng Wu?","Why did he use such an endearing name?","He hadn’t even met her yet. Would he use some more ridiculous names when Feng Wu showed up?","The boys in the colonels’ quarters usually called Yan Han “Precious Yan.”","The thought made Yan Han even more jealous. She threw Feng Wu’s portrait on the ground and stepped on it.","“So what if you have a pretty face? I’ll step on it! You don’t know how well-connected I am! I won’t let you steal my show!”","Yang Zhihu didn’t know Yan Han would react that way. Right now, he was leading a group of people to look everywhere for Feng Wu.","Deputy Xu led the first group to search the Dayless Woods.","Wang Zhaole led the second group to search the entire colonels’ quarters.","Yang Hong led the third group to search the rest of the fortress.","The fourth group...","In other words, all of the colonels’ quarters was on the move.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu had no idea what was going on. She was still fast asleep.","Yang Zhihu went to Elder Helian for help.","Elder Helian said, “What?! Xiao Wu is missing?!”","He looked like he was going to lose his mind. “We can’t let anything happen to her, or the crown prince will kill us all!”","Moreover, she was also a Semi-Divine medicine refiner who could outwit Elder Dongfang!","“Can it be the Military Academy’s doing?” Elder Helian wanted to question Elder Dongfang.","Of course, the Military Academy heard the commotion in Imperial College’s section.","Elder Dongfang’s house was right across the road from Elder Helian’s.","Right now, she was feeding medicine to Dongfang Ziyun, who was still bedridden.","“Aunt, it’s so noisy outside...” Dongfang Ziyun said weakly. She could hear Elder Helian’s angry voice.","Elder Dongfang chuckled. “You wouldn’t say that if you knew what’s happening out there.”","Dongfang Ziyun wasn’t interested at all.","She lay dispiritedly in bed and could only think of the person she hated the most.","Feng Wu!","Feng Wu!","Feng Wu!","She closed her eyes to hide the hatred in them.","Feng Wu had injured her and stolen the essence crystal mine. Not only was Dongfang Ziyun utterly humiliated, the people of the Military Academy had also started hating her. Even her aunt lost some popularity for helping her.","Dongfang Ziyun would never forgive Feng Wu.","“Feng Wu is missing,” Elder Dongfang whispered in Dongfang Ziyun’s ear.","Only a moment ago, Dongfang Ziyun said she wasn’t interested, but she bolted up when she heard this and almost knocked over the bowl in Elder Dongfang’s hand.","She asked anxiously, “Aunt, what did you just say? What was that?!”","Elder Dongfang smiled. “I heard Feng Wu’s missing.”","“Did you do it?” Dongfang Ziyun’s first reaction was the same as Elder Helian’s.","Elder Dongfang shook her head.","She had thought about it, but now wasn’t the right time.","The Military Academy had just lost their mine. If she took action now, she would come under suspicion right away. Therefore, she decided to wait until more people disliked Feng Wu. She could do it when Feng Wu was in the Dayless Woods."]},{"number":3136,"title":"Chapter 3136 Are You a Fairy from the Moon?","paragraphs":["3136 Are You a Fairy from the Moon?","Dongfang Ziyun asked, “Who could it be, then? Who did it?”","Elder Dongfang said indifferently, “Why do you care?”","Dongfang Ziyun realized she was right.","Yes!","!!","Why should she care? Somebody out there did it!","“Hahaha! That’s karma! Finally, the time has come for her to be punished for what she did!” Dongfang Ziyun said coldly.","At that moment, Feng Wu had no idea everybody was looking for her.","She slowly woke up when she heard the noise outside.","What was that about?","Why wouldn’t they let her sleep?","Feng Wu rubbed her eyes, yawned and finally opened her eyes.","She rolled around in bed, finally feeling she had rested enough. She gathered her strength, but remained lying down.","Her eyes were bright and clear once more.","Because the house was made of wood, she could see the light flashing outside. Something seemed to be rushing back and forth outside, moving unbelievably fast.","Was it a ghost?","Intrigued, Feng Wu got out of bed and went to open the door.","She was right. So many people were running around outside.","Feng Wu rested her elbows on the railing and cupped her chin as she watched them curiously.","Were they looking for something?","Somebody was digging in the ground.","Somebody was checking a bird’s nest.","Feng Wu thought they were looking for some spiritual pet.","She ran down the stairs and asked the teenager who was looking into the bird’s nest, “Hey, what are you looking for? Can I help you with anything?”","All these people were wearing colonel shoulder badges. Since Feng Wu was new here, she decided to make friends with them and blend in.","The teenager searching the bird’s nest was quite capable as well.","He was called Yue Xiu.","He was still looking into the nest when he casually replied, “Do you not know? Did you just come back from the Dayless Woods? Something really strange has happened.”","It was too dark to see one’s face clearly, and the teenager was looking into the nest the whole time, so he didn’t realize who he was talking to. He thought Feng Wu was just another fellow colonel.","Feng Wu’s eyes twinkled in the dark. “Strange? How strange? Tell me about it!”","Yue Xiu said grumpily, “Somebody disappeared from our quarters, and Yang Zhihu is leading the search party. We’ve done nothing but look for that person tonight. Yang Zhihu is a short-tempered man. I’m sure when he finds that person, he’ll skin him or her alive.”","“A search party? Who are you looking for? I’m very good at finding missing people.” Feng Wu rolled up her sleeves, ready to impress her new colleague.","“Feng Wu,” said Yue Xiu.","“Yes?” Feng Wu wondered how this teenager knew her name.","“Feng Wu.”","“Hm?”","Yue Xiu grew impatient. What was this girl doing? He turned around and stared at Feng Wu. “I’m telling you, the person we’re looking for is called Feng Wu!”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Under the moonlight, the girl’s skin was flawless and as fair as the first snow.","Her features were exquisite, and her beauty was beyond description.","She looked like the best work of Nature itself.","Yue Xiu’s brain froze for a moment. He opened his mouth, but no sound came out.","“Are you a fairy?” He stared at Feng Wu. “Are you a fairy from the moon?”"]},{"number":3137,"title":"Chapter 3137 More Than Perfect","paragraphs":["3137 More Than Perfect","Feng Wu looked perplexed.","Yue Xiu said, “You... You...”","A thought suddenly struck him, and he took a portrait out of his chest pocket and looked at it under the moonlight.","Holy crap!","The painting hadn’t made Feng Wu prettier than she really was!","Everybody thought the painting was a beautified version of the girl.","When they searched for her, they were expecting to see a girl that only resembled the painting by 70%.","If the girl in the painting had a score of ten, they thought Feng Wu herself would only be a seven.","However, Yue Xiu realized the girl in front of him was at least a twelve!","No painting could depict how beautiful she was.","“Are you Feng Wu?” Yue Xiu stared at her.","Feng Wu nodded. “Yes, I am.”","Yue Xiu shouted, “Guys! Over here! I found her! I found Feng Wu!”","His voice resonated in the quiet living quarters.","Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment and had a bad feeling about this.","Was she the reason for all the commotion?","Everybody heard Yue Xiu’s voice.","Immediately, they all rushed in their direction.","Apart from Deputy Xu and his group, who had gone to the Dayless Woods, everybody was here. They surrounded Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at them, and they looked back at her.","In the moonlight, she was as beautiful as a fairy. No one could bring themselves to tell her off.","Wang Zhaole and Yang Hong led the second and third groups respectively.","They looked at each other. Both wanted to step forward, but neither had the courage.","Just then, Yang Zhihu arrived.","He glowered at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu only gave him an innocent glance.","Now that Yang Zhihu knew Feng Wu’s background, he didn’t dare do anything to her. However, he was all about saving face, so he put on a serious look.","He stared at her. “Feng Wu?!”","Feng Wu said, “Yes...”","Yang Zhihu said, “What took you so long? Where have you been? Everybody has been looking for you!”","Feng Wu said, “I...”","Before she could finish, Yang Zhihu said impatiently, “Follow me!”","He put his hands behind his back and led the way.","Seeing that Feng Wu was still standing there, he shouted, “I said follow me!”","The entire colonels’ quarters knew that Yang Zhihu was a Level 9 Spiritual King, and everybody was afraid of him.","His nickname was “White Tiger.”","Hearing his bellow, everybody cringed and held their breaths.","Yue Xiu was worried about Feng Wu. Yang Zhihu was angry. What would happen to the fairy?","Wang Zhaole and Yang Hong looked at each other, and were both worried about Feng Wu.","She couldn’t be older than 15. Yang Zhihu was like an angry tiger when he lost his temper. The girl wouldn’t be frightened to tears, would she?","“Dismissed!” Yang Zhihu shouted at his subordinates.","Yue Xiu summoned up his courage. “Sir, about Feng Wu...”","“Shut up!” Yang Zhihu shouted at Yue Xiu.","His voice sounded like a thunderclap, and everybody cringed.","The white tiger was so scary.","He looked like he could kill somebody.","Everybody gave the pretty girl sympathetic looks.","Only one person was smiling in the crowd.","It was none other than Yan Han herself."]},{"number":3138,"title":"Chapter 3138 Skip Two Ranks","paragraphs":["3138 Skip Two Ranks","Yan Han almost cried when she saw Feng Wu. However, she felt very relieved after Yang Zhihu scolded the girl.","So what if Feng Wu is pretty? Mr. Yang still shouts at her.","He doesn’t care about your background. You’ve offended him. You’re doomed!","Jealousy could blind a person.","!!","When Yan Han didn’t feel threatened, she was still an arrogant girl, but her pride was within reason. But now, all she could think of was defeating the beautiful Feng Wu.","She wondered how her colleagues felt about Feng Wu.","Hence, she put on a smile so that the others wouldn’t see how displeased she was.","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi were the most brilliant members in the colonels’ quarters. Both were young lords, and both were the crown prince’s close friends.","Yan Han had been trying to make friends with them but never had the chance.","She was glad they weren’t here. Otherwise, she was sure they would be infatuated with Feng Wu.","The thought made Yan Han heave a sigh of relief.","She set a goal for herself: get rid of Feng Wu before Feng Xun came back.","Apart from Feng Xun and Xuan Yi, Wang Zhaole and Yang Hong were the most outstanding colonels.","They always followed Feng Xun and Xuan Yi around and acted like their lackeys.","Helian Zehang, the Level 7 Spiritual King, was also an important member because his grandfather was Elder Helian. However, he was in the Dayless Woods at the moment.","Yan Han calmed down and ran after Wang Zhaole with a smile. “Zhaole, Hong, wait for me.”","Wang Zhaole and Yang Hong were about to leave, and they looked at each other when they heard Yan Han’s voice.","Did Yan Han just address them as Zhaole and Hong?","That didn’t seem right.","Yan Han always raised her chin and gave them sidelong glances when she talked to them before, and they were only “Wang Zhaole” and “Yang Hong” to her.","She was an inscription master and a rather good one, which made her rather arrogant because everybody had to ask for her help when the inscriptions on their weapons needed repairing.","The change in her attitude was very strange.","Wang Zhaole and Yang Hong turned around and looked at Yan Han.","“What is it, Yan Han?”","Unlike other people, Wang Zhaole and Yang Hong always addressed her by her full name.","Yan Han was very polite this time. She smiled at Wang Zhaole and asked, “Are you going back? Let me join you.”","Of course, the two young men couldn’t say no.","Yan Han walked between Wang Zhaole and Yang Hong.","After exchanging a few pleasantries, she quickly changed the subject.","“What do you think about Feng Wu?”","Wang Zhaole asked, “What?”","Yan Han said, “Do you think she’s pretty? I’m told she’s only a Level 2 Spiritual King.”","“A Level 2 Spiritual King?” Wang Zhaole and Yang Hong were both surprised. “Are you sure?”","“Yes,” Yan Han said seriously. “I’ve asked around. Do you know what I’ve learned? Feng Wu was only a student before she became a colonel!”","WHAT?!","Wang Zhaole and Yang Hong were genuinely astonished.","A student?","And she suddenly became a colonel?","How many ranks did she skip?","Major, lieutenant colonel, and colonel... She skipped the first two ranks!"]},{"number":3139,"title":"Chapter 3139 Your Power","paragraphs":["3139 Your Power","She had skipped two ranks. Who on earth was she?","Wang Zhaole and Yang Hong looked at Yan Han in astonishment.","Yan Han was pleased to see their reaction and decided to say as many bad things about Feng Wu as she could.","She smiled bitterly. “How do you think that’s possible? I’ve asked my grandfather. Feng Wu doesn’t have any relatives among the elders.”","!!","“You’ve asked your grandfather already?” asked Wang Zhaole.","Yan Han hadn’t.","If she had, she wouldn’t have dared to offend Feng Wu.","However, she looked at Wang Zhaole and said seriously, “Yes, I’ve asked my grandfather. Feng Wu doesn’t have any connections. I think she probably gained all those points with her pretty face.”","“Her face? Do you mean...”","Yan Han gave them a “you know what I mean” look before walking past them. She then went to talk to other people.","Wang Zhaole and Yang Hong frowned at each other.","Somehow, they felt Yan Han was keeping something from them.","What a strange girl.","Meanwhile, Yang Zhihu had taken Feng Wu to his office.","Feng Wu felt rather guilty when she realized the entire colonels’ quarters had been turned upside down because of her, so she lowered her head and stood there, waiting to be told off.","“Sit.”","Feng Wu thought she was going to be punished, when the angry-looking man told her to sit down.","Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment.","“Please take a seat.” Yang Zhihu gestured at Feng Wu.","“Alright...” Feng Wu did as she was told.","Under the bright light, Yang Zhihu could finally see her face clearly.","She was prettier than a fairy. No wonder the crown prince was tempted. Yang Zhihu cleared his throat. He knew he couldn’t let it show because Elder Helian had told him to keep it a secret.","Feng Wu tilted her head and looked at the colonel known as the White Tiger in bewilderment.","He had been so impatient a moment ago, but somehow, he had become a little more friendly.","Yang Zhihu was trying to figure out what to do with the girl.","He asked, “How old are you?”","Feng Wu said, “14 and a half.”","Yang Zhihu said, “What? 14 and a half?!”","He had been swaying back and forth in his chair, but almost jumped to his feet when he heard this.","A 14-year-old colonel. This had to be a joke!","However, the crown prince was her patron; so be it. The crown prince himself had a higher rank when he was only ten.","Yang Zhihu asked, “Your cultivation level?”","After some thought, he added, “You don’t need to tell me if you don’t want to.”","How capable could a pretty 14-year-old be? Yang Zhihu didn’t expect to get an answer.","Most of the colonels were between Level 6 to Level 8 at the Spiritual King stage.","Of course, there were exceptions. Yan Han hadn’t reached Level 6 yet, but she still became a colonel because of her expertise in inscriptions.","Feng Wu asked earnestly, “Do you mean my actual level or my combat ability?”","Yang Zhihu asked, “Is there a difference?”","Feng Wu gave it some thought. “I’m a Level 5 Spiritual King, but I can defeat Level 6 Spiritual Kings in actual combat.”","Pffft!","Yang Zhihu almost spat out his tea.","“You? A Level 5 Spiritual King? And you can defeat Level 6 Spiritual Kings?”"]},{"number":3140,"title":"Chapter 3140 Girl, You’re Bragging","paragraphs":["3140 Girl, You’re Bragging","Yang Zhihu studied the girl carefully.","He had never heard a girl brag about herself with such a straight face.","“You...” Yang Zhihu tried to pick the right words so that he wouldn’t hurt her feelings.","“You... Forget t. Do you have any other specialties?” Yang Zhihu asked.","Surely, a girl would have some skills like singing or dancing.","Feng Wu tilted her head and asked, “Do you want to hear about everything I know?”","Yang Zhihu slapped his thigh. “Of course! Tell me everything!”","Feng Wu said, “Well, I have medical skills.”","Yang Zhihu’s eyes lit up. Medical skills? Good. Girls had nimble hands, so she could treat other people’s wounds in the future.","“Are you a medicine refiner?” Yang Zhihu asked carefully so that he wouldn’t hurt the girl.","“Yes, I am,” Feng Wu said solemnly. “I know a few things about medicine, and I’m a Semi-Divine medicine refiner now. Don’t worry. I’ll become a Divine medicine refiner in a few years.”","Thump!","Yang Zhihu’s forehead bumped into his desk so hard that he almost cracked his head open.","Many people already knew that, but they were mostly high-ranking officials.","For instance, Elder Helian and the elders who had gone to the Dayless Woods.","However, they wouldn’t gossip with the junior officers, so the news had never spread.","As a result, Yang Zhihu never heard about it.","“You...” Yang Zhihu pointed at Feng Wu, trying to say something.","He had been trying hard not to hurt the girl’s feelings, but she wouldn’t stop bragging. He didn’t know what to do.","Seeing that Feng Wu wanted to continue, he waved her off. “Let’s forget about being a medicine refiner. Do you have any other hobbies?”","Feng Wu said, “Well, I know formations. I’m a formation master.”","That could be very useful! Yang Zhihu asked excitedly, “Are you? That’s great! We need formation masters when fighting the Dongsang Kingdom. Do you know who Elder Mei is? He’s our best formation master! I’m sure you’re too young to know that. How foolish of me.","“Do you know what level Elder Mei is? Level 8!”","Feng Wu said, “I see.”","Yang Zhihu said, “I’ll have Elder Heng take you to Elder Mei. He can give you a few instructions, and you’ll improve a lot. But he’s always busy, so I don’t think he’ll have time. What’s your level now?”","If she was too weak, maybe Elder Mei wouldn’t help her, despite her relationship with the crown prince.","Feng Wu said, “I think I’m higher than Level 8.”","Yang Zhihu coughed.","Feng Wu gave him an innocent look.","Yang Zhihu didn’t know what to do.","The girl was stunning, but she was too good at bragging. He couldn’t take it anymore.","Yang Zhihu said, “Do you know anything else?”","Feng Wu said, “I know inscriptions, too.”","Yang Zhihu said, “Are you going to tell me you’re above Level 8 in inscriptions, too?”"]},{"number":3141,"title":"Chapter 3141 It’s Your Face","paragraphs":["3141 It’s Your Face","Feng Wu was amazed. “How did you know?”","What else could Yang Zhihu do?","“You...”","He wanted to say something else, but he waved at her in the end. “You can go now.”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you done?”","Yang Zhihu said, “Yes, I’m done. You can go now. You’ll be working in Team 2, and Wang Zhaole will be your captain. Go on.”","Feng Wu said, “I see.”","She went back to her living quarters.","She noticed many people were giving her strange looks.","Some even talked behind her back.","“I heard she... sleep around...”","“Level 2 Spiritual King... Her only way...”","“She doesn’t deserve...”","Feng Wu frowned. Somebody must have been making up stories about her again.","She would usually ignore them since with her capability, she would soon rise to a new level.","However, she was very hungry and very grumpy now, and she couldn’t stand such nonsense.","Two girls walking ahead of her were talking about her.","Feng Wu walked up to them and patted them on the shoulder. “Hey, you.”","Female members of the colonels’ quarters spent most of their time cultivating, and they didn’t look as pretty as the others.","The two young women were at least 20, and it had been a while since they graduated. They hadn’t been taking care of their skin, which was a little sallow, and their pores were rather large.","When they stood side by side with Feng Wu, the comparison was very cruel.","The two women were Han Lu and Gao Ya. Both colonels were Level 6 Spiritual Kings.","When they saw Feng Wu’s young, pretty face, they felt rather defeated, and their faces darkened.","Han Lu asked grimly, “Who are you talking to?”","Feng Wu rested her hands on her waist. “I’m talking to whoever’s been talking about me behind my back.”","She didn’t try to keep her voice down, and the colonels all had sharp ears. Not only did the passersby hear her, many people in their rooms also heard her as well.","At their level, they only focused on their cultivation, so they usually worked in their rooms and ignored the commotion outside.","However, everybody who wasn’t cultivating turned to see what was happening.","Han Lu smirked when she saw how unrestrained the newcomer was. “What? What did you hear?”","Feng Wu snorted. “You were saying bad things about me. Was I wrong?”","Han Lu said, “Yes, I said things. Why can’t I? Guys, she’s Feng Wu! She’s only a Level 2 Spiritual King, but she’s already a colonel. Isn’t that ridiculous?!”","Gao Ya chimed in. “That’s right. Why can’t we talk about you? Our questions are reasonable. Why don’t you tell us how you, a Level 2 Spiritual King, became a colonel?","“Is it because of your capability? No, it’s because of your face!”","A Level 2 Spiritual King?","Many people’s opinion of Feng Wu changed.","She was only a Level 2 Spiritual King?","That made sense. She couldn’t be more than 15; at her age, she had done a great job to reach that level."]},{"number":3142,"title":"Chapter 3142 Her Red Skirt Flapped in the Wind","paragraphs":["3142 Her Red Skirt Flapped in the Wind","The girl shouldn’t have come to the colonels’ quarters.","She didn’t belong here.","Seeing that no one said anything, Han Lu grew more arrogant.","She sneered at Feng Wu, despising the girl for using her beauty to get what she wanted.","“You’ve fallen quite low for your young age!” Han Lu continued. “I’m saying this for your own good. Be grateful!”","Gao Ya tugged at Han Lu’s sleeve. “Let’s go. She’s so young, but she’s already corrupt. Don’t waste your energy on her. She won’t listen to you.”","Wang Zhaole didn’t want to get involved, but the more he thought about what Yan Han said, the more uneasy he felt. He had come out of his room as soon as he heard the commotion outside.","Seeing Han Lu and Gao Ya picking on the new girl, Wang Zhaole frowned. Were the two veterans bullying the newcomer?","“What are you doing?” Wang Zhaole glared at Han Lu. “Are you bullying our new colleague?”","“Me? Bullying her?” Han Lu snorted. “Wang Zhaole, are you taking her side because she’s pretty? She’s only a Level 2 Spiritual King! Why does she think she can be a colonel like us?","“I won’t have it! We worked so hard to gain badges and essence crystals. We earned every single point we redeemed! We shed tears and blood for everything we earned. Rising to our current position nearly cost us our lives!","“What about her? Her capability is a joke! She has the same rank as us because she’s pretty, she’s a sweet-talker, and she doesn’t mind sleeping around! That’s why she’s here! Do you think that’s fair?!”","One had to admit what Han Lu said was quite contagious.","When she shouted at the top of her lungs, many people around her sympathized with her.","They were all from ordinary families and had only earned this life because they had worked hard for it. However, this girl had everything handed to her on a plate because of her pretty face!","Even Wang Zhaole hesitated a little.","Feng Wu looked even calmer than usual, and her voice didn’t sound disturbed either.","She stared at Han Lu and asked, “Who told you I’m a Level 2 Spiritual King?”","Han Lu smirked. “That’s not important. What’s important is I’m already doing you a favor by calling you a Level 2 Spiritual King...”","She never finished her sentence.","Suddenly, Feng Wu changed at her like a pouncing tiger.","She clenched her fist and punched Han Lu in the face.","The noise sounded like a meteorite crashing into the ground.","Thump!","“Ah!”","“Sh*t!”","No one knew how Feng Wu did it.","All they saw was Feng Wu charging forward and exerting an irresistible force.","The impact made everybody stumble backward.","Han Lu flew back when the fist hit her.","The force destroyed all the plants she crashed into, and she didn’t stop until she was hundreds of meters away.","Everyone was speechless.","Their eyes widened.","Even Han Lu didn’t know what had happened.","Gao Ya was the first to react.","“Han Lu!”","She screamed and ran to Han Lu’s side.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was also walking toward Han Lu.","The hem of her red skirt flapped in the wind."]},{"number":3143,"title":"Chapter 3143 The Crown Prince’s Favorite Girl","paragraphs":["3143 The Crown Prince’s Favorite Girl","There was no expression on her beautiful face.","Her black eyes could chill one to the bone.","Wang Zhaole shivered when he looked at Feng Wu.","The girl was a little scary.","!!","Feng Wu didn’t stop. Instead, she slowly marched toward Han Lu.","Han Lu lay in Gao Ya’s arms and stared at Feng Wu as the latter moved closer. When she tried to say something, she spat out a mouthful of blood.","The others followed Feng Wu, but they were also scared of her murderous energy.","Yan Han’s stomach lurched when she saw Feng Wu’s expressionless face.","This girl...","How could she defeat Han Lu?","Han Lu was a Level 6 Spiritual King.","Yan Han felt a little dizzy. She put a hand over her heart and found it beating fast.","Feng Wu’s red dress looked like it was on fire, and her murderous energy kept people from moving closer.","“What are you doing?” Gao Ya saw a shadow approaching, and when she looked up, Feng Wu was in front of her. Gao Ya panicked.","Feng Wu knew there was no need to talk to this woman.","She picked Gao Ya up without another word.","Gao Ya screamed in a fluster.","Feng Wu smirked. Picking up Gao Ya with one hand, she punched Gao Ya’s stomach with the other.","“Did you call me a Level 2 Spiritual King?","“I’m only a pretty face, aren’t I?","“You also said I sleep around, didn’t you?","“Keep talking now. Why did you stop?!”","With each question, Feng Wu punched Gao Ya once.","Each time, Gao Ya thought she was going to faint.","A Level 2 Spiritual King?","Bullsh*t!","No Level 2 Spiritual King could do this to a Level 6 Spiritual King!","Everybody was watching Feng Wu. Somehow, it felt like Feng Wu was punching them as well.","Before long, it began to rain.","The pouring rain soon became a storm.","Everybody was soaked, but no one dared walk away.","Feng Wu was still punching Gao Ya.","“Do you know how important a girl’s reputation is? What you said could erase all her hard work!","“You’re so evil!","“I’m gonna kill you!”","She punched Gao Ya over and over again.","Gao Ya was spitting out blood and almost lost consciousness.","Yan Han’s heart sank when she saw this. She stiffened, and a chill ran down her spine.","Somehow, it felt like Feng Wu was punching her.","“Who told you I’m a Level 2 Spiritual King?” Feng Wu asked the key question. “Tell me!”","“It was... Yan...” Gao Ya fainted before finishing the sentence.","Someone arrived at that moment.","It was Yang Zhihu.","His eyes popped when he saw this.","Feng Wu’s ‘bragging’ had given him a headache. He thought he would skip his practice and call it a night.","Before his head hit the pillow, Wang Zhaole rushed into his room and told him that Feng Wu was fighting someone.","If it were any other person, Yang Zhihu wouldn’t bother, but it was Feng Wu.","She was the crown prince’s favorite girl!","The girl was only a Level 2 Spiritual King!","OMG!","Yang Zhihu suddenly wasn’t sleepy anymore."]},{"number":3144,"title":"Chapter 3144 She Wasn’t Fighting","paragraphs":["3144 She Wasn’t Fighting","He couldn’t imagine what would happen if the girl was injured.","Yang Zhihu was usually a very stern colonel, but now, he threw on some clothes and rushed out of his room.","When he finally arrived at the scene and pushed through the crowd, what did he see?","A person was leaning against a bent tree with blood all over her clothes. Her eyes were filled with fear. That was Han Lu.","!!","Another person was standing there, holding something in her hand. No, it wasn’t a thing. It was a person.","Feng Wu was punching Gao Ya so hard that the latter was barely breathing.","Yang Zhihu then looked at Feng Wu.","The girl looked so intimidating in her red dress.","She turned around and smiled at Yang Zhihu.","Yang Zhihu felt like he was under the gaze of an eagle or a wolf.","How frightening!","There was a smear of blood on her fair cheek, and some had even splashed onto her eyelashes. She looked as scary as a ghost.","“Feng Wu!” Yang Zhihu bellowed.","Hearing his voice, Feng Wu seemed to wake up from a trance-like state. She swayed and fell to the ground.","Yang Zhihu managed to catch her in time.","However, Gao Ya, who was in Feng Wu’s hand, fell to the ground.","Yang Zhihu didn’t know what to do.","He yelled at Wang Zhaole, “Help Feng Wu!”","Only then did the others seem to wake up. Some went to fetch a medicine refiner, and some helped the wounded.","However, when they looked at one another, they all saw fear in each other’s eyes.","Feng Wu’s outburst had successfully intimidated everybody.","Her actions had been more useful than any words.","A Level 2 Spiritual King?","Feng Wu had proven she could beat up a Level 6 Spiritual King.","If one had to be a Level 6 Spiritual King to become a colonel, now that Feng Wu had demonstrated she could beat up a Level 6 Spiritual King, no one would think she had come here based solely on her pretty face.","She was ferocious...","When the others thought about how Feng Wu had turned Gao Ya into a punching bag, they were all chilled to the bone.","As for Yan Han...","She had been frightened to tears, and no one knew where she was.","A medicine refiner?","Everybody thought Dongfang Ziyun was the most capable medicine refiner in the fortress.","Therefore, Yang Zhihu told Yang Hong to get Dongfang Ziyun here to check on Feng Wu. He didn’t want anything to happen to the girl.","While they were waiting for Dongfang Ziyun to come, Yang Zhihu finally had time to ask what happened.","Wang Zhaole hesitated before describing the entire incident.","Yang Zhihu was astonished.","“She can fight two Level 6 Spiritual Kings at once?!”","Wang Zhaole felt that wasn’t the most important thing. Shouldn’t Yang Zhihu be asking how Feng Wu managed to beat up those two people?","Yang Zhihu stared at Wang Zhaole. “Is that true? Did she fight those two people together?”","Wang Zhaole squeezed his nose bridge. “To be more precise, she beat them both up.”","Yang Zhihu said, “Isn’t that what I meant?”","Wang Zhaole said, “It’s not. Mr. Yang, Feng Wu didn’t have a fight. It was a one-sided beating.","“She could crush those two people with one finger. They couldn’t deliver even one strike before she beat them up.","“Han Lu went flying all the way over there, and she turned Gao Ya into a punching bag...”"]},{"number":3145,"title":"Chapter 3145 The Starving, Unconscious Girl","paragraphs":["3145 The Starving, Unconscious Girl","“Mr. Yang, exactly what is Miss Feng Wu’s level?” Wang Zhaole asked curiously.","Yang Zhihu didn’t know the answer either, so he said, “Why hasn’t Miss Dongfang arrived? Tell her to hurry up.”","Just then, Yang Hong arrived with a little old man.","Seeing that it wasn’t Dongfang Ziyun, Yang Zhihu frowned and stared at Yang Hong.","!!","Yang Hong smiled bitterly. “I went to see her and politely asked for her help, but Miss Dongfang said she was still unwell and couldn’t help anybody else. And... and...”","Yang Zhihu said, “And what?”","Yang Hong said, “She mocked Feng Wu.”","Yang Zhihu stared at Yang Hong.","Yang Hong shook his head. “Miss Dongfang said, ‘Doesn’t Feng Wu claim that she’s a Semi-Divine medicine refiner? Tell her to cure herself.’”","Yang Zhihu frowned. “Double the fee. Won’t she come for that?”","Yang Hong said, “She said she would only come if we return essence crystal mine No. 3.","“I asked around and found out Miss Dongfang was also injured by Feng Wu.”","Yang Zhihu was speechless.","He opened his mouth to say something, but no sound came out.","What could he say?","Nothing.","“Master Fu is a step away from the Supreme level. Shall we let him take a look at Xiao Wu?” asked Yang Hong.","What choice did Yang Zhihu have?","He could only move aside and let Master Fu do his job.","Seeing Master Fu check Feng Wu’s pulse, Yang Zhihu was greatly worried.","Why did the Military Academy have a Supreme Level medicine refiner, while Master Fu was the best they had? They were inferior to their opponent.","Every time somebody in Imperial College was severely injured, they had to ask for Dongfang Ziyun’s help.","In the eyes of someone as straightforward as Yang Zhihu, Dongfang Ziyun was too arrogant. All the flattery had only made her more unreasonable.","However, she was the only Supreme Level medicine refiner, and Imperial College had no choice but to beg for her help and pay a large fee every time. How frustrating!","When would Master Fu become a Supreme Level medicine refiner? Yang Zhihu hoped it would happen as soon as possible.","Meanwhile, Master Fu had finished examining Feng Wu.","“How’s she doing?”","Yang Zhihu asked the question as soon as Master Fu stood up.","Master Fu gave Yang Zhihu an indecipherable look.","Yang Zhihu was scared and grabbed Master Fu. “Has she caught something incurable? Master Fu, say something!”","Master Fu felt Yang Zhihu throttling him.","“No, it’s nothing like that,” said Master Fu. “She’s fine.”","Yang Zhihu frowned. “Why did she pass out? What’s wrong with her?”","Yang Zhihu gave Yang Zhihu a strange look.","What was wrong with her?","Her veins were as strong as a tiger’s, and her spiritual essence was flowing in her energy channel like surging waves. What could possibly be wrong with her?","Master Fu shook his head. “She’s in perfect condition.”","Yang Zhihu asked, “Why did she pass out?”","Master Fu said, “You would pass out, too, if you haven’t eaten for over ten days.”","Yang Zhihu said, “Do you mean...”","Master Fu said, “She passed out because she’s starving!”","He then gathered his things and was ready to leave.","He had already been in bed when someone dragged him out. He thought it would be someone with an incurable disease, but the girl just needed food."]},{"number":3146,"title":"Chapter 3146 Life Is So Hard","paragraphs":["3146 Life Is So Hard","Master Fu cast a stern look at Yang Zhihu. “White Tiger, be careful when you punish people in the future. I can’t believe you can do this to a pretty girl!”","Yang Zhihu didn’t know what to do.","He hadn’t done anything!","However, he was known for his short temper; no wonder he was blamed for this.","!!","After Feng Wu was examined, Yang Zhihu had the almost-Supreme-Level medicine refiner check the two unfortunate women who had been beaten up by Feng Wu.","Wang Zhaole stole a glance at Yang Zhihu.","Their boss had always been tough, and saving face was his biggest concern. Feng Wu had created some major trouble this time, and Wang Zhaole was worried Yang Zhihu would scold Feng Wu again when she woke up.","Wang Zhaole gave Feng Wu a sympathetic glance and hoped she wouldn’t wake up too soon.","Yang Zhihu saw the girl had moved around in bed and her arms were outside the blanket. Fearing that she would catch a cold, Yang Zhihu tucked the blanket around her neck.","He then told Wang Zhaole, “Fetch some hot porridge.”","After some thought, he added, “Bring the stove here, too. I don’t want the porridge to get cold.”","Wang Zhaole was surprised. What happened to his boss?","He soon decided his boss wanted to feed the girl before lashing out at her.","Poor girl...","Wang Zhaole was filled with sympathy and went to make the porridge himself.","No one expected a little girl to beat up her two senior sisters. Wang Zhaole knew he wouldn’t want to offend her.","Seeing Wang Zhaole cooking over the stove, Yan Han moved closer and asked, “Zhaole, why are you making porridge?”","Wang Zhaole shrugged. “Colonel Yang told me to make this for the girl.”","Yan Han frowned. She hoped Yang Zhihu would send Feng Wu away.","If that girl stayed here...","“Cooking isn’t for guys. Let me help you.” Yan Han rolled up her sleeves and wanted to take over.","Wang Zhaole recalled the way Yan Han talked to everybody about Feng Wu, and Han Lu and Gao Ya had only behaved that way because of Yan Han.","The thought made his stomach lurch.","He involuntarily said, “That’s fine. Making porridge isn’t hard. I can do it myself.”","Yan Han looked like an abandoned puppy. “Zhaole, do you think I started the whole thing? I just want to do something to express how sorry I am. I didn’t know Feng Wu would hit them so hard.”","Wang Zhaole looked at her in astonishment.","Shouldn’t she feel sorry for urging people to slander Feng Wu behind her back?","Why did she make it sound like it was Feng Wu’s fault?","Wang Zhaole’s face darkened, and he turned Yan Han down. “Colonel Yang told me to make some porridge, and I have to be the one to make it. If something goes wrong, will you take the blame?”","Wang Zhaole had never been so serious before, and Yan Han’s heart sank. She said meekly, “What could go wrong? Zhaole, is that what you think of me?”","Yan Han burst into tears.","She buried her face in her hands and ran off.","Wang Zhaole was baffled and wondered if it was something he had said.","Yang Hong smacked him on the shoulder. “Did you make her cry?”","Wang Zhaole was dumbfounded. “I barely said anything to her...”","Why was life so hard?"]},{"number":3147,"title":"Chapter 3147 The Girl Who Eats a Lot","paragraphs":["3147 The Girl Who Eats a Lot","Yang Zhihu was already quite frustrated. He put his hands behind his back and stared out the window. He was going to reprimand the girl when she woke up. She needed to know she couldn’t mess around in the colonels’ quarters, even if the crown prince was her patron.","He turned around when he heard movement behind him.","The girl stuck her head out of the blanket like a cute bunny.","For the first time in his life, Yang Zhihu knew what “cute” meant.","He told himself to stay unaffected because he was supposed to reprimand her.","The girl rubbed her eyes with her fair hands before putting her hands over her stomach and sitting up.","She still felt weak, so she only stuck her head out, showing off her fair skin, exquisite chin, and her cheeks that still had some baby fat on them. The innocent and bewildered look on her face made one want to squeeze her adorable cheeks.","Seeing the girl’s round little head, Yang Zhihu realized his anger had completely disappeared. The girl was simply too lovely.","She pouted and rubbed her stomach as she looked at him with an innocent look on her face. It was as if he was the only person who could help her.","Yang Zhihu was nearly 30 years old and had just begun to develop a paternal instinct. He had a soft spot for adorable girls.","...","He couldn’t bring himself to say anything harsh to her.","He had to put on a stern look as he stared at Feng Wu. “You’re awake.”","Feng Wu recalled what happened before she passed out: She had beaten up two people who had been talking behind her back.","She wondered how strict the military rules were.","She could mention Elder Helian’s name, but she wasn’t the kind of idiot who couldn’t live without a patron. She was an independent girl. She would do everything on her own!","Feng Wu’s eyes darted around, and she knew what to do.","“Hungry?” Yang Zhihu stared at the girl and asked sternly.","Feng Wu looked at Yang Zhihu with her bright eyes and nodded.","Wang Zhaole heard their conversation and came in with a bowl of porridge.","Yang Zhihu wanted to scold Feng Wu, but when he saw the look on her face, his anger disappeared right away.","He beckoned Wang Zhaole over and gestured at him, telling him to give the porridge to Feng Wu.","...","Feng Wu took the bowl and finished the porridge in one go.","Her bold gesture wasn’t something a pretty girl would do.","Yang Zhihu felt that even he didn’t eat that way.","Feng Wu wiped her mouth and looked eagerly at Yang Zhihu. It was obvious what she wanted.","Having no choice, Yang Zhihu glanced at Wang Zhaole.","Wang Zhaole ran out of the room and got Feng Wu another bowl of porridge.","Feng Wu finished it in one go again.","Yang Zhihu wanted to laugh. The girl was pouring porridge down her throat like she was drinking wine.","Feng Wu was still hungry.","Yang Zhihu said, “Let her have it. Let’s see when she’ll be full.”","When Yang Zhihu sent Wang Zhaole to make the porridge, he had given the latter special permission to use the black rice in the storage room.","...","Wang Zhaole had also added the meat of a magical beast to the porridge, as well as an entire essence crystal.","The essence crystal was the size of an egg and came from Elder Heng.","Ordinary people couldn’t withstand that kind of energy and would die from their energy channels exploding.","Yang Zhihu watched as Feng Wu finished one bowl after another.","The stack of bowls now towered above her head, but she still wanted more.","In the end, she finished the whole pot, which was enough to feed Wang Zhaole’s entire team."]},{"number":3148,"title":"Chapter 3148 A New Cultivation Path","paragraphs":["3148 A New Cultivation Path","To feed the girl, Wang Zhaole went to the canteen in the colonels’ quarters and brought back the porridge that was meant for all the colonels.","However...","The girl proved she had a bigger appetite than they had expected.","Ten bowls.","100 bowls.","200 bowls.","Yang Zhihu and Wang Zhaole looked at each other with wide eyes.","How much more could she eat?","Feng Wu was equally surprised.","What happened to her? Why couldn’t she feel full? Everything she ate was immediately consumed by her dantian.","...","Take this porridge for example.","When she ate it, the useful spiritual essence was immediately absorbed by her dantian, while the rest was crushed and discarded.","She could feel the spiritual essence increasing in her dantian.","The speed was incredible.","Each bowl didn’t provide her with much energy, but it accumulated over time. She knew she had become an intermediate Level 5 Spiritual King.","She had been a junior before passing out.","Was she able to increase her cultivation level by eating?","While Feng Wu was surprised by her special ability, Yang Zhihu was shocked by her appetite.","In the end, Yang Zhihu was blown away.","He stammered, “Are... Are you full yet?”","The girl looked at him with puppy eyes and shook her head repeatedly.","...","Still no?","Yang Zhihu really wanted to cry.","Feng Wu licked her lips and said meekly, “The second batch of porridge tastes better.”","The batch she meant had more essence crystals in it and was prepared for colonels between Level 6 and Level 8.","Yang Zhihu didn’t know how to express his feelings right now because one couldn’t absorb spiritual essence infinitely.","A cultivator could only ingest a limited amount of spiritual essence every day. If they crossed the threshold, their veins would explode, if their bodies didn’t explode first.","The girl had ingested far more spiritual essence than an ordinary cultivator could.","“Are you sure you’re alright?” Yang Zhihu frowned.","Feng Wu said, “I’m hungry...”","Yang Zhihu said, “No, you can’t eat anymore. You’ll explode. Be a good girl.”","Feng Wu lowered her head in disappointment. “Alright...”","...","Yang Zhihu fought back the impulse to rub her little head.","“Get some rest. Join us when you’ve recovered.”","Yang Zhihu left after that.","He was gone.","Even he had forgotten he had waited here for so long because he wanted to reprimand her when she woke up.","Yang Zhihu met someone shortly after he left the room.","“Mr. Yang.”","It was Yan Han.","Yang Zhihu smiled at her. “Yan Han, what are you doing here? It’s late. You should go to bed.”","He walked away after that, but Yan Han followed him.","She bit her lip as if she had been wronged.","...","“Mr. Yang, I’m here to confess.”","“Confess?” Yang Zhihu looked at her in bewilderment.","Yan Han said, “They were talking about Feng Wu before, saying she became a colonel because of her connections, and they didn’t like that. I said something bad about her, too...”","Yang Zhihu waved her off. “That’s it? Don’t worry about it.”","Yan Han said, “It was my fault. I shouldn’t have said those things about her, even if she came here because she pulled some strings. I...”","Yang Zhihu laughed. “Don’t worry about it. You’re the only one here who’s not qualified to be a colonel; Elder Yan is the only reason you’re here.”"]},{"number":3149,"title":"Chapter 3149 She’s a Genius!","paragraphs":["3149 She’s a Genius!","Yang Zhihu laughed. “Don’t worry about it. You’re the only one here who’s not qualified to be a colonel; Elder Yan is the only reason you’re here.”","Yan Han’s expression froze.","Was Yang Zhihu mocking her?","However, that didn’t seem to be the case when she looked at his earnest smile.","She could only grit her teeth and change the subject. “Feng Wu’s real level is...”","Yang Zhihu lost his temper when he heard that.","His face darkened, and he said angrily, “I don’t know who spread the rumor that she’s a Level 2 Spiritual King. That’s so misleading! If I find out who it was, I’ll kick their ass!”","Yan Han felt a chill run down her spine.","However, she stayed by Yang Zhihu’s side because she still wanted to slander Feng Wu.","“But she behaved like a Level 2 Spiritual King two weeks ago in the junior arena. She only just made a breakthrough before that. I’ve asked around. That’s the truth.”","...","Yang Zhihu shook his head. “It’s like you said. That was two weeks ago.”","Yan Han stared at him.","Yang Zhihu put his hands behind his back. He looked troubled, but he sounded like he was bragging.","“You have no idea. That girl is a genius!”","Yan Han wanted to leave because she had a feeling that she didn’t want to hear the next part.","She smiled bitterly. “Mr. Yang, I...”","However, Yang Zhihu had become excited and wouldn’t let her leave.","He complained to Yan Han, “You have no idea how fast she’s been making progress. She only joined the War Academy six months ago. Do you know how many ranks she has skipped?”","Once he started, he couldn’t stop.","While Feng Wu was unconscious, he had gone to ask Elder Helian.","When Elder Helian showed him Feng Wu’s school report, Yang Zhihu couldn’t believe his eyes.","...","Seeing that Yan Han had the same reaction and the same dark face, Yang Zhihu felt the satisfaction of inflicting his pain on other people.","They hadn’t had much time, so Elder Helian didn’t say much.","Yang Zhihu could tell that Elder Helian still had more to say, but he made an excuse and left.","If he listened any longer, he felt his cultivation would be affected.","Yan Han wanted to bury her head in her hands. She didn’t want to hear it.","However, she was supposed to be a sympathetic princess, so she could only smile and try to change the subject. “I guess Feng Wu is very impressive, but she injured Han Lu and Gao Ya so severely. According to the military rules...”","According to the rules, she would be whipped at least 80 times, which could kill her.","Yang Zhihu said sternly, “Someone will be punished. There’s no doubt about it. I won’t let this kind of behavior continue!”","Yan Han heaved a sigh of relief.","Believing she had achieved her goal, she said goodbye to Yang Zhihu and left as fast as she could.","After she was gone, Wang Zhaole arrived in a hurry. “Mr. Yang, it’s Feng Wu...”","...","Yang Zhihu frowned. “What now?”","“She’s still hungry.” Wang Zhaole smiled awkwardly.","After some thought, Yang Zhihu took a handful of essence crystals out of his pocket. He hesitated, then handed Wang Zhaole an entire pouch. “She can have them all.”","Wang Zhaole said, “But you’ve been saving them for so long...”"]},{"number":3150,"title":"Chapter 3150 How Much Can a Girl Eat?","paragraphs":["3150 How Much Can a Girl Eat?","Did Yang Zhihu want to give them away?","Of course not. He had been saving them for a long while.","However, he couldn’t starve the girl either.","Therefore, Yang Zhihu told Wang Zhaole, “Use them all. We have to feed the kid.”","“Alright,” said Wang Zhaole.","“Wait.” Yang Zhihu stopped Wang Zhaole before the latter left. “Don’t tell anyone about Feng Wu’s appetite. We don’t want to damage her reputation.”","He wondered if the crown prince knew about this.","Yang Zhihu had just sat down, when Wang Zhaole returned.","Yang Zhihu asked, “Shouldn’t you be taking care of Feng Wu?”","“Well...” Wang Zhaole had an indescribable look on his face.","Yang Zhihu asked, “Has something happened to the girl? Is she alright?”","Wang Zhaole said, “Well...”","Yang Zhihu slapped his desk. “Speak!”","Wang Zhaole said, “She’s finished everything. She absorbed all the essence crystals you gave me...”","Pffft!","Yang Zhihu almost spat out a mouthful of blood.","It had taken him a year to accumulate all those essence crystals! What a wasteful girl!","He felt like dropping to his knees and begging her to stop.","Wang Zhaole asked, “What should we do now? The girl still says she’s hungry.”","Yang Zhihu was glad he never promised to feed the girl until she was full.","“You can go now. I’ll take care of it.”","After sending Wang Zhaole away, Yang Zhihu paced up and down the room.","What should he do now?","He couldn’t starve the kid, but he couldn’t afford the expense either.","He had no choice but to talk to Elder Heng.","Elder Heng was shocked. “Really?”","Yang Zhihu nodded. “Yes. She can’t stop eating. It’s as if her stomach has turned into a bottomless pit, and all the food just disappears. We don’t have enough essence crystals to give her!”","Elder Heng rubbed his chin. “We didn’t have enough before, but maybe that’s no longer the case. After all, she won us an essence crystal mine.","“However, we’ll need Elder Helian’s permission first.”","Hence, Yang Zhihu and Elder Heng went to see Elder Helian together.","Elder Helian was a very stingy man!","But he immediately said yes when he learned the essence crystals were for Feng Wu. “Of course she can have them! She can take as many as she needs! There’s no limit!”","Yang Zhihu wanted to remind his superior that the decision would cost him a lot.","He couldn’t be too explicit, and the remainder was quite subtle.","However, Elder Helian didn’t think much of it. “How much energy can a girl absorb? Don’t be so stingy!”","Stingy?!","Yang Zhihu nearly fainted.","He asked gingerly, “Did Miss Feng Wu have such a big appetite before?”","Elder Helian said, “Did she? I’ve never heard anything about it.”","Yang Zhihu’s stomach sank. Did she become this way because she fought with some girls in the colonels’ quarters? Did that make it an injury she had suffered on the job?","Elder Helian gave Yang Zhihu a token. “Take this and get the essence crystals from mine No. 3. It’s guarded by Elder Wu.”","Yang Zhihu said, “I’ll probably need a lot.”","Elder Helian waved him off, not taking the reminder seriously.","A lot? How much could a girl eat?"]},{"number":3151,"title":"Chapter 3151 Patrol the Territory","paragraphs":["3151 Patrol the Territory","When Yang Zhihu saw Feng Wu chewing essence crystals as if they were sweets, he was glad he never promised to feed her until she was full.","The first time he went to mine No. 3, he came back with a handful of essence crystals.","A handful was more than it sounded because it could provide enough energy for an elder to cultivate for a month.","However, Feng Wu carried the small bag of essence crystals around and snacked on it wherever she went. The essence crystals were soon gone.","Yang Zhihu had to get more.","Elder Wu was displeased to see Yang Zhihu, but he still gave the latter more because they were for Feng Wu.","The new batch lasted longer, but not too much. They were gone in two days.","Feng Wu soon finished this batch.","Yang Zhihu wondered if Feng Wu really saw them as a snack.","Why hadn’t her energy channels exploded?","It was a miracle.","In the end, Yang Zhihu couldn’t stand it anymore. He took Feng Wu to mine No.3 and showed her inside. Most of the essence crystals in the mine had been used up already. He asked Feng Wu, “Do you want to find your food yourself?”","Feng Wu was speechless. Did this man think she was some kind of baby and would lie on the ground, chewing on the rocks?","Still, it was a great idea.","She didn’t need any token. All she needed was to show up.","All the elders knew Feng Wu had taken the mine from Elder Dongfang after outwitting the latter.","Led by Elder Helian, Imperial College had been a rather poor institute.","They only had two mines now.","Only the elders and a couple of their best students were qualified to cultivate in the mines.","The first mine they had could hardly be called a mine. It was less than 100 meters long. There were over a dozen elders in Peace Grassland, and the place was packed when they all entered. It was such an embarrassing scene.","It didn’t look like cultivation at all.","Luckily, Feng Wu obtained mine No.3 for them. The first 200 meters had been drained, and half a dozen elders were scattered in the last 100 meters.","They were all cultivating and didn’t notice Feng Wu.","Elder Wu was filled with emotion when he saw Feng Wu.","The first time they met was a month ago.","Back then, he thought Feng Wu was only doing a little better than the other students. Although her talent was rare, it wasn’t unique in Imperial College.","However, what happened next proved him wrong.","The girl had done amazing things in the competition against the Military Academy, in the junior arena and in the Dayless Woods, and had won them a mine. He thought he had seen everything, but she still amazed him.","Elder Wu no longer treated Feng Wu as a junior cultivator. If he could, he would enshrine her.","“Feng Wu, I didn’t know you were coming! Come in!”","Yang Zhihu had been trying to find an excuse to get Feng Wu inside, but he was surprised by Elder Wu’s reaction.","Elder Wu was supposed to treat everyone in an indifferent manner!","Feng Wu walked inside, still chewing on essence crystals. This was the first time she had seen the mine since she won it from Elder Dongfang.","“It’s on the smaller side.” Feng Wu walked next to Elder Wu as if she was patrolling her own territory."]},{"number":3152,"title":"Chapter 3152 How Wonderful","paragraphs":["3152 How Wonderful","“It’s on the smaller side.” Feng Wu walked next to Elder Wu as if she was patrolling her own territory.","Elder Wu told Feng Wu, “It’s big enough. The first one is only 100 meters long. The Military Academy has been using this one for many years, but there are still 100 meters left.”","Feng Wu studied the unexploited section and realized there was only a thin layer of essence crystals. There wasn’t much left.","She put a hand on her stomach, her face turning pale.","Elder Wu asked in concern, “What’s wrong?”","Just then, they heard familiar footsteps outside. It was Elder Helian.","Seeing Feng Wu, Elder Helian went up to her in a hurry. “Kiddo, what’s wrong? Are you not feeling well?”","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “I’m starving.”","Elder Helian said, “That sounds so serious! What happened? Why are you suddenly unwell?”","Being a Semi-Divine medicine refiner, Feng Wu knew herself better than anyone else.","She couldn’t figure it out at first, but after analyzing herself for the past two days, she finally knew what was going on.","She said, “Ultimately, it’s because I made too many breakthroughs in such a short time. When I passed out from starvation, some of my hidden symptoms flared up.”","She rubbed her forehead. “I made too much progress in the past year.","“I started off as a Spiritual Master a year ago, and I’m a Level 5 Spiritual King now.","“My level has been rising, but I’ve been stretching out my spiritual essence.","“It’s like when a person grows too fast until their nutrition can’t keep up with that speed. In the end, something serious is bound to happen.","“My hunger for spiritual essence now is in response to my past deficiency.","“I simply need too much spiritual essence. It seems I’ll never be able to eat enough.”","Feng Wu raised her head to find everybody staring at her in astonishment, including Elder Helian, Elder Wu, and Yang Zhihu.","Even the elders who had been cultivating in the mine had stopped what they were doing, and were looking at her silently.","No one spoke, and the mine became dead silent.","She wasn’t showing off, which was even worse.","Feng Wu asked, “Are you alright?”","Elder Helian wanted to leave.","Was she even human?","How could she do all that?","These elders were already outstanding cultivators, but Feng Wu’s words were still such a hard blow to them, let alone other people.","Feng Wu said, “Hm...”","She wondered if she had said something wrong.","She said, “I’m so hungry...”","Elder Helian sighed. “Go ahead. You won this mine; you can have as much as you want.”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “Really?”","Elder Helian said, “That’s right. How many essence crystals can you use, anyway?”","He knew the monthly consumption of Spiritual Overlords. Feng Wu was only a Spiritual King, so how much could she need?","Elder Helian wasn’t worried at all.","“She can’t use more than a thousand,” thought Elder Helian.","But...","Crack...","When Feng Wu sat down with her legs crossed, the essence crystals within a meter of her began to crack, as if they were drained of energy.","Crack...","The range expanded to two meters around her, and the ground looked like a spiderweb now.","Crack...","...","Elder Helian’s face turned green.","The range had expanded to five meters.","He suddenly rose to his feet and couldn’t look away. As for Yang Zhihu..."]},{"number":3153,"title":"Chapter 3153 Group of Eight","paragraphs":["3153 Group of Eight","Elder Helian didn’t know how to react.","Feng Wu seemed to have turned into an essence crystal vacuum cleaner.","She was consuming essence crystals like a tornado!","Yang Zhihu stole a glance at Elder Helian before looking at Feng Wu, who was oblivious. He thought, “I knew this was going to happen. Elder Helian is so jumpy.”","!!","He thought he knew everything about Feng Wu, but he soon grew uneasy because...","Crack...","That range had expanded to ten meters, and the ground cracked even further.","Normal essence crystals were white with a pale-green tint, which was the color of the spiritual essence within.","However, the essence crystals on the ground had become...","Elder Wu grabbed a handful and showed it to Elder Helian, who sensed the spiritual essence within.","There was nothing left. The crystals had all been drained.","There wasn’t a trace left.","That was to say, the essence crystals beneath the cracked ground had all become useless.","They were no different from ordinary stones. The only function they had now was as building material.","Elder Helian watched Feng Wu with a pleading look in his eyes.","He crossed his fingers and hoped the girl could leave some for the other members of the school.","20 meters...","50 meters...","...","Elder Helian didn’t have much hope left.","The other elders were all stunned.","That was incredible.","What kind of creature was this girl?","Her absorption rate...","“Won’t she explode?” Elder Wu licked his dry lips and asked Elder Helian in bewilderment.","The other elders were equally confused.","Elder Helian said in frustration, “How am I supposed to know?!”","Yang Zhihu licked his lips and wondered if the colonels’ quarters would need to pay for this loss. After all, Feng Wu was one of them now.","While everybody was transfixed, they heard approaching footsteps.","They sounded quite familiar.","Elder Helian looked up to see some old acquaintances.","It was Elder Dongfang, the last person Elder Helian wanted to see at the moment.","Because the wound on Dongfang Ziyun’s neck still hadn’t healed, Elder Dongfang wanted to take her to the essence crystal mine, where Dongfang Ziyun could use the spiritual essence to heal her wound.","The elders weren’t exactly happy with Dongfang Ziyun, but she was the only Supreme Level medicine refiner that they knew of and who could be used against Imperial College. Because of that, they didn’t say anything.","After Dongfang Ziyun circulated the spiritual essence in her system, her treatment was over for the day. Elder Dongfang was ready to leave.","However, Dongfang Ziyun insisted on going to mine no. 3 when she heard Feng Wu was there.","Elder Dongfang couldn’t change her mind, so she took her niece there to have a look.","They were currently in mine no. 2, and six other elders were cultivating here.","Three of them used to cultivate in mine no. 3 and now had to squeeze into mine no. 2 after no. 3 became Imperial College’s. Because of that, the three of them were quite displeased.","Hearing that Elder Dongfang was going to no. 3, they decided to go with her for sentimental reasons.","After that, the other three elders decided to tag along.","Hence, the group of eight went on a one-day trip to mine no. 3."]},{"number":3154,"title":"Chapter 3154 Frustration","paragraphs":["3154 Frustration","The two mines weren’t too far apart, and the elders arrived at their destination within 15 minutes.","When they arrived, Feng Wu was breaking the mine apart.","The ground beneath her was cracking, and the cracks were expanding in all directions.","It already looked like a spiderweb and reminded one of when Jun Linyuan farted repeatedly.","!!","Feng Wu had no idea she was absorbing spiritual essence like a vacuum cleaner. Seeing this, Elder Helian thought his heart was going to stop.","His face drained of all color, and he put a hand over his chest.","He was going to pass out.","However, his old enemy arrived at that moment.","Elder Dongfang stood on the edge and looked down at the people in the mine.","The mine was essentially a pit, and Elder Dongfang could see everything happening inside.","She saw the elders sitting there in bewilderment, while Feng Wu was sitting in another spot all by herself. As for the ground of the mine...","Dongfang Ziyun had been so weak that she couldn’t walk around without her aunt’s help. However, she grew excited when she saw this.","“Aunt!”","Her shriek was quite harsh.","Elder Dai glanced at Dongfang Ziyun in bewilderment. She had seemed too weak to speak only a moment ago. Why was she so loud now?","Dongfang Ziyun was over the moon because she thought she had found a way to defeat Feng Wu.","“Aunt!” Dongfang Ziyun grabbed Elder Dongfang’s hand and shouted, “Look! What’s happening to the mine? Why has the ground cracked? Is this some sort of curse, or is it the wrath of heaven?”","A curse?","The wrath of heaven?","What slander! Dongfang Ziyun was trying to ruin Feng Wu!","The elders of Imperial College were furious.","They all turned their furious gazes on Dongfang Ziyun.","Yang Zhihu was a Level 9 Spiritual King and was the weakest member here. Hence, when all the elders stared at Dongfang Ziyun together, it was more than she could take.","She nearly passed out in fear.","Although she managed to stay conscious, the gazes would still disturb her mind for a long time.","Dongfang Ziyun wouldn’t be able to make any progress any time soon.","Elder Dongfang reacted quickly and dragged Dongfang Ziyun away from the edge.","She stared at Elder Helian. “What are you doing? Why are you and your elders bullying a girl?”","Before Elder Helian could speak, Elder Wu smirked. “Why is an old girl bullying a little girl, then?”","An old girl?!","Dongfang Ziyun couldn’t believe her ears.","Elder Wu said righteously, “Xiao Wu isn’t 15 yet and is only a girl. How old are you now? Aren’t you ashamed of bullying Xiao Wu?”","Dongfang Ziyun spat out a mouthful of blood.","She was furious.","Elder Dongfang fumed. “You!”","Elder Helian glared at Elder Dongfang. “Shut up! You’re halfway into your grave, but you still won’t leave a 14-year-old alone! What are you? 15?”","Pffft!","Elder Dongfang also spat out a mouthful of blood.","Elder Helian pointed at Elder Dongfang. “Why is your niece so unreasonable? She’s behaving this way because she’s mimicking her senior!”"]},{"number":3155,"title":"Chapter 3155 Imperial College’s Mine Is Gone","paragraphs":["3155 Imperial College’s Mine Is Gone","Elder Dongfang spat out a mouthful of blood in frustration.","Since when did Elder Helian become so eloquent?","He hadn’t been so harsh before.","Elder Dongfang had no idea that the change in Elder Helian was caused by Feng Wu.","Because he wanted to protect his kid now, he no longer feared anything. Moreover, Feng Wu was so talented and wanted very little from the school. Therefore, he became much more capable.","Seeing the two elders fighting, Elder Gu frowned. “What happened? Why are all the essence crystals shattered?”","Dongfang Ziyun said, “Look. The cracks are centered around Feng Wu. She must be the reason.”","Elder Gu couldn’t begin to describe how much it pained him to see this.","He and the other two elders used to cultivate here.","The spacious mine was almost destroyed.","The space was 100 meters long and 20 meters wide. The ground was around 2,000 square meters in size, and cracks covered the entire area.","Elder Gu jumped into the mine, grabbed a handful of essence crystals, and examined them.","There was no spiritual essence.","Not a single trace!","“What happened?” Elder Gu stared at Elder Wu. “Mine no. 3 was perfectly fine when we handed it over. Why did the essence crystals turn into rocks? What did you do to them?”","Elder Wu felt equally sorry, but what could he do? The girl was hungry, and they had to feed her first.","Elder Helian said so, and none of the other elders objected.","They felt sorry about losing all the essence crystals, but it was Feng Wu who had given them this mine, and she could use it however she wanted.","Right now, they all wanted to protect her and keep her abnormality from other people.","They were acutely aware of the fact that Feng Wu’s secret had to remain a secret.","Elder Wu lost his temper when he heard Elder Gu’s question.","Elder Wu snapped. “Who the hell are you? Do you know whose mine it is? What gives you the right to question me? Do you hear Elder Helian saying anything?”","Elder Dai said, “That’s right. Is it your mine now? Stop gabbing!”","Elder Gu snorted.","“You must be so proud of yourself. Imperial College was much more polite when you people begged for our help. You’ve found yourself a patron, haven’t you?” Elder Gu mocked Elder Dai. “Are you seeing this?","“The mine you’ve worked so hard to steal from us is gone!","“The essence crystals have been reduced to rubble. You don’t have anything to use.","“Your old mine is almost drained.","“Imperial College doesn’t have a mine left!","“How are you going to cultivate from now on? Don’t come to us and beg for our help!","“We won’t give you a dime!","“Good luck!”","Elder Gu then told Elder Dongfang, “Let’s go. They’ll beg us one day.”","The other elders of the Military Academy also sneered at the elders of Imperial College. There were even looks of pity in their eyes.","Dongfang Ziyun smirked and confirmed that Feng Wu’s good fortune had come to an end.","Something happened at that moment.","There was a strange sound."]},{"number":3156,"title":"Chapter 3156 Feng Wu Fell","paragraphs":["3156 Feng Wu Fell","Just then, they heard a strange noise.","Elder Gu frowned, and got an ominous feeling.","The people of the Military Academy involuntarily paused and looked at one another. Something felt off.","Dongfang Ziyun turned around and saw Feng Wu sitting alone in the essence crystal mine.","!!","Her hands were folded together, and she looked as ethereal as a fairy.","Rumble...","A glow enveloped Feng Wu.","It then turned into a beam of light which burst out of her body.","“She’s made a breakthrough!” Dongfang Ziyun stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","“She was a Level 2 Spiritual King before.” Dongfang Ziyun ground her teeth. “Is she a Level 3 one now?”","“Who told you she was a Level 2 Spiritual King?”","Elder Gu looked at Dongfang Ziyun in bewilderment.","With the concealing jade, usually, no one could tell Feng Wu’s actual level.","However, she was in the middle of a breakthrough, and capable cultivators could sense the change in her spiritual essence.","“What level is she?” Dongfang Ziyun’s stomach lurched.","She knew Feng Wu was more capable than that.","Earlier in the prison, Feng Wu had almost killed her with that soft-bladed sword. Dongfang Ziyun knew then that she stood no chance against Feng Wu.","Elder Gu sighed. “She’s a Level 6 Spiritual King now.”","That meant Feng Wu had been a Level 5 Spiritual King before.","“How’s that possible? She was only a Level 2 Spiritual King in the junior arena. I’m sure of it!” Dongfang Ziyun looked like she was about to cry. “She was only a Level 2 Spiritual King!”","She was so insistent because she wanted to prove that Feng Wu wasn’t a Level 6 Spiritual King now.","Elder Gu shook his head. “I don’t know what level she was back then, but she is absolutely a Level 6 Spiritual King now. If you don’t believe me, you can ask Elder Dongfang.”","Dongfang Ziyun looked at her aunt, who nodded grimly.","Elder Dongfang didn’t feel any less frustrated. She was overwhelmed by a sense of crisis.","She tried to convince herself that compared with herself, a peak Spiritual Overlord, a Spiritual King still had a long way to go.","Moreover, Imperial College would have paid a high price if this breakthrough had cost them all the spiritual essence in this mine.","Elder Dongfang was filled with jealousy, and so were the other elders of the Military Academy.","Elder Gu even sneered at the people of Imperial College. “Doting on Feng Wu is the worst mistake you’ve ever made. You’ll regret...”","He was cut off by a sudden turn of events.","Whoosh!","There was a loud crack, and they saw the ground open up at an even faster rate.","The ground only looked like a spiderweb before, but some of the cracks were wider than a palm.","Feng Wu was still sitting in the center of the mine.","Crack...","Right at that moment...","Thump!","It sounded like something had fallen into a pond.","Everybody realized Feng Wu was gone.","“Where’s Feng Wu? Where is she?”","“She fell into that hole in the ground! I saw it!”"]},{"number":3157,"title":"Chapter 3157 Not Just Essence Liquid","paragraphs":["3157 Not Just Essence Liquid","“Where’s Feng Wu? Where is she?”","“She fell into that hole in the ground! I saw it!”","Fell?","Where?","!!","There should only be rocks beneath the layer of essence crystals. What could she have fallen into?","Elder Helian didn’t care about that. All he knew was that his favorite girl was missing.","The next second, he disappeared from the spot.","Everybody watched as the cracks widened, but they were only limited to the area within the mine. The ground outside remained intact.","For instance, the area where Elder Dongfang and her people were standing was perfectly fine.","“Come over here!” Elder Wu told everybody to move away from that area.","Elder Helian had gone to help Feng Wu. The others had better stay out of his way.","Yang Zhihu was worried sick as he looked at the hole in which Feng Wu had disappeared.","Feng Wu was such a lovely girl. Yes, she ate a lot, but that was her only shortcoming. Why was she still hungry?","Seeing Feng Wu fall into that hole, Dongfang Ziyun was exhilarated. She almost jumped to her feet.","“Feng Wu is dead! She must be!”","But...","She heard the sound of rippling water.","Was there water under this mine?","Did that mean Feng Wu would survive? The smile froze on Dongfang Ziyun’s face.","The cracks continued to widen.","Thump...","The drained essence crystals fell into the hole in large chunks, like pieces of iceberg falling into the ocean.","The essence crystals made splashing sounds as they fell.","“So, there’s water underneath.” Dongfang Ziyun pursed her lips and whispered, “I wonder if there’s a powerful whirlpool...”","If there was, Feng Wu might still die.","The idea excited her. She wanted to share it with her aunt but stopped halfway.","Her aunt didn’t seem too happy.","When Dongfang Ziyun looked at the other elders, she realized their faces had darkened as well.","What was going on?","She suddenly felt uneasy.","Dongfang Ziyun looked at the elders of Imperial College and saw Elder Wu’s cheeks trembling.","“Aunt...” Dongfang Ziyun grabbed her aunt’s hand, feeling her knees weaken. “What’s wrong? Isn’t that a dark green river?”","Elder Dongfang held Dongfang Ziyun’s hand. Blue veins popped on the back of her hand from agitation.","The grip was so tight that Dongfang Ziyun was in tears.","“Is that an essence liquid river?” Elder Dai asked in a shaking voice.","Essence liquid? Was that liquified essence crystals? Was it easier to absorb than essence crystals? Dongfang Ziyun was so jealous that her eyes spat fire.","In fact, all the elders of the Military Academy felt the same way.","Elder Dongfang’s lips trembled as she said, “It’s not just essence liquid.”","More than essence liquid?","“What is it?”","Everybody, including the elders of Imperial College, looked at Elder Dongfang curiously."]},{"number":3158,"title":"Chapter 3158 Elder Helian Has Fainted","paragraphs":["3158 Elder Helian Has Fainted","They all thought it was essence liquid, the type that was easier to absorb than essence crystals.","Wasn’t it?","Elder Dongfang didn’t say a word.","However, her eyes revealed how she really felt: She was so jealous that she almost lost her mind.","!!","What kind of liquid was this? Everybody stared nervously at the river.","The spiritual essence was so dense. Was it from something more than essence liquid?","However, Elder Dongfang didn’t say a word. She looked like she wanted to kill someone, especially when she stared at Dongfang Ziyun.","Dongfang Ziyun felt that her aunt had been angry at her ever since this river surfaced. She began to panic.","Just then, two heads popped out of the river.","One was Elder Helian, and the other was Feng Wu.","To everybody’s astonishment, it was Feng Wu who was dragging Elder Helian out of the river.","She smiled wryly when she reached the shore. “Give me a hand.”","Only then did Elder Wu and the others realized what was going on, and dragged Elder Helian out of the river.","Feng Wu wiped her face and turned around.","What a project. The essence crystal mine had collapsed because of her, and an essence river had surfaced.","“What’s wrong with Elder Helian?” Elder Wu was worried.","“Did he suffocate in the river?” Elder Mo mumbled.","Elder Wu looked at him in helplessness.","Elder Helian was a Spiritual Overlord. How could he suffocate in a river?","“Elder Helian specializes in the water element. How can he suffocate in a river? Don’t make me laugh!” Elder Wu snapped.","That was right. Elder Helian specialized in the water element. So, what happened?","Elder Dongfang stared at Elder Helian. She knew why he had fainted.","He was too excited.","She was about to faint from her rage, too.","Elder Wu and the others looked at Feng Wu in expectation, waiting for an explanation, but Feng Wu shrugged. “I have no idea. I fell into the water, and before I knew it, Elder Helian jumped in.","“He then smelled and tasted the liquid to examine it. He suddenly trembled and fainted.”","Feng Wu thought for a moment and added, “I’ve checked his pulse. His blood pressure is a little higher, but there’s nothing wrong with him. As for why he fainted, my conclusion is...”","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said earnestly, “He fainted because he was too emotional.”","Elder Wu said, “But Elder Helian is a peak Spiritual Overlord!”","How could he be too emotional? That didn’t sound like him at all. If he were so easily disturbed, he wouldn’t have become a peak Spiritual Overlord.","Therefore...","“Are you sure about your conclusion?” Elder Wu questioned Feng Wu’s medical skills.","Feng Wu shrugged. Even she began to question her skills.","Just then, Elder Helian slowly woke up.","He opened his eyes and met everybody’s gazes.","Suddenly, his eyes lit up, and he burst into laughter.","His laughter could bring down the roof."]},{"number":3159,"title":"Chapter 3159 Three Lucky Draws","paragraphs":["3159 Three Lucky Draws","The entire fortress could hear him.","Those who were around Elder Helian found their ears buzzing.","Had Elder Helian lost his mind?","Only Elder Dongsang understood Elder Helian’s behavior. She knew why Elder Helian was laughing, which was why she appeared so unhappy.","Elder Helian finally stopped laughing. He wiped away his tears and gradually calmed down.","He patted Feng Wu on the head. “Good girl!”","However, he didn’t control his strength well because of his excitement.","Thump —","Poor little Feng Wu fell into the river again.","Elder Helian was scared out of his wits and immediately scooped her out of the water.","Feng Wu felt dizzy and could see stars. After being dunked in the water, her skin seemed fairer than before.","Elder Helian decided to reveal the truth. He rubbed Feng Wu’s head apologetically and told the others, “It’s not essence liquid. It’s all-purpose tri-transformation liquid!”","When the other elders heard this, their eyes all lit up.","“OMG!”","“All-purpose tri-transformation liquid?”","“Are you sure? Is this really all-purpose tri-transformation liquid?”","“That’s amazing! Feng Wu, you’ve found a treasure!” Elder Wu also patted Feng Wu on the shoulder, his eyes unbelievably bright.","The elders of Imperial College all burst into tears of excitement, but the elders of the Military Academy were so jealous that their eyes were bloodshot red.","It looked like their eyes were bleeding.","Feng Wu was confused.","All the elders seemed to know what that liquid was, but why hadn’t she heard about it before?","Feng Wu immediately asked the question.","“Yes! All-purpose transformation liquid!” Elder Helian felt he had gotten his revenge when he saw Elder Dongfang’s darkened face.","He rubbed Feng Wu’s head in satisfaction.","He now realized how much they had endured at the hands of the Military Academy until Feng Wu showed up. After that, things turned around.","“You’re our savior!” Elder Helian praised Feng Wu. “The name has ‘all-purpose’ in it, which means it works on all living creatures.","“The ‘tri’ means each creature has three opportunities to change their natural endowment in this liquid. Some people can gain new skills, some people will have enhanced physical strength, and some can obtain more spiritual essence.","“It works the same on magical plants and beasts. Each individual can transform three times.","“In plain terms, anyone can pick three lucky draws.”","Elder Helian couldn’t stop laughing. “I only fell into the river for a moment, but the progress I made was more than what dozens of years of practice can do!”","All the elders looked at Elder Helian in envy.","Dozens of years? That was terrific!","Elder Helian said, “That was what happened to me. You may not be as lucky as I was.”","No matter what, three lucky draws were still three great opportunities that could make a great difference to one’s cultivation."]},{"number":3160,"title":"Chapter 3160 Mine No. 3 Used to Be Ours","paragraphs":["3160 Mine No. 3 Used to Be Ours","Everybody looked at Feng Wu as if she had descended from heaven.","Why was she so adorable?","Elder Helian went on.","“The energy in this all-purpose tri-transformation liquid is limited. Only a finite number of people can enjoy the three lucky draws.","“Once the special substance is used up, the dark green liquid will turn light green, which is the color or essence crystals.","“When that happens, this liquid will deteriorate and become essence liquid.","“Even when that happens, it’ll still be an extremely valuable resource!","“It’ll be much easier to absorb than essence crystals.","“With a pool of essence liquid, Imperial College will have a never-ending flow of geniuses!”","That was why Elder Helian had fainted from excitement.","The liquid could help more than a handful of people. It would help Imperial College to crush the Military Academy.","It could even help the Junwu Empire’s fortress defeat the Dongsang Kingdom’s.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “I didn’t know it was so useful!”","Yang Zhihu was astonished.","He sat on the ground and couldn’t recover from the shock after a long while.","A few minutes before, he was worried about not having enough food to feed Feng Wu. However, she simply sat down and found them a new treasure.","He wondered if he was dreaming.","He suddenly realized that ever since Feng Wu showed up in the colonels’ quarters, everything around him seemed to have turned into a fantasy, and his world had turned upside down.","Dongfang Ziyun finally found out why her aunt had that murderous look on her face.","Feng Wu had taken mine No. 3 because of Dongfang Ziyun.","Miss Dongfang really wanted to cry now.","The Dongfang family could live with the loss of a mine, but Feng Wu had just found this all-purpose tri-transformation liquid.","Three lucky draws...","Elder Helian gained dozens of years of experience in just one go.","Jealousy could twist one’s mind, but it could also give one courage.","Dongfang Ziyun walked up to Elder Helian and kept her gaze on him. “Elder Helian, this mine doesn’t really belong to Imperial College.”","Hearing this, the elders of Imperial College became nervous.","Elder Helian immediately spoke to his shoulder badge. “Attention! All elders, come to mine No. 3 right now!","“Will the schoolmaster come to mine No. 3, please?","“General, please come to mine No. 3 immediately!”","Elder Helian’s loud command made Dongfang Ziyun jump, and she involuntarily stepped back.","Why was he making such a big fuss?","Elder Dongfang stared at Elder Helian. “They’re confronting the Dongsang Kingdom now! You’re distracting them!”","Elder Helian said, “As far as I know, there’s a temporary truce. I don’t know when the battle will resume, but nothing is going on right now.”","Elder Dongfang ground her teeth and stared at Elder Helian.","She wanted to take the mine by force, but it wouldn’t be so easy now.","“But this mine used to belong to Military Academy!” Elder Dongfang ground her teeth."]},{"number":3161,"title":"Chapter 3161 Take Feng Wu Away","paragraphs":["3161 Take Feng Wu Away","“But this mine used to belong to the Military Academy!” Elder Dongfang ground her teeth.","Elder Helian turned his cold gaze on Elder Dongfang. “Are you going to fight with us over this mine?”","Elder Dongfang said, “I told you. This mine used to be the Military Academy’s.”","Elder Helian said, “It’s like you said. It used to be yours, but it’s ours now.”","!!","Elder Dongfang glared at Elder Helian.","What was wrong with this man? He wasn’t so aggressive before. She didn’t think she was his match now.","Seeing that her elders had almost all arrived, Elder Dongfang turned to Dongfang Ziyun. “You should leave.”","Dongfang Ziyun said, “Aunt, I...”","Elder Dongfang’s face darkened, and she snapped at her niece. “Leave!”","Dongfang Ziyun grew uneasy, feeling that a battle was about to break out.","She gave Elder Dongfang a long look before taking off.","Elder Helian also turned to Feng Wu. “Kiddo, you should leave, too.”","Feng Wu said, “What?”","She hadn’t met the legendary general yet.","She knew Mr. Lu, the schoolmaster of the Imperial College. However, the general was such a mysterious person that she still hadn’t met him even once.","Elder Helian had never seemed so stern before.","Feng Wu said, “Hm...”","It seemed Elder Helian was serious.","Elder Dongfang wanted to take the mine by force, and Elder Helian wouldn’t let her. A battle might break out any time soon.","Seeing that Feng Wu wouldn’t move, Elder Helian bellowed, “Yang Zhihu, take her away!”","Just then, Feng Wu said, “Wait!”","She took out the Phoenix Pen and wrote a large “Lock” above the all-purpose transformation liquid.","Everybody thought she had lost her mind.","Did she think she could seal off this liquid in that way?","How childish!","Elder Helian didn’t believe it would work.","Elder Dongfang snorted as well.","She was glad Dongfang Ziyun was an obedient girl and left the scene when she was given the order.","As for the all-purpose transformation liquid, Elder Dongfang had hatched a plan.","No one knew if the Military Academy could take a portion of the liquid when the general arrived. Since they had so many elders here, the capable ones could jump into the liquid now. Imperial College couldn’t ask them to pay for it, could they?","She decided not to play by the book.","Elder Dongfang was experienced enough to hatch this shameless plan, but she had no idea that Feng Wu could easily outwit her.","The “Lock” written with the Phoenix Pen sealed the all-purpose transformation liquid in a dome.","To make a perfect seal, a formation had to be carefully set up, which would take at least a few hours. There wasn’t enough time, which was why Feng Wu used the Phoenix Pen.","The inscription could withstand three strikes.","After that, the invisible dome would shatter.","“That should keep the liquid safe until the bosses arrive,” thought Feng Wu.","“Yang Zhihu!”","Elder Helian didn’t know what Feng Wu had done and thought she was being disobedient, so he bellowed at Yang Zhiyu.","Yang Zhihu immediately took action.","He grabbed Feng Wu and carried her out of harm’s way.","As soon as they dashed off, Elder Helian and Elder Dongfang moved.","So did their subordinates."]},{"number":3162,"title":"Chapter 3162 Where’s the Military Law?","paragraphs":["3162 Where’s the Military Law?","Yang Zhihu’s eyes almost turned red.","He anxiously clenched his fists, but there was nothing he could do.","He was a peak Level 9 Spiritual King and only a step away from becoming a Spiritual Overlord.","However, he had been stuck at his current level for so many years.","No matter how hard he tried, he couldn’t make a breakthrough.","He could only watch his elders fight and was unable to participate.","Held by Yang Zhihu, Feng Wu looked over her shoulder and saw the elders fighting fiercely.","It was a battle of elites.","From afar, they looked like moving dots of light, and their speed was incredible.","“Don’t worry. No one will die.” Yang Zhihu saw Feng Wu was worried and patted her on the head. “The elders are allowed to fight, but they’re forbidden to severely injure or kill one another.","“We don’t have many elders. If we begin to kill each other, we won’t be able to fend off the Dongsang Kingdom anymore.”","“Why are you so anxious, then?” Feng Wu asked curiously.","Yang Zhihu said, “I’m worried about the all-purpose transformation liquid! Elder Dongfang is a cunning person. She’s trying to trick us!”","Feng Wu gave him a mysterious smile. “Are you trying to tell me Elder Dongfang started this battle on purpose so that her elders could ‘accidentally’ fall into the all-purpose transformation liquid while fighting?”","Yang Zhihu clenched his fists in anger. “That’s right! That’s Elder Dongfang’s plan. If they fall into the liquid during the battle, they’ll look perfectly innocent and claim they didn’t mean to.","“In that case, they can absorb the all-purpose transformation liquid and still look like the good guys. Damn those people!” Yang Zhihu became even angrier.","However, Feng Wu couldn’t help but chuckle.","“Why are you laughing?” Yang Zhihu looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","Feng Wu smiled. “Didn’t you see what I wrote just then? I’ve sealed off the all-purpose transformation liquid.”","She patted Yang Zhihu on the shoulder. “Zhihu, none of the Military Academy’s elders can get in.”","Yang Zhihu looked at her in resignation, thinking the girl was trying to look more mature than she really was.","However...","He rubbed his temple and reminded himself that apart from her big appetite, the girl’s most noticeable feature was her bragging.","Before Yang Zhihu could say anything, Feng Wu caught up with him and walked by his side. “The ‘Lock’ wasn’t the only thing I wrote. There was also ‘Thunder,’ but it was tiny, and I don’t think they’ll notice it.","“Luckily, the seal is above the all-purpose transformation liquid, and the energy source is endless. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have been able to write the inscriptions in one go.”","Feng Wu looked at her Phoenix Pen. “Finally, I found the right place to use it.”","Yang Zhihu looked up at the sky.","There. She was bragging again.","Who would believe her?","While Feng Wu was trying to catch up with Yang Zhihu, she saw someone walking toward them.","It was Yan Han.","Yan Han frowned when she saw Feng Wu walking side by side with Yang Zhihu.","She thought Yang Zhihu had promised her that he would punish Feng Wu as demanded by military law. Shouldn’t she be whipped 80 times? Why was she still jumping around like a monkey?","Since when did they become so close? If one didn’t know better, they would think these two were father and daughter!","Yan Han suppressed her anger and walked toward the two people."]},{"number":3163,"title":"Chapter 3163 Everybody’s Favorite","paragraphs":["3163 Everybody’s Favorite","When Yan Han saw how close Yang Zhihu and Feng Wu were, she was filled with jealousy.","However, she still managed to put on a friendly smile.","“Mr. Yang.” Yan Han smiled. “Why are you together?”","Yang Zhihu didn’t like that question.","He was taking Feng Wu to dinner, which was none of Yan Han’s business.","Yang Zhihu never tried to hide his feelings. He cast a stern look at Yan Han, gave her a nod, and was going to lead Feng Wu inside.","He was going to give Feng Wu a long speech. A pretty girl like her shouldn’t brag all the time. It wasn’t right.","However, Yan Han wouldn’t be dismissed so easily.","She was devastated when she saw how much Yang Zhihu wanted to get rid of her.","Oh god...","She was supposed to be the princess of the colonels’ quarters.","Everybody should dote on her.","She should be everyone’s favorite.","However, everything changed since Feng Wu came here. Feng Xun and Xuan Yi hadn’t come back yet, so she didn’t know about them, but none of the other colonels seemed to like her anymore.","Even Han Lu and Gao Ya, who were still bedridden, weren’t happy to see her.","Yan Han felt defeated.","She looked eagerly at Yang Zhihu. “Mr. Yang Zhihu, did I do something wrong? Is this why you’re all like this?”","Yang Zhihu turned around in bewilderment. “What?” He had no idea what was going on.","Yan Han said, “None of you like me anymore...”","Yang Zhihu’s face darkened. He wasn’t good at comforting girls.","Yan Han was a tall and strong young woman.","Feng Wu, on the other hand, was only a teenager. However, she was much tougher than she seemed. When Elder Helian smacked her into the essence liquid, she climbed out all by herself without shedding a tear. Why was Yan Han...","Yang Zhihu looked at Feng Wu, feeling troubled, but Feng Wu only shrugged. There was nothing she could do.","Yan Han sobbed for a while before making a promise. “I’ll be a better Precious Yan in the future. Mr. Yang, will you like me now?”","Yang Zhihu got a headache.","What was she talking about? They were in the middle of a battle! She should focus on her cultivation and become a better fighter!","Seeing Yang Zhihu frown, Yan Han changed the subject. “When I left the colonels’ quarters, Wang Zhaole said we didn’t have enough essence crystals. Mr. Yang, what happened? I thought we had collected 1,000 essence crystals for everybody’s cultivation.”","Yan Han knew this because her grandfather was an elder.","That was whom she had learned this from.","Hearing that, Yang Zhihu glanced at Feng Wu.","“Are you still hungry?”","Feng Wu rubbed her stomach. “Not at the moment.”","God knew how much all-purpose transformation liquid she had swallowed.","Moreover, she had put quite a lot in her storage space.","Feng Wu had two spiritual pets and a spiritual plant.","She didn’t know what they would get in the three lucky draws, and was looking forward to seeing the results.","With so many people around, Feng Wu couldn’t check the situation now.","Yan Han looked at them in bewilderment. Hungry? What were they talking about?","She felt left out.","She looked at Feng Wu and feigned a casual tone. “Miss Feng Wu, I heard you used up all the essence crystals in the colonels’ quarters. Is that true?”"]},{"number":3164,"title":"Chapter 3164 Born to Be Mean","paragraphs":["3164 Born to Be Mean","Feng Wu looked at Yan Han in surprise.","What was that?","Why was this woman bringing her into the discussion again?","Yan Han smiled at Feng Wu, but the look in her eyes was rather sinister.","“Miss Feng Wu, you’re new here, so you have a lot to learn,” Yan Han said slowly. “Essence crystals are very important to cultivators like us. They have to be taken seriously because they’re more important than our lives.”","She tried to sound soft and gentle, but compared with Feng Wu’s naturally sweet voice, hers was ridiculous.","Feng Wu only smiled at her but didn’t say anything. She wanted to know what Yan Han was getting at.","Yan Han looked like a senior sister reprimanding her ignorant junior sister. “We don’t have a lot of essence crystal mines, and each crystal is very precious to us. Be a good girl and return the essence crystals you took from us.”","Feng Wu didn’t say anything, but Yang Zhihu was displeased.","1,000 essence crystals were nothing compared with what Feng Wu had given them in return.","Before, each crystal was very precious to Imperial College, but now, they could use essence liquid by the bottle.","Yang Zhihu stared at Yan Han. “That’s enough.” This woman was humiliating herself.","Yan Han didn’t know that Yang Zhihu was trying to help her. Instead, she thought he was taking Feng Wu’s side, and almost burst into tears.","“Mr. Yang, I know Miss Feng Wu is a lovely girl, but she has taken so many essence crystals. They’re very important to us...”","Yang Zhihu grew impatient. What was she doing?","Would she ever stop?","“Yan Han, work on your cultivation or inscriptions,” Yang Zhihu said sternly.","However, Yan Han wanted to finish the job. She ground her teeth and said, “Mr. Yang, I can cultivate whenever I want to, and I’m a great inscription master. I’m Level 4 already!”","After showing off her inscription skills, Yan Han reminded Yang Zhihu, “Mr. Yang, have you forgotten about the military law you mentioned?”","Yang Zhihu rubbed his temple and told Feng Wu, “Xiao Wu, you can take a break now.”","Feng Wu nodded, made a face at Yan Han, and happily walked away.","Did she make a face at me?","Why is she so smug?","Is she provoking me?","Yan Han wanted to tear Feng Wu apart.","Yang Zhihu couldn’t understand how someone could be born to be so mean.","Yang Zhihu kept his gaze on Yan Han and stressed each word. “Yan Han, I didn’t want to say this, but you simply wouldn’t let it go, so I have to say something.","“It’s about Feng Wu.”","Yang Zhihu pointed at Feng Wu, who was walking away. “She’s someone you can’t afford to offend. Your Level 4 inscriptions are nothing. You should stay away from her even if you’re a Level 8 inscription master!”","Yan Han’s face suddenly lost all color. She bit her lower lip and wouldn’t accept it.","Yang Zhihu said, “You should believe me. All you need to know is 1,000 essence crystals are nothing. Feng Wu can earn a million times more than that for our school! Do you believe that?","“I guess the answer is no.” Yang Zhihu shook his head. “Go to the seclusion room and stay there for three days. Come out once you’ve cleared your head.”","Yan Han was devastated. “You’re all bullying me!”","“Wang Zhaole!” Yang Zhihu frowned and stopped the first person who walked past him. “Walk her to the seclusion room. Don’t let her come out for the next three days!”","If Yan Han still couldn’t figure out what she did wrong, Yang Zhihu would have to talk to Elder Yan in person. Targeting Feng Wu all the time wouldn’t help Yan Han at all.","At the same moment, Feng Wu –"]},{"number":3165,"title":"Chapter 3165 Feng Wu In a Bad Mood","paragraphs":["3165 Feng Wu In a Bad Mood","Feng Wu didn’t know Yan Han was talking behind her back, nor did she know Yang Zhihu had defended her.","Right now, she was sitting on the stairs with her chin in her hands, deep in thought.","She had a lot to do.","She did some calculations and realized that the second Immortal Spiritual Fruit would ripen in six days.","!!","She had to get that fruit because she owed it to Bao Er.","After what happened last time, Sakiya would only guard the fruit more closely. The task would be very hard.","There were also the Twelve Trials of Love. She was stuck on the eleventh trial.","Zuo Qingluan was the main reason.","Feng Wu couldn’t understand why that woman was so stubborn. She simply wouldn’t admit that Jun Linyuan was in love with Feng Wu.","She and Jun Linyuan might need to play the loving couple in front of Zuo Qingluan to force the latter to face reality. She had to complete the eleventh trial. If Zuo Qingluan disappeared, Feng Wu would be stuck here.","If that happened, she didn’t know when her beautiful master would wake up.","She had to hurry up.","However, Jun Linyuan was cultivating his mysterious bloodline. Feng Wu wondered if he had finished.","She immediately took action and went to Jun Linyuan’s place.","But...","He hadn’t!","Feng was guarding the door.","The last time he was away, Jun Linyuan was injured. Because of that, he wouldn’t leave Jun Linyuan’s side after he came back.","Feng gestured at Feng Wu, asking her to be quiet.","“Still nothing?”","Feng solemnly shook his head.","The last time they met, Feng Wu had been in the Dayless Woods, and in the middle of a breakthrough.","“Will the all-purpose transformation liquid help Jun Linyuan?” Feng Wu asked curiously.","Feng thought about it and shook his head. “Spiritual Saints don’t really need it.”","Feng Wu nodded in disappointment. She wanted to ask some questions, but kept her silence when she saw how cautious Feng was.","“I’ll come back in a few days.” Feng Wu said goodbye to Feng.","Without Jun Linyuan, she couldn’t work on the eleventh trial or the second Immortal Spiritual Fruit. That could be a little troublesome.","Feng Wu thought about the all-purpose transformation liquid.","She was the one to discover that liquid; the last thing she wanted was to let the Military Academy take it away.","At first, she didn’t think it would happen, but Elder Helian was such an honest and upright person that she didn’t have any confidence in him.","Feng Wu immediately went to see Elder Helian, and she actually found him.","Feng Wu had visited Elder Helian quite often, so his servant didn’t stop her.","She entered the room to find the mood inside rather awkward.","Elder Helian sat in the host seat, and fifteen Spiritual Overlords sat around an oval table.","They seemed to be arguing about something.","Feng Wu heard Elder Wu protest. “No! No way! Feng Wu found the all-purpose transformation liquid. Why should we give half of it to the Military Academy? They’ve never shared their mines with us!”","What? The Military Academy wanted half of the all-purpose transformation liquid?!","Feng Wu didn’t like the sound of that at all."]},{"number":3166,"title":"Chapter 3166 Angry Feng Wu","paragraphs":["3166 Angry Feng Wu","What? The Military Academy wanted half of the all-purpose transformation liquid?!","Feng Wu didn’t like the sound of that at all.","She pushed the door open.","Elder Wu seemed embarrassed to see her.","!!","Since Elder Helian was sitting in the host seat, Feng Wu walked up to him, stopped, and kept her gaze on the elderly man.","Elder Helian almost couldn’t meet her eyes.","He couldn’t understand why Feng Wu, a Level 5, no, Level 6 Spiritual King, could make him feel this way.","“Why?” Feng Wu stared at Elder Helian, the look in her eyes stern and intimidating.","Elder Helian sighed. “The decision came from above us.”","Feng Wu said, “Didn’t you try to argue with them?”","Elder Helian rubbed his eye, which had been bruised from Elder Dongfang’s blow.","He heaved a long sigh. “I did, but...”","Seeing all the elders prick up their ears, Elder Helian stared at Feng Wu. “Come with me!”","He wanted to talk to Feng Wu in private to calm her down, but Feng Wu stood there and sneered at him. “I’m not going anywhere. If you have anything to say, say it now!”","Elder Helian stared at Feng Wu, but Feng Wu put her hands behind her back and looked more intimidating than him.","Elder Helian was speechless.","He had no choice but to tell her, “It was Mr. Lu’s decision.”","Feng Wu sneered at him.","Elder Helian had to tell her more. “According to our superiors, the Military Academy has more elders and more talented students. Letting them use the liquid can maximize benefits for the entire fortress. We have to see the big picture.”","Feng Wu smiled. “If the Military Academy was the one who found the all-purpose transformation liquid, would they give us half of it?”","Before Elder Helian said anything, Elder Wu almost jumped to his feet. “Half of it? You’re so naive! They wouldn’t give us so much as a bottle!”","Elder Mo said, “When they had four crystal mines, did they ever give us any essence crystals? We had to tighten our belts and live on what we had!”","Feng Wu stared at Elder Helian, who smiled wryly but nodded at her. Elder Wu was right.","Feng Wu thought she was going to explode.","“That’s not fair!” Feng Wu’s face turned red, and she glared at Elder Helian. “That’s so unfair! Why should we give them half when they wouldn’t share with us? What kind of rule is that? I won’t accept it!”","Elder Helian sighed. “No, it isn’t fair, but we don’t have a choice.”","Feng Wu said, “You don’t have a choice. I do!”","She turned to leave.","“Xiao Wu! Xiao Wu!” Elder Helian ran out of the room and stopped her. “His Royal Highness isn’t around at the moment. Please don’t cause any trouble.”","Feng Wu said, “Cause trouble? The trouble is already here!”","Elder Helian said, “I mean it. His Royal Highness isn’t here, and I don’t think I can keep you safe...”","Feng Wu said angrily, “I don’t need you to keep me safe! No one can take the all-purpose transformation liquid without my permission! I’m the one who found it!”"]},{"number":3167,"title":"Chapter 3167 Angry Feng Wu (2)","paragraphs":["3167 Angry Feng Wu (2)","Feng Wu stormed out after that.","She had to see Mr. Lu now.","Seeing Feng Wu leave, the other elders were a little worried about her.","Elder Yan smiled wryly, thinking that Feng Wu was the same as Yan Han.","!!","He thought they were both spoiled and willful kids.","“Mr. Lu doesn’t exactly have a good temper,” Elder Wu told Elder Helian. “We don’t want her to offend him.”","Elder Mo said, “I’m very angry about what happened. They keep telling us to see the big picture, but the Military Academy never gave us any support when we needed essence crystals.”","Elder Yan sighed. “I don’t think Mr. Lu will let Xiao Wu see him.”","With Emperor Wu’s token, of course, Feng Wu could see Mr. Lu.","She was stopped at the front gate at first, but when she showed them the token, no one tried to stop her again.","It was a courtyard at the center of the fortress.","The gate was guarded, but no one dared to stop the angry girl with the emperor’s token.","Mr. Lu was playing chess in the courtyard. It wasn’t just him. A man sat opposite him.","His opponent was also an elderly man.","That man had a tough look and was obviously from the military.","Seeing Feng Wu charge toward him, Mr. Lu smiled bitterly.","Elder Helian had mentioned it before, so he knew why Feng Wu was here.","“Xiao Wu, I didn’t expect to see you here.” Mr. Lu waved at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu wanted to speak, but Mr. Lu said mildly, “Take a seat and watch us play.”","Just like Jun Linyuan, Mr. Lu was a capable Spiritual Saint.","Feng Wu didn’t know his exact level, but he was indeed a Spiritual Saint, and there were only a handful of them in the entire imperial capital.","She was furious, but with Mr. Lu’s intervention, she couldn’t lash out. Without any other choice, she could only sit on a chair, rest her chin on her hands, and glare at Mr. Lu.","The person opposite Mr. Lu was none other than Mr. Xu, the schoolmaster of the Military Academy.","Mr. Xu concentrated on the chessboard and acted as if Feng Wu wasn’t there.","To him, she was only one of the insignificant students of Imperial College.","A colonel?","A senior member like him was several ranks higher than a colonel. He didn’t think Feng Wu mattered at all.","Therefore, he didn’t so much as glance at her.","Feng Wu looked from Mr. Lu to Mr. Xu.","She was furious when she arrived, but after sitting down, she calmed down a little.","She realized that Mr. Lu must have agreed to give half of the liquid to Mr. Xu because the latter had offered something to Mr. Lu or Imperial College in return. However, they were still messing with her things without her permission.","Feng Wu couldn’t stand it.","She didn’t know much about Mr. Xu, but had heard that he was a rigid and strict military man who had incredible physical strength.","More importantly, he had been the head of Emperor Wu’s imperial guards before he was appointed as head of the Military Academy.","Feng Wu rubbed her chin as her brain raced.","If she rushed to take action, she wouldn’t gain anything and would only become more frustrated.","Her gaze slowly moved to the chessboard.","Her chess skills..."]},{"number":3168,"title":"Chapter 3168 Angry Feng Wu (3)","paragraphs":["3168 Angry Feng Wu (3)","Her chess skills...","Her beautiful master had trained her for years since she was little. Needless to say, she was a great player.","She immediately saw that Mr. Lu wasn’t Mr. Xu’s match at all.","In a few moves, Mr. Xu would win.","Resting her chin on her hands, Feng Wu studied the game. “Mr. Lu, is this a bet?”","Mr. Lu said casually, “Yes.”","“What’s at stake?”","Mr. Lu glanced at Feng Wu. “The all-purpose transformation liquid.”","Feng Wu was infuriated.","This man didn’t cherish other people’s hard work at all!","It had taken her some painstaking effort to find the all-purpose transformation liquid. He couldn’t play the generous man and give it away!","Feng Wu smirked. “Do you think the all-purpose transformation liquid is yours? Why do you think you have the right to give it away?”","Her voice was loud enough for everybody to hear.","Mr. Lu was astonished.","So was Mr. Xu.","They were both top-ranking officials and two of the most influential people in the Junwu Empire.","Even Emperor Wu wouldn’t speak to them that way, but a mere colonel had just reprimanded them.","What a day!","Mr. Xu looked at Mr. Lu in bewilderment, wondering why the latter didn’t kill this colonel on the spot.","Mr. Lu would have done so if Feng Wu were an ordinary colonel, but she was a lovely girl.","Moreover, Mr. Lu had watched Feng Wu grow up and knew how capable she was.","Earlier, Elder Helian even told him that Feng Wu was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner and a Level 6 Spiritual King, which had shocked Mr. Lu.","But on second thought, he realized it wasn’t all that surprising since it was Feng Wu.","Feng Wu stared at Mr. Lu. “That liquid is mine, and only I can give it away! No one else is allowed to do so!”","How arrogant!","How bossy!","How willful!","Those were the words which popped into Mr. Xu’s head when he looked at the pretty girl.","He shook his head, and his impression of Feng Wu changed drastically.","Mr. Lu felt awkward and tried to reason with Feng Wu. “Xiao Wu...”","Feng Wu said, “I said no!”","Mr. Lu said, “I think...”","Feng Wu bellowed, “I don’t care what you think! The only thing that matters is what I think! I won’t allow you to give it away!","Mr. Lu almost spat out a mouthful of blood.","Since when did this girl become so irritable?","She used to be so adorable.","Mr. Xu glanced at Feng Wu, unable to stand her anymore. “You’re an interesting girl.”","Feng Wu sneered at him. “You’re an interesting, greedy schoolmaster.”","Pffft!","Seeing Mr. Xu’s astonished expression, Mr. Lu almost spat out his tea.","Xu, you never saw this coming, did you?","Mr. Xu had always been a rigid and serious man. Even when he wasn’t angry, many people were still afraid of him. Apart from Emperor Wu and Jun Linyuan, no one dared speak to him in this way, and he was rather displeased.","However, his opponent was only a girl.","As soon as he stared at her, she took off her badge, indicating she wasn’t talking to him as a colonel in the fortress.","Would he have to argue with a civilian girl?","Mr. Xu had never been in such an unconventional situation before, and for a while, he didn’t know what to do.","Seeing this, Mr. Lu laughed wholeheartedly."]},{"number":3169,"title":"Chapter 3169 Angry Feng Wu (4)","paragraphs":["3169 Angry Feng Wu (4)","“Xu, you never thought this would happen to you, did you?” Mr. Lu pointed at Mr. Lu and laughed.","Many of the elders of Imperial College waited outside the courtyard and gingerly eavesdropped on the conversation.","They were here because they were worried about Feng Wu, but the fear of Mr. Lu stopped them from going inside.","The protection barrier around the courtyard was soundproof.","People outside couldn’t hear the conversation inside when Feng Wu and the two schoolmasters spoke in their normal voices.","However, the barrier couldn’t block Mr. Lu’s laughter.","Elder Helian and the others were dumbfounded when they heard it.","What was going on inside?","Was the laughter so loud because Xiao Wu was dead?","Meanwhile, Mr. Xu kept his cold gaze on Feng Wu, trying to bring her to her knees.","But...","Feng Wu was a clever girl. When she felt the tremendous force that was trying to make her kneel, she took out a token.","It was equivalent to having the owner of the token here.","That was Emperor Wu’s token, which couldn’t be used casually because it would be disrespectful to Emperor Wu, and Feng Wu would appear to be abusing her power and using it to bully other people.","If Emperor Wu heard that, he would have a bad impression of Feng Wu and wouldn’t treat her so nicely.","Therefore, the token could only be used in critical moments such as now.","Feng Wu was far inferior to Mr. Xu both in her capability and her military rank, but she had this secret weapon.","She took out the token, showed it to Mr. Xu, and smirked. “Do you want His Majesty to kneel?”","Of course, Mr. Xu wouldn’t dare do that, so he stopped putting pressure on Feng Wu, but his cold gaze stayed on her.","It was such an intimidating look.","Feng Wu held the token in her right hand and returned his gaze, showing no fear.","There was a huge gap between their military ranks and cultivation levels, but the energy they gave off was equally fierce.","Mr. Lu’s expression changed as he studied Feng Wu.","They hadn’t met for a while, so he still thought of Feng Wu as the little girl he used to know.","He thought he could easily brush her aside like coaxing a baby with some sweets.","However, he realized he had to face reality now.","Feng Wu was no longer the girl with no cultivation ability who couldn’t get into Imperial College.","So much had happened to her in the past year.","She was now a Semi-Divine medicine refiner and a Level 6 Spiritual King. The crown prince and Emperor Wu were both her patrons.","Mr. Lu realized he couldn’t coax Feng Wu anymore. Rather, he had to treat her as an equal, because that was the right choice.","Mr. Lu’s attitude quickly changed, but Mr. Xu’s attitude didn’t because he didn’t know Feng Wu well.","Still, he was shocked by her reaction.","He had no idea that such a young student could give off such a powerful aura.","Only the royal family could exude such confidence, but she wasn’t a princess.","Mr. Xu still stared at Feng Wu, but he didn’t increase the pressure on her.","The energy he brought to bear on Feng Wu was equivalent to that of a Level 8 Spiritual King.","What a strange girl!","Feng Wu stared at him and smirked.","Mr. Xu threw a dirty look at her before he pulled back his spiritual essence."]},{"number":3170,"title":"Chapter 3170 The Elders’ Different Levels","paragraphs":["3170 The Elders’ Different Levels","Mr. Xu thought, “So what if she has an impressive aura? She’s not even a Spiritual Overlord yet.”","At that moment, Feng Wu turned to Mr. Lu. “If he loses, we won’t have to give him half of the all-purpose transformation liquid. Correct?”","Mr. Lu nodded. “That’s right.”","Feng Wu said, “You’re not good enough. Let me play against him.”","Mr. Xu frowned. “An educated man shouldn’t talk during a chess game.”","Feng Wu snapped at him. “I’m not a man. I’m a girl.”","Mr. Xu rubbed his temple. This girl was giving him a headache.","He decided not to argue with the girl.","Mr. Xu stared at Mr. Lu, hoping the latter could get rid of Feng Wu.","However, Mr. Lu didn’t know what to do either because Feng Wu was an expert at making trouble.","Mr. Lu said patiently, “Xiao Wu, we have to see the big picture. Don’t be so narrow-minded.”","Feng Wu smirked.","Mr. Lu said, “If I had a choice, I wouldn’t want to give the liquid away. Do you think I like this decision?”","He tried to reason with her. “What do you think this fortress is for?”","Feng Wu crossed her arms and wouldn’t respond to that question.","Mr. Lu could only keep talking. “The Imperial College has 36 elders, and 25 are here in the fortress. Right?","“The Military Academy has 41 elders, and 25 are here.","“What about the Dongsang Kingdom? They also have 50 elders here at the border.","“Do you know why both sides can only have 50 elders?","“Do you know why the other elders aren’t here?","“That’s because the two sides have agreed to have an equal number of Spiritual Overlords here on the border.”","Mr. Lu said patiently, “Here’s the thing: The number is fixed, but the Spiritual Overlord stage has nine levels.”","Feng Wu snorted but didn’t answer.","Mr. Lu said, “If all our Spiritual Overlords can rise by one level, the force of the entire fortress will improve.”","That made sense, but Feng Wu didn’t like it.","“Let me ask you a question. They’re asking us to see the big picture. If it was the Military Academy who found the all-purpose transformation liquid, would they give it to us?” Feng Wu stared at the Military Academy.","Mr. Lu couldn’t answer that question, so he turned to Mr. Xu.","Mr. Xu didn’t like the question, so he said coldly, “We wouldn’t keep it to ourselves.”","Feng Wu asked, “How much would you give Imperial College, then?”","Before Mr. Xu could answer, Feng Wu smirked. “You’re a schoolmaster. I have faith in your honesty.”","Mr. Lu rubbed his temple.","What an impressive girl.","When she said that, Mr. Xu had to tell the truth.","As expected, Mr. Xu said, “Of the 25 elders from the Military Academy, ten are junior Spiritual Overlords, ten are intermediate ones, four are senior ones, and one is a peak Spiritual Overlord.”","Feng Wu knew the peak one was Elder Dongfang.","Mr. Xu continued. “Imperial College has fifteen junior Spiritual Overlords, seven intermediate ones, two senior ones, and one peak Spiritual Overlord.”","Feng Wu frowned a little. Overall, Imperial College was inferior to the Military Academy. No wonder Elder Helian had to report to Mr. Lu when the all-purpose transformation liquid was discovered."]},{"number":3171,"title":"Chapter 3171 Viva la Feng Wu","paragraphs":["3171 Viva la Feng Wu","“Based on that ratio, we would have given you 30%,” Mr. Xu said solemnly.","Blue veins popped on Feng Wu’s forehead.","“You’re taking half of our all-purpose transformation liquid, but if you found it, you would only give us 30%!”","Uncontrollable fury filled Feng Wu’s chest.","However, Mr. Xu said indifferently, “You should be grateful that we’re not taking 70% now.”","Grateful?!","Go to hell!","Feng Wu had never been so angry before.","She slammed her palm on the chessboard and seemed to have turned into a ball of angry flames.","Staring at Mr. Xu, she smirked. “70%? I won’t even give you 10%!”","Mr. Xu frowned.","Why was this girl so unreasonable?","He was being very patient with her because she had His Majesty’s token. Why was she so stubborn?","He glanced at Mr. Lu, asking the latter to discipline the girl.","Mr. Lu felt conflicted.","Didn’t he want to keep everything? Of course he did.","But he couldn’t.","He was told to see the big picture. What choice did he have?","He could only tell Feng Wu, “Xiao Wu, you’re not a kid anymore. You have to see the big picture...”","“To hell with the big picture!”","Feng Wu lost her temper and no longer cared about her choice of words.","Mr. Lu was astonished. The girl had to be extremely angry to lose control like this.","Feng Wu stared at the two schoolmasters. “You two schoolmasters seem to be having a good time playing chess here.","“I found the liquid, but you’re openly discussing ownership of it now. Who gave you that right? You should be ashamed of yourselves!","“See the big picture? See my ass!","“Without me, you would never have known that the all-purpose transformation liquid was underneath the mine!","“At your speed, it would have been ten thousand years before you dug through that layer!”","The two men were so angry that even their beards shook.","Why was this girl so good at telling people off?","Outside...","All the elders of Imperial College heard what Feng Wu said.","The barrier could block normal conversation, but when somebody raised their voice, the sound would penetrate the barrier.","Ordinary people might not hear it, but Spiritual Overlords could.","Therefore...","They were all dumbfounded and shocked.","It was a miracle that Feng Wu was still alive.","Was she trying to get herself killed?","She was scolding a schoolmaster.","Wait. She said “schoolmasters.” That was to say...","Mr. Lu wasn’t the only schoolmaster inside. Mr. Xu was there, too!","OMG!","The elders dropped to their knees in fear.","However, Feng Wu stood there with her hands on her waist. In her red dress, she looked like a ball of fire. If she had a red cape, she would be the goddess of war.","She turned to stare at Mr. Xu.","“Why are you looking at me? Am I wrong?","“Would you have found it without me?","“How many years did your school work on mine No. 3? Did you find it? Why do you think you have the right to share the all-purpose transformation liquid?","“70%? We should be grateful? Don’t make me laugh!","“You must feel so good about having so many high-level elders.","“If you think you’re so extraordinary, don’t dip your finger in my all-purpose transformation liquid! You thief!”"]},{"number":3172,"title":"Chapter 3172 Defend Xiao Wu","paragraphs":["3172 Defend Xiao Wu","The elders were no longer kneeling. They were all lying on their stomachs now.","Feng Wu was amazing!","Had she received training in berating people?","Why was she so good at it?","!!","It felt so good to hear her talk.","However, the elders turned pale when they realized she was talking to Mr. Xu and Mr. Lu.","They felt a chill run down their spines.","Could Feng Wu survive this?","Elder Helian searched his memory and tried to remember if he had told Mr. Lu that Feng Wu was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner. Had he?","Meanwhile, in the courtyard, Mr. Lu couldn’t laugh anymore.","No one could smile when they were scolded this way.","He still felt calmer than Mr. Xu since Feng Wu’s anger was obviously directed at the latter.","Because of that, Mr. Lu rubbed his nose and decided to let it go. Meanwhile, Mr. Xu looked at Feng Wu in astonishment.","He was genuinely shocked.","He had been through many dangerous situations before, but this was the first time that someone had spoken to him in this way.","He opened his mouth, but no words came out.","It was clear from his trembling cheeks how angry he was.","Feng Wu smirked. “You have more senior elders than us, but so what? When our elders come out of the all-purpose transformation liquid, we’ll be as powerful as your school! Just wait and see!”","Feng Wu headed for the gate outside.","Mr. Lu stared at her. “Where are you going?”","Feng Wu said, “To let my elders soak in the all-purpose transformation liquid. We won’t just sit here and let it vaporize!”","Mr. Lu tried to speak, but Feng Wu sneered at him. “I won that mine for our school, and I discovered the all-purpose transformation liquid. If you want to take it, you can ask the general to talk to me!”","Feng Wu left after that.","Seeing Feng Wu leave, Mr. Lu smiled wryly and turned to Mr. Xu. “The kid is spoiled. Did you see her temper?”","Mr. Xu glanced at Mr. Lu and said grimly, “If she were from my school, I would have killed her already!”","Mr. Lu looked at Mr. Xu. “Kill her? His Royal Highness will kill you!”","Mr. Xu frowned. “What does this have to do with His Royal Highness?”","Mr. Lu said, “She’s the mother of the crown prince’s future son. What do you think?”","Mother of his future son?","It took Mr. Xu a moment to realize what that meant.","If that was the case... He frowned. “I won’t have it!”","Mr. Lu asked, “What do you mean?”","Mr. Xu glanced at Mr. Lu. It was quite obvious what he meant.","Mr. Lu was speechless. “His Majesty has given her his token. What can you possibly do?”","However, Mr. Xu had made a mental note of it.","He was the vindictive type.","“Where are you going?” Mr. Lu asked in a hurry when Mr. Xu rose to his feet.","Mr. Xu smirked. “Since you won’t discipline your student, and she’s not one of mine, someone has to do something.”","Mr. Xu knew Mr. Lu could control Feng Wu if the latter wanted to, but all he did was talk about useless things.","He was taking that girl’s side.","Mr. Xu could stop Feng Wu, but it wouldn’t be appropriate.","To solve this matter, the general was the perfect candidate."]},{"number":3173,"title":"Chapter 3173 Share the Benefits","paragraphs":["3173 Share the Benefits","Feng Wu came out to find the elders lying all over the ground.","She looked at them, and they looked back at her.","Feng Wu was perplexed. “What are you all doing here?”","Elder Helian was the representative of the elders. He rose to his feet and patted the dust off his knees. He looked at Feng Wu in amazement. “You’re still alive!”","Feng Wu was even more perplexed.","“Why shouldn’t I be?”","Elder Helian said, “I know Mr. Lu won’t do anything, but didn’t Mr. Xu do anything?”","Mr. Lu rarely came out of seclusion. Elder Helian had worked for him for years, but had only met him a few times. Therefore, Elder Helian had always respected Mr. Lu, and more so Mr. Xu.","Why had Imperial College lived under the Military Academy’s shadow all these years?","It was because of Mr. Xu’s suppression.","Only someone at Elder Helian’s level knew that secret.","Right now, they looked at Feng Wu as if she was God.","She was amazing!","Feng Wu still had plans. With a wave of her hand, she said, “Let’s go!”","“Where?” Elder Helian was bewildered.","“Lucky draw,” Feng Wu said succinctly.","Lucky draw?","Was she referring to the all-purpose transformation liquid in mine No. 3?","Elder Helian looked at Feng Wu in wonder and smiled bitterly. “The general has sealed it off. Even if we go with you, we still won’t be able to get in.”","Feng Wu asked, “Really?”","Elder Helian said, “Yes. Both Mr. Lu and Mr. Xu are capable cultivators. We need their permission to release the seal. Let’s talk to them...”","Feng Wu asked, “Is the general good at inscriptions?”","Elder Helian said, “Yes. He’s even better than Elder Yan.”","Elder Yan stepped out.","He said seriously, “I’m a Level 7 inscription master, and the general is slightly better than me, but I don’t think he’s reached Level 8 yet.”","“That won’t be a problem.” Feng Wu was already at Level 8. With Master Linghu’s Phoenix Pen, she could easily solve a Level 9 inscription.","“By the way,” Feng Wu asked Elder Helian, “how many people do you think can soak in the all-purpose transformation liquid before it’s used up?”","All the elders had done the calculations, including Elder Helian.","Elder Helian told Feng Wu, “Not many. My estimate is about a hundred people, but it could be fewer than that.”","Feng Wu rubbed her chin.","Since the liquid was hers, she felt she should decide how to use it.","So what if the Military Academy blamed her for it?","By then, the liquid would be used up, and their blame would be useless. It would be like the all-purpose transformation liquid never existed. Anyway, it wasn’t their mine.","Feng Wu had prepared a speech for Mr. Xu, and couldn’t wait to get started.","However, time was of the essence here.","She took out a piece of paper and started writing down names.","She then handed it to Elder Wu.","“Elder Wu, please go to the living quarters and find everybody on this list.”","Elder Wu was bewildered when he saw the names, which all belonged to colonels and lieutenant colonels.","“They’re all my friends.” Feng Wu smiled. “Since we’re friends, I must share my good fortune with them. I found the all-purpose transformation liquid. How can I forget my friends?”","All the elders looked at Feng Wu in astonishment."]},{"number":3174,"title":"Chapter 3174 Mine No. 3 Is Ours","paragraphs":["3174 Mine No. 3 Is Ours","While Elder Wu took the list to find Feng Wu’s friends, Feng Wu took the elders to mine No. 3.","They ran into different people on the way.","For instance, Elder Dai of the Military Academy saw them.","He panicked a little when he saw all the elders walking by, and he asked, “Where are you going?”","The elders all ignored him.","They now held a lot of grudges against the Military Academy.","Elder Dai realized something was wrong, so he hurried off to get Elder Dongfang.","Feng Wu frowned. “We need to move faster. The Military Academy will soon send their elders.”","Elder Helian laughed. “You worry too much.”","Feng Wu was bewildered. “Am I wrong?”","Elder Helian said seriously, “The general has sealed off the all-purpose transformation liquid with a Level 8 inscription. No one else can open it.”","That didn’t seem right...","“Why are you following me, then?” Feng Wu looked back at the other elders.","They all seemed so confident. Did they think this was a picnic?","The elders all smiled kindly at Feng Wu.","Elder Helian smiled at her as well.","Feng Wu immediately knew what they were doing.","They believed they couldn’t get to the all-purpose transformation liquid, but they still went with her to keep her company.","“Are you worried that Mr. Xu will kill me if I’m left alone?” Feng Wu asked curiously.","“Ahem...” Elder Helian awkwardly cleared his throat, feeling she had seen through them.","Feng Wu was speechless. These people had wild imaginations.","However, she felt she had to return the kindness.","She had always been this way. When other people were kind to her, she felt compelled to return the favor. If they were unkind, she wouldn’t hesitate to get her revenge.","These elders were so kind!","It was true. A good act would be well-rewarded.","Feng Wu raised her Phoenix Pen. “I’ll show you how I break that Level 8 inscription!”","However, only a handful of people could recognize that pen, and the elders didn’t believe her.","They weren’t alone. Elder Dongfang and her people didn’t believe her either.","...","Elder Dai went to report to Elder Dongfang.","An elder like him shouldn’t run around like a messenger, but this involved the all-purpose transformation liquid, so he couldn’t care less about his image.","Elder Dai went to report to Elder Dongfang.","“The elders of Imperial College are headed for mine No. 3. What should we do?”","The elders were usually very busy and wouldn’t sit down to chat with one another because it was a waste of time.","They spent most of their time cultivating in seclusion and battles, and would alternate between the two.","A meeting of over ten elders was very rare.","Elder Dongfang sat in the host seat, and the topic of the meeting was the all-purpose transformation liquid.","When Elder Dai ran into the room, one of the elders was saying, “50% won’t be enough! Our elders are much more capable than theirs. 70% would be a fair percentage. I think asking for 80% is also acceptable!”","The other elders agreed with him.","Elder Gu said righteously, “Mine No. 3 was ours in the first place! They should be grateful if we give them 20%!”"]},{"number":3175,"title":"Chapter 3175 Getting Sad","paragraphs":["3175 Getting Sad","Elder Dai ran into the room at that moment and asked Elder Dongfang what to do.","The elder who talked about taking 80% laughed. “Why are they going to mine No. 3 now? Don’t they know it’s sealed by the general’s Level 8 inscription?”","Elder Gu also laughed. “I’m sure they know it, but it doesn’t mean they can accept it. That’s why they want to look at it while they still can.”","“Hahahaha —”","Everybody laughed.","Why were they so sure they could take most of the all-purpose transformation liquid?","After the battle, Mr. Xu told Mr. Lu, “At least 50%.”","Mr. Xu had always been a domineering person. If he wanted at least 50%, he could easily have 70% or 80%.","Therefore, the elders of Imperial College wouldn’t like it at all.","“What can they possibly do? They have to see the big picture.” Elder Gu laughed.","The other laughed with him.","The mood was rather solemn at first, but everybody was much more relaxed now.","The elder asking for 90% was Elder Qiu, who was the cunning, sinister, and greedy type.","He laughed wholeheartedly. “Elder Dai, don’t panic.”","Elder Dai looked at him.","Elder Qiu said, “They’re intimidated. It means we’ve gained the upper hand in the negotiation between Mr. Xu and Mr. Lu. Imperial College must have compromised a lot.”","Elder Dai thought about it and felt Elder Qiu had a point.","He looked at Elder Dongfang. “What should we do now?”","Elder Dongfang said casually, “Let’s wait here. I think we’ll hear from Mr. Xu in a moment.”","The elders of the Military Academy sat there and happily talked about other things that had happened to Imperial College.","Were these elders very close? Not really.","They had different cultivation levels and had to compete over cultivation resources; of course things between them weren’t as friendly as it seemed. They had temporarily put aside their conflict because of Imperial College, which was their common enemy.","Nobody believed Feng Wu could break the Level 8 inscription set up by the general.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu had led the others to mine No. 3.","The elders all found a place to sit. Elder Helian took Feng Wu to the edge of the shore before sitting down.","“Xiao Wu, come here.”","Feng Wu looked at Elder Helian in bewilderment. They had arrived at their destination. Why were they just sitting there? Were they sunbathing?","“I need to get on with my work.” Feng Wu waved at him and wouldn’t go to his side.","Elder Helian looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment. He walked up to Feng Wu and stood by her side. Looking down at the all-purpose transformation liquid close by, he sighed. “Here’s a pool of all-purpose transformation liquid...”","He said guiltily, “Unfortunately, we can’t keep it safe. We’ve let our school down!","“If we could keep all the all-purpose transformation liquid, our elders will improve significantly. Apart from anything else, we won’t be so inferior when facing the elders of the Military Academy!”","Elder Helian became sadder as he spoke."]},{"number":3176,"title":"Chapter 3176 Northern Feng General","paragraphs":["3176 Northern Feng General","Elder Helian glanced at Feng Wu and saw that she seemed to be writing something on the protective dome with a pen. Was it “Open”?","It could be, but he wasn’t sure.","He knew it was something complicated.","She was moving around the all-purpose transformation liquid as she wrote.","Had she lost her mind because of all the things she had gone through?","At that thought, Elder Helian looked guiltily at Feng Wu. “Xiao Wu, don’t be too sad...”","Feng Wu ignored him because she was busy breaking the formation.","Her godfather knew both inscriptions and formations and was at Level 8 in both aspects. His work was quite advanced.","It would take Feng Wu a considerable amount of energy to open this seal.","Seeing that Feng Wu was still writing, Elder Helian followed her and kept talking. “Xiao Wu, cheer up. We’ll have to find other opportunities in the future. Let me talk to my superior. I’m sure we can keep half of the liquid.”","Feng Wu said, “Mr. Xu said he would take 70%.”","WHAT?!","Elder Helian was astonished.","He wasn’t alone. The other elders had been sitting idly on the shore and eyeing the all-purpose liquid. When they heard this, they almost jumped to their feet.","What was that?","“70%? Who can have 70%?”","Feng Wu was still moving around the dome, and all the elders were following her around now.","They all seemed very unhappy.","“Isn’t that obvious? The Military Academy will take 70%, and we’ll keep 30%.”","“How can he do that? That’s not fair!” Elder Helian’s face darkened. “What did Mr. Lu say? Did he just let them do this to us?”","Feng Wu shrugged. “The 50% is the result of Mr. Lu’s negotiation. That’s why Mr. Xu told me that we should feel grateful to get the other 50%.”","“Grateful? The all-purpose transformation liquid is ours! Why should we feel grateful for giving away 50%?!”Elder Mo bellowed.","The other elders were equally angry.","Feng Wu said, “According to Mr. Xu, the Military Academy has ten junior Spiritual Overlords, ten intermediate ones, four senior ones, and a peak Spiritual Overlord.”","The elders of Imperial College flushed in frustration.","They knew better than anyone else the capabilities of their own elders.","Because they didn’t have the advantage, the elders of Imperial College were a close-knit community.","Feng Wu’s voice rang out at that moment. “I’m risking my life here to break the seal for you. Guys, please don’t disappoint me.”","Break the seal?","The elders didn’t understand what she meant at first, but something soon began to happen.","Crack...","The transparent dome covering the all-purpose transformation liquid began to crack.","It started as a little gap, but the crack soon formed a spiderweb.","In the end —","The entire dome disappeared.","All the elders were astonished.","Meanwhile, in the general’s residence, Northern Feng General, who was recuperating in a secret chamber, slowly opened his eyes.","Someone had just destroyed his protective barrier.","He narrowed his eyes and saw what was going on in mine No. 3.","His pupils contracted when he saw the girl with the Phoenix Pen.","Phoenix Pen!","Master Linghu’s Phoenix Pen!","Of course, Northern Feng General knew who Master Linghu was.","Master Linghu was the one who had taught him inscriptions and formations, but the master had never given him the Phoenix Pen.","Master Linghu wasn’t the general’s official teacher, but he was the closest thing to a teacher that the general ever had."]},{"number":3177,"title":"Chapter 3177 Jump in","paragraphs":["3177 Jump in","Feng Wu had no idea that the Northern Feng General had sensed what she did.","Even if she knew, she wouldn’t think much of it because he was her godfather.","Elder Helian and the others were all astonished.","Of course there were.","The dome was made out of a Level 8 inscription, but Feng Wu had just broken it.","“You...” Elder Helian stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","So did the elders around him.","They couldn’t believe their eyes.","Elder Helian stared at Feng Wu. “How did you do it? How...”","Feng Wu shrugged. “It’s just a Level 8 inscription. It’s not as hard as you think.”","Someone in the crowd suddenly spoke.","“Miss Feng Wu, I know you’re a great formation master, but I didn’t know you were equally impressive in inscriptions.” That was Elder Mei, who had dealt with Feng Wu before.","“You’re more talented than the last time we met,” Elder Mei said emotionally.","Making progress was very hard for formation masters, and each improvement felt like being reborn.","He couldn’t figure out why it was so easy for Feng Wu to make progress.","Elder Helian stared at Elder Mei. “Do you mean...”","The others all looked at Elder Mei.","Elder Mei said solemnly, “She’s particularly good at formations. I think she’s higher than Level 8. As for her inscription skills... You’ve seen it yourselves.”","Nobody made a sound.","Elder Helian opened his mouth and wanted to tell the others the girl was also a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","In the end, he didn’t say anything","but only looked up at the sky.","If he told the others, he was worried the girl’s unbelievable talent would make God jealous. Imperial College couldn’t afford to lose such a genius.","Seeing the dumbfounded elders, Feng Wu calmly pointed at the all-purpose transformation liquid. “The all-purpose transformation liquid right down below. Get inside.”","“But...” Elder Helian hesitated. “Is that a good idea? It feels like we’re stealing what is entrusted to our care.”","Feng Wu asked the elders, “Did I win this mine for Imperial College?”","The elders said, “Yes!”","Feng Wu asked, “Did I discover the all-purpose transformation liquid?”","The elders said, “Yes!”","Feng Wu asked, “Do I have the right to distribute my belongings?”","The elders said, “Yes!”","After answering the questions, the elders felt that their reaction was a little childish.","Feng Wu waved at them. “Hurry up. When the Military Academy hears about this, they’ll be rushing here like blood-sucking locusts. As for the blame from our superior... I’d like to see who will blame me for using my own things!","“The law doesn’t punish numerous offenders. What can they possibly do to you?","“Are they going to destroy all your abilities?","“A bird in the hand is worth two in the bush. If you don’t draw the lottery now, they’ll take this chance away!”","The elders realized she was right.","What could the empire possibly do to them?","As for Feng Wu...","When they all became more capable, they could protect her together and wouldn’t let anyone punish her.","At that thought, Elder Helian waved his hand. “She’s right! We need to make it an established fact! Get in! Hurry up!”","He chased the other elders into the liquid like chasing a flock of ducks."]},{"number":3178,"title":"Chapter 3178 Elder Helian Comes Out First","paragraphs":["3178 Elder Helian Comes Out First","After all the others jumped in, Feng Wu told Elder Helian, “You should join them.”","Elder Helian wanted to turn down the offer, but Feng Wu said, “You still have two opportunities. It’ll be a shame to waste them.","“Elder Dongfang made a breakthrough recently and is more capable than you now.","“Do you know why she’s always so arrogant? The two of you are the leaders of the two schools, but she’s always better than you.","“Elder Helian, you’re the head of the elders in our school. Mr. Lu isn’t reliable, so we’re counting on you!”","Feng Wu patted Elder Helian on the shoulder.","Elder Helian suddenly felt the weight of his responsibility.","She was right. Mr. Lu was too easy to persuade. Elder Helian knew he needed to improve his capability.","“The elders of the Military Academy are coming. Mr. Xu and even the general will be here, too. Elder Helian, you need to improve your capability now!”","Elder Helian felt something burning in his chest.","He gave Feng Wu a solemn nod before she jumped into the all-purpose transformation liquid.","Feng Wu didn’t stay idle. She picked up the Phoenix Pen and started walking around.","What was she doing?","The answer was easy. She was setting up a camouflage.","After she was done, from afar, other people would see the elders sunbathing on the shore.","Of course, the camouflage would stop working when the watchers moved closer.","The pool containing the all-purpose transformation liquid was only over a hundred square meters. After the twenty elders jumped in, there was little room left.","A person needed some room when refining the energy of the liquid. They couldn’t afford any disturbance.","After setting up the camouflage, Feng Wu decided to add a protective dome.","The general had used one to keep everybody out.","She would do the same.","Feng Wu picked up her Phoenix Pen and walked around the mine again. Every now and then, she would write a “Seal” in the air.","The process was very energy-consuming.","The all-purpose transformation liquid was the only reason that Feng Wu could break the previous seal and set up a new one.","Even the general would need a while to open up her dome.","“What a pity,” thought Feng Wu.","She couldn’t create a seal of this scale in other places without the all-purpose transformation liquid. Otherwise, she would be able to do almost anything she wanted.","Feng Wu rubbed her temple. Using formations and inscriptions repeatedly had exhausted her.","Her temples were throbbing.","She had reached her limit.","What she didn’t know was how much more energetic she was compared with other people. Even Level 8 inscription and formation masters would need days to create this seal.","...","Time crawled by.","Feng Wu saw all the elders glowing in the all-purpose transformation liquid.","15 minutes later, Elder Helian was the first to come out.","He had drawn the lottery once and gained dozens of years worth of cultivation experience. What did he gain this time?","Feng Wu looked at him.","Elder Helian could barely control his impulse to guffaw.","Feng Wu had him sit down.","“I’ve sealed the mine,” she told Elder Helian. “Feel free to speak. You won’t affect the other elders.”"]},{"number":3179,"title":"Chapter 3179 Let’s Show Them","paragraphs":["3179 Let’s Show Them","Elder Helian stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","He soon realized the girl was one of the best formation masters and inscription masters. She was a genius!","Even that was an understatement!","Elder Helian had been shocked too many times and had gotten used to it. He sat down next to Feng Wu and told her what he had obtained.","!!","Feng Wu’s eyes sparkled as she listened. “Does that mean you can become a Spiritual Overlord any time you want?”","Elder Helian nodded in excitement.","He used to be inferior to Elder Dongfang, but that would no longer be the case.","“I’ll soon become a lot stronger than that old hag!” Elder Helian was over the moon. “She can’t be so arrogant toward me anymore!”","Feng Wu said, “Make your breakthrough now.”","Elder Helian looked at Feng Wu in concern. “Didn’t you say the general and Mr. Xu would be here soon?”","Feng Wu said, “They won’t be able to do anything after you guys all make breakthroughs. Go ahead.”","Elder Helian thought about it and agreed with her.","He didn’t need to sit in the all-purpose transformation liquid to make his breakthrough.","He could do it while sitting next to Feng Wu.","Elder Mo came out as well.","Feng Wu had examined the elders before and knew he was a junior Spiritual Overlord.","Elder Mo seemed to be over the moon.","Feng Wu asked him what he had gained.","Elder Mo said, “I can become a senior at any moment!”","A senior Spiritual Overlord? That meant he could skip the intermediate stage.","Seeing the look in Feng Wu’s eyes, Elder Mo said excitedly, “Yes! Directly to the senior stage!”","Feng Wu said, “What are you waiting for, then?”","Elder Mo said, “Alright!”","Hence, Elder Mo sat down next to Elder Helian and started cultivating.","Gradually, more and more elders came out of the pond.","By the looks on their faces, Feng Wu knew they had made some great achievements.","Their eyes all sparkled as they looked at Feng Wu.","They were all thrilled.","Feng Wu said, “Start cultivating now. Get as much out of it as you can.”","After a pause, she added, “The elders of the Military Academy will be here soon, and we’ll show them our muscle!”","Hearing this, the elders’ eyes all sparkled.","Yes!","They would show the Military Academy’s elders what they could do!","The thought of the looks on those people’s faces excited them.","They all found a spot behind Elder Helian and started cultivating.","By then, there were only a few elders left who were soaking in the liquid.","Feng Wu checked the time and wondered why Elder Wu hadn’t returned with those people.","Yang Zhihu was the first to arrive, and Feng Wu told him to get in.","Yang Zhihu hesitated at first, but Feng Wu said, “The Military Academy’s people are coming here to punish me in a moment. You have to get stronger and protect me!”","Hearing this, Yang Zhihu nodded repeatedly. “Alright! You can count on me!”","He immediately jumped into the all-purpose transformation liquid.","Feng Wu had sealed the mine with a dome, leaving only one opening for everybody to enter and exit.","She studied the all-purpose transformation liquid.","Elder Helian was right. The active ingredient in the liquid would eventually be used up."]},{"number":3180,"title":"Chapter 3180 Feng Wu Wouldn’t Have It","paragraphs":["3180 Feng Wu Wouldn’t Have It","After the elders came out, the dark-green color faded a little, becoming a lighter shade.","Feng Wu did some calculations and knew she could still fit many people into the liquid.","Seeing that Elder Mo had finished cultivating, she whispered something in his ear.","Elder Mo nodded and headed for the colonels’ quarters.","Poor Elder Mo.","He had been downgraded to a messenger, but he rather enjoyed it.","He found Wang Zhaole and told the latter to gather everybody in three minutes and take them to mine No. 3. The whole thing should be kept a secret, and no one was allowed to leak the information. Otherwise, they would be punished by military law.","It was now a time of war, and everybody was prepared for emergencies like this.","Some colonels had gone to the Dayless Woods to carry out missions, and the rest were in the fortress.","Feng Wu had thought about them because when she was sleeping earlier, Yang Zhihu had asked all the colonels to look for her through the night. She felt she owed them one, and she never wanted to owe anybody anything.","Now was the perfect time to return this little favor.","When Wang Zhaole gathered everybody, he saw that three people were missing.","They were Yan Han, Han Lu and Gao Ya.","Yang Hong said, “Mr. Yang ordered Yan Han to stay in seclusion for three days, so...”","Wang Zhaole waved him off. “We’re going on a mission this time, and it could be dangerous. She’s not exactly a capable cultivator... Forget it. Let her stay here.”","The others all nodded.","Yan Han became a colonel because of her connection with Elder Yan and her skill with inscriptions. As a result, she was a qualified member of the colonels’ quarters. However, her actual capability was a different story.","“As for Han Lu and Gao Ya...” Wang Zhaole frowned. “They’re both still injured. How are they going to fight? Let them stay here. We’re leaving!”","When Elder Mo told Wang Zhaole to gather everybody, he didn’t mention the all-purpose transformation liquid. Wang Zhaole didn’t leave the three people out on purpose.","In mine No. 3, Feng Wu waited and waited, and her friends finally arrived.","She was used to giving out favors instead of receiving them.","She had returned that favor when she gave her friends the badges. There was no need to do more, but the all-purpose transformation liquid was available, so why not use it?","If they didn’t use it, the Military Academy would.","The man who said he would take 70% would use it.","That wasn’t going to happen!","Feng Wu wouldn’t have it!","Feng Wu’s list contained a lot of people. There was Ying Yuan, Chen Ziyun, and Sun Yu. Even Yang Wan and her friends were included.","They were thrilled to see Feng Wu, but before they had time to greet her, Feng Wu pointed at the all-purpose transformation liquid. “Get in!”","What?","They jumped into the liquid before they knew what they were doing.","As soon as they were inside, they felt the benefits of the all-purpose transformation liquid.","Somebody shouted, “I’ve just gained ten years’ worth of cultivation experience!”","“My skills have improved!”","“My dantian has expanded!”","...","Feng Wu saw the color of the all-purpose transformation liquid turn lighter.","After they got out, Feng Wu told them to find a corner to cultivate."]},{"number":3181,"title":"Chapter 3181 Stop!!!","paragraphs":["3181 Stop!!!","She told them to stay in a corner because she didn’t want them to be disturbed when the elders of the two schools started fighting.","However, at that moment —","Wang Zhaole arrived with his people.","Elder Yan was slightly distracted when he heard that all the colonels were here.","All the colonels...","Yan Han was a colonel, too. Since all the colonels were here, Yan Han had to be here with them.","Elder Yan was glad.","Feng Wu was an amazing girl.","He decided to tell Yan Han later that she should get along well with Feng Wu. That way, her future would be promising.","The elders treated her as their equal and would even run errands for her.","Elder Yan put away all thoughts and focused on his cultivation again.","What he didn’t know was that Yan Han wasn’t among the colonels.","Moreover, Yan Han and Feng Wu were anything but friends.","Feng Wu looked up at the sky and saw little black dots. What were those?","The elders of the Military Academy!","“Get inside! Now!”","Wang Zhaole was glad to see Feng Wu. He wanted to chat with her, but she suddenly kicked him into the all-purpose transformation liquid.","“Cough, cough —”","Wang Zhaole almost choked on the liquid.","“Feng Wu, why are you doing this to me...”","Urged by Feng Wu, all the colonels jumped into the liquid one after another.","Feng Wu smiled and wrote something on the opening.","Seal!","The all-purpose transformation liquid was completely sealed up now.","As for herself...","Feng Wu had stored some all-purpose transformation liquid in her storage space and could use it whenever she wanted.","Whoosh!","People began to land from above.","The first one was Elder Dongfang.","As soon as she landed, she ran toward the all-purpose transformation liquid.","She was astonished by what she saw.","Because!","A lot of youngsters were floating in it.","Dongfang Ziyun immediately recognized them.","“They’re the colonels of Imperial College!” Dongfang Ziyun’s eyes had turned red.","She was so jealous.","All the colonels were floating in the all-purpose transformation liquid and absorbing its energy.","Elder Dongfang realized the liquid was only mildly green now.","She knew that if these people continued to absorb the energy, the green color would only become lighter.","When the liquid became light green, would it still be the all-purpose transformation liquid?","No!","It would become ordinary essence liquid, which was only slightly better than essence crystals.","“No!!!”","Elder Dongfang stared at the all-purpose transformation liquid with bloodshot eyes.","The elders around her looked like they were going to lose their minds.","A moment ago, they had been dreaming of taking 70% or 80% of the liquid. The most greedy ones even wanted to take all the liquid, but that dream had just been shattered.","There was less than 10% left.","“Elder Dongfang, please make them stop! Tell them to stop!” they all urged Elder Dongfang."]},{"number":3182,"title":"Chapter 3182 The All-Purpose Transformation Liquid Is Gone","paragraphs":["3182 The All-Purpose Transformation Liquid Is Gone","Didn’t Elder Dongfang want to stop them?","She wanted to, but she couldn’t.","As soon as she saw the colonels, she wanted to jump into the liquid, but she only managed to bump her head on the dome.","That hurt!","When the other elders saw all the colonels in the liquid, their eyes popped.","D*mn it!","They all tried to jump into the all-purpose transformation liquid from above.","The colonels watched this in astonishment.","Holy crap!","The elders of the Military Academy looked like they wanted to kill someone.","Were they going to get in?","They were all frightened.","Wang Zhaole felt the same as everybody else.","When Feng Wu kicked him into the liquid, he complained about how she treated him. However, he soon realized the benefits of the liquid and became dumbfounded.","He had suddenly become a level higher!","Gosh!","The higher one’s level was, the harder it was to make a breakthrough. However, it had happened just like that!","Was this some kind of divine liquid?","It had to be since the elders of the Military Academy looked like they had lost their minds.","“Don’t!”","Elder Dongfang tried to stop them.","However, she was too late.","The elders smashed their heads on the transparent dome.","Ssss —","Wang Zhaole could tell how painful it was just by looking at them.","They had jumped down from so high up.","He saw a purple bump appear on one elder’s head right away, making him hiss.","The elders of the Military Academy looked like ants on a hot pan.","The all-purpose transformation liquid was running out, but they couldn’t get in.","How frustrating!","The two sides were suddenly at a stalemate.","While the young colonels inside the dome enjoyed the benefits of the liquid, the elders outside lost their minds.","Seeing this, Feng Wu didn’t want to get involved. She closed her eyes and pretended she didn’t know what was going on.","Elder Dongfang finally saw Feng Wu.","She didn’t confront Elder Helian because she knew the whole thing was Feng Wu’s doing.","“You must be so pleased with yourself!” Elder Dongfang stared at Feng Wu. “How dare you!”","Feng Wu acted as if she couldn’t hear her.","Elder Dongfang went up to Feng Wu and glared at her from above.","She reached out and tried to grab Feng Wu by the collar.","Obviously, Elder Dongfang wanted to pick Feng Wu up by the collar.","She was treating the girl like a servant.","But...","Before she could do that, Feng Wu stuffed something into her hand.","It was the token.","It was equivalent to having the owner of the token here.","Elder Dongfang was speechless.","She stared at the token as if it burned her palm.","Only then did she realize that the token belonged to Emperor Wu.","Feng Wu was the crown prince’s favorite girl.","This was so frustrating!","Elder Dongfang forced herself to calm down.","Although Peace Grassland was beyond Northern Border City, it was still ruled by the law of the empire.","They were all the emperor’s subjects.","She couldn’t defy Emperor Wu.","“Elder Dongfang, the active ingredient in the all-purpose transformation liquid is completely gone!” Elder Dai reported to Elder Dongfang with bloodshot eyes."]},{"number":3183,"title":"Chapter 3183 The General Had a Headache","paragraphs":["3183 The General Had a Headache","Had they been dreaming?","They actually thought they could take a large chunk away.","There was nothing left for them!","“It’s Imperial College’s doing! It has to be them!” Elder Dai looked like he had lost his mind.","He had forgotten about his manners and dignity.","The hell with all that! He just wanted to cultivate!","At that moment, Feng Wu finally opened her eyes and rose to her feet.","Elder Helian was exasperated.","He hadn’t finished his breakthrough yet and wished Feng Wu would remain still.","Feng Wu tilted her head and smiled at Elder Dongfang. “Do you want to kill me?","Elder Dongfang had calmed down from her initial frantic state. Her face was expressionless and her eyes were cold.","Before Elder Dongfang could say anything, Elder Dai bellowed at Feng Wu, “I’m gonna kill you!”","He charged at Feng Wu, but Elder Dongfang stopped him.","Elder Dai stared at Elder Dongfang in bewilderment.","Why?","Elder Dongfang ignored Elder Dai and only stared at Feng Wu. “It was you, wasn’t it?!”","All the elders of the Military Academy behind Elder Dongfang stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","It was her?","This girl?!","Elder Dongfang kept her cold gaze on Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smiled at her. “Didn’t the general set up the protective barrier?”","The elders behind Elder Dongfang all found it strange because Feng Wu was telling the truth.","“How did the people of Imperial College get in?!” Elder Dai questioned Feng Wu.","Feng Wu tilted her head. “We just could.”","Elder Dai said, “I don’t believe you!”","Feng Wu said, “I’m telling the truth. We can go in right now. Maybe the general favors us over you.”","Elder Dai smirked. “I’d like to see how you did it!","“I’ll believe you if you can go inside now.”","Feng Wu chuckled.","Elder Helian and the other cultivating members of Imperial College also let out a breath of relief.","As long as they didn’t need to fight, Xiao Wu could pass any test.","“That’s right. If you can get in, we’ll believe the general favors your school!” said the other elders of the Military Academy.","They agreed because they were certain it was impossible.","They had tried kicking, burning, and using lightning on the dome, but they still couldn’t get in.","In the general’s residence, Northern Feng General was watching Feng Wu from afar while recuperating in the secret chamber.","He didn’t know how to describe the behavior of the elders of the Military Academy.","The general rubbed his temple. He was getting a headache.","As expected, Feng Wu immediately took action.","She went up to the all-purpose transformation liquid. No, it should be called essence liquid now.","She stepped over the edge.","Thump —","She was in the pool.","Half of the people onshore stared at her.","That half was the elders of the Military Academy.","They couldn’t believe their eyes.","They were all capable Spiritual Overlords, but they couldn’t get in no matter how hard they tried. However, Feng Wu was only a Spiritual King.","She made it seem so easy!","Elder Dongfang swayed a little and started to panic.","Because Mr. Xu used to serve Emperor Wu, when he became the head of the Military Academy, the school received a lot of favors, which was why the Military Academy had become so powerful, but now...","It seemed the general preferred Imperial College."]},{"number":3184,"title":"Chapter 3184 Inviolable Master","paragraphs":["3184 Inviolable Master","Had the general started favoring Imperial College now?","The idea filled Elder Dongfang with sorrow.","She was frustrated and distressed, but she didn’t dare lash out at anybody.","Behind her were the other elders, who were dumbfounded when they saw Feng Wu jump in.","How was that possible?","Elder Dai rushed to the opening where Feng Wu had entered and tried to get through.","He made a diving gesture.","Unfortunately, his head bumped into the dome with a thump.","Ssss —","A lump immediately formed on his forehead.","He already had one from the first attempt, and the two symmetrical lumps now looked like a pair of horns.","They were kind of adorable.","However, the elders of the Military Academy didn’t see it that way. They were horrified.","“Why...”","“Why could she get in?”","“Why can’t we?!”","The discovery felt like a bucket of cold water poured over their heads.","They were so aggressive earlier, but now, they were all frozen on the spot and didn’t know what to do.","Two people finally arrived at that moment.","They were Mr. Xu and Mr. Lu.","Seeing them, the elders became excited and greeted their respective schoolmasters.","Chen Ziyun and his friends sat quietly in the corner.","The teenagers in the pool were also speechless.","They watched the scene with blank looks on their faces.","What...","What was the occasion?","Apart from this benefit, they even got to see so many important people.","Their hearts had raced when Feng Wu confronted Elder Dongfang.","Elder Dongfang was the head of all those elders!","However, Feng Wu simply snapped back at Elder Dongfang without hesitation!","She was dauntless and wouldn’t give in.","Somehow, she won the argument.","And now, they saw the two schoolmasters, who almost never showed up in public.","They were Mr. Lu of Imperial College and Mr. Xu of the Military Academy.","What happened today was beyond everybody’s expectations.","They thought they were dreaming.","As soon as Mr. Xu and Mr. Lu landed, Elder Dai angrily went up to Mr. Xu and asked, “Mr. Xu, why did this happen?”","Elder Dai pointed at what used to be the all-purpose transformation liquid. “Aren’t we supposed to have at least half of it? It’s all gone!”","Mr. Xu fixed his cold gaze on Elder Dai and asked in a stern tone, “Are you blaming me now?”","He sounded like he could kill someone right now.","Elder Dai was petrified.","Only then did he realize he was talking to Mr. Xu, a Spiritual Saint whose eyes he couldn’t meet.","Elder Dai immediately shut up, but he didn’t seem convinced.","He wasn’t alone.","None of the Military Academy’s elders were convinced.","Mr. Xu didn’t speak. He turned around and stared at someone on the other side of the dome.","When his cold gaze met Feng Wu’s eyes, Feng Wu felt like her eyes were being stabbed by needles.","Even with the protective barrier, Feng Wu felt a searing headache, and her mind went blank for a moment.","That was the effect of a capable master’s gaze.","Mr. Xu was one of the best cultivators in the empire, and he wouldn’t let anyone challenge his authority."]},{"number":3185,"title":"Chapter 3185 I Want to Make a Breakthrough","paragraphs":["3185 I Want to Make a Breakthrough","Just then, Mr. Lu stepped forward and blocked Mr. Xu’s sight.","He waved at Feng Wu. “Kiddo, come out here.”","Feng Wu rubbed her temples. Her mind had gone blank for a moment back there. She was much better now, but her head was still spinning a little.","She snorted. Why would she go out just because they told her to? That wasn’t very polite.","Just then, Wang Zhaole nudged Feng Wu a little and whispered, “Xiao Wu, Mr. Lu is talking to you.”","A common student like Wang Zhaole wouldn’t know what to do in the current situation.","The elders on the shore were some of the most capable masters. It was hard for anybody to imagine ever meeting them.","Wang Zhaole was surprised to see Feng Wu ignore Mr. Lu.","Most of the colonels were still in the pool, and they were all watching Feng Wu eagerly.","Mr. Lu looked at Feng Wu and sighed. “Come out now.”","Feng Wu snorted but eventually left the dome.","Mr. Lu told Chen Ziyun and his friends, who were hiding in a corner in astonishment, “You can go back to your living quarters now.”","However, Chen Ziyun looked at Feng Wu in concern.","Feng Wu waved at them.","Recalling that the crown prince was Feng Wu’s patron, Chen Ziyun nodded and left with the others.","Mr. Lu kept his cold gaze on Wang Zhaole, and the latter immediately felt suffocated.","“May we leave now?” Wang Zhaole stammered from fear.","Mr. Lu nodded.","Wang Zhaole glanced at Feng Wu, who nodded at him.","Wang Zhaole and the other colonels immediately dashed off.","Oh god!","When they returned to the colonels’ quarters, they all sat on the ground, and no one spoke a word.","Their foreheads were covered with sweat.","Yang Hong felt his back and found it covered with sweat.","“Holy crap! That was an eye-opener!” Yang Hong was amazed. “I never thought I would see so many elders in one day.”","The others all nodded.","It was one of the most miraculous days of their lives.","“I’ve never seen them quarrel that way. I thought they were different from us. They’re supposed to be beings on another level who eat no mortal food and show no emotions. Who could have known? They can argue and fight as well.”","Everybody nodded.","“I was too scared to breathe and almost fainted. I thought if I so much as breathed, Mr. Lu would look at me. That feeling was so scary.”","“Did you notice Feng Wu wasn’t afraid of the elders at all?”","“That’s right. Elder Dongfang obviously wanted to hit her, but she forced herself to stop.”","“That was amazing! Feng Wu was bold enough to talk back to Elder Dongfang!”","“That wasn’t all. Did you see that? When Mr. Lu told her to come out, she defied his order at first!”","The colonels fell silent when they recalled what Feng Wu had done.","How courageous!","“I wonder if Feng Wu can come out alive...”","“Feng Wu is a really nice person. Elder Mei told me she was the one who told him to fetch us.”","“The elders of the Military Academy desperately want that liquid, but we ended up absorbing all of it.”"]},{"number":3186,"title":"Chapter 3186 Intimidate You as a Junior","paragraphs":["3186 Intimidate You as a Junior","“I feel like I’m about to make a breakthrough!”","“So do I!”","“Me, too!”","Wang Zhaole was the first person to express that urge, and his colleagues chimed in.","In the end, most of the colonels said they were going to make a breakthrough.","How terrifying!","Instead of returning to their rooms, they sat down in the square and started cultivating.","Meanwhile, in mine No. 3, Mr. Lu had dismissed his subordinates and was looking at the stubborn girl in resignation.","“Apologize to Mr. Xu.”","Mr. Lu put on a straight face.","Was he glad? Of course.","He wasn’t stupid. He never wanted to share the liquid with Mr. Xu when Imperial College didn’t have enough resources.","Even the graduates would improve significantly after soaking in the liquid, not to mention the elders. This year, Imperial College would have much stronger colonels.","However, Mr. Lu couldn’t let his feelings show. He had to frown and stare at Feng Wu, and tell her to apologize to Mr. Xu.","Mr. Xu put his hands behind his back, and his face was livid.","He had never expected this to happen.","Apologize? Feng Wu tilted her head. “Why should I apologize?”","Mr. Lu gave Feng Wu a warning look.","“We’ve gained actual benefits. Show them some respect, and this will be over soon. Isn’t that the right way?”","“No!” Feng Wu stared back at Mr. Lu.","Mr. Lu rubbed his temples and felt he had never had such a difficult student.","Seeing the exchange of looks between Mr. Lu and Feng Wu, Mr. Xu smirked. “Young lady, you’re very arrogant.”","Here we go!","Elder Dongfang and her people all became excited.","So what if Feng Wu had the token? Mr. Xu used to personally serve Emperor Wu!","Feng Wu smiled at Mr. Xu. “Arrogant? Am I? Mr. Xu, you’re giving me a bad name so that you can hang me. Just because you’re a schoolmaster doesn’t mean you can blame me for everything. I won’t have it.”","Mr. Xu’s face turned livid.","He had never met a girl so good at quarreling!","“You’re just a Spiritual King, but you’re talking back to me. Aren’t you arrogant?” Mr. Xu became serious.","Feng Wu said, “So what if I’m a Spiritual King? Everybody was a Spiritual King once. Mr. Xu, were you a Spiritual Saint when you were born?”","Mr. Xu was speechless.","Taking a deep breath, he glanced at Mr. Lu. “Does Imperial College have speech classes?”","Feng Wu smirked. “Are you trying to use my superior to intimidate me? Why don’t you fight your own battle?”","Mr. Xu put his hands behind his back. “I’m a senior, and I’ll use that to my advantage.”","Elder Dongfang almost couldn’t recognize Mr. Xu anymore.","He used to be an unapproachable man, but now, he was arguing with a child.","Feng Wu smirked. “In that case, I’m a junior, and I’ll use that to my advantage!”","“Against me?” Mr. Xu couldn’t believe his ears.","“No junior can intimidate me!” Mr. Xu laughed wildly.","He was right.","Mr. Xu was a Spiritual Saint, and the Junwu Empire only had a handful of such cultivators.","How could a junior intimidate him? The girl had to be dreaming."]},{"number":3187,"title":"Chapter 3187 Exposed","paragraphs":["3187 Exposed","Feng Wu said seriously, “What if a junior can intimidate you?”","“If you can accomplish that impossible mission...”","Mr. Xu stared at Feng Wu and pointed at the pool of liquid. “I’ll forget about what happened to the all-purpose transformation liquid!”","Mr. Lu gave Mr. Xu a strange look, and so did Elder Helian.","Both of them were thinking of the same name.","However, Mr. Xu had no idea what they were thinking, and he sneered at Feng Wu. He sounded so sure of himself.","Feng Wu said, “Alright! It’s a deal! We’ll meet again in a month. If you lose, you’ll have to forget about this incident and hold no more grudges against us. If you win, I’ll give you a new pool of all-purpose transformation liquid!”","“Where are you going to find that?” Mr. Xu stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “Why do you think you can win?”","Mr. Xu was speechless.","He decided not to talk to her unless it was necessary because it would damage his image as an unapproachable man.","Mr. Xu smirked. “Bring it on!”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Everybody here will be our witness!”","Elder Dongfang wanted to warn Mr. Xu, but Mr. Xu had already taken the challenge. She didn’t know what to tell him now.","Elder Dai snorted. “Are you going to ask His Royal Highness for help?”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “That’s so clever of you! No points for getting the right answer, though.”","His Royal Highness?","Mr. Xu’s pupils contracted, and he glared at Feng Wu.","“Do you know His Royal Highness well?”","Feng Wu said, “Elder Dongfang knows my relationship with the crown prince.”","Elder Dongfang wanted to slap Feng Wu.","What an evil girl!","Mr. Xu turned his cold gaze on Elder Dongfang.","Having no other choice, Elder Dongfang tried to choose the right words. “Feng Wu... She socializes with His Royal Highness quite often, I guess...”","Mr. Xu heaved a sigh in relief. He could accept that.","Feng Wu smiled. “Are you sure it’s only ‘socializing’?”","Elder Dongfang glared at Feng Wu. “How would you describe your relationship, then?”","Feng Wu smiled. “You’ll never know what our relationship is.”","She had convinced herself that she and Jun Linyuan were best friends.","Mr. Xu studied Feng Wu. He still didn’t believe Jun Linyuan would turn against the head of the Military Academy for a girl.","She was a nobody, and he was a schoolmaster. Anyone would choose him over her.","But what if Jun Linyuan really was in love with her?","Mr. Xu stared at Feng Wu, his brain racing.","Nobody knew what he was thinking.","Right at that moment...","They heard a stern voice.","“Little Feng Wu! Get over here!”","That was the general’s voice!","The general was more capable than either of the schoolmasters. Because of that, the two schools had reached an equilibrium, and their conflicts were kept at bay.","The general had just called Feng Wu by her name.","Did he know her?","Everybody reacted differently to the general’s voice.","The elders of Imperial College turned pale and forgot to breathe.","Oh god...","What she did had been exposed!"]},{"number":3188,"title":"Chapter 3188 Do You Want to Fight Me?","paragraphs":["3188 Do You Want to Fight Me?","Feng Wu had destroyed the general’s formation to let everybody absorb the all-purpose transformation liquid. After that, she also put the blame on the general.","Hearing the general’s angry voice, they were worried that he would punish her now.","While the elders of Imperial College panicked, those of the Military Academy began to celebrate.","“Feng Wu, it’s over for you!”","Even Mr. Xu’s expression changed a little.","Half of the people here couldn’t wait to see the general punish Feng Wu, while the other half was worried sick.","Elder Helian was among the latter.","However, Feng Wu acted as if nothing had happened. She turned to Elder Helian. “How do I get to the general’s residence?”","Elder Helian said nervously, “The general is very strict!”","Feng Wu said, “I know.”","Feng Xun had complained to her more than once about his angry and serious father, who always scolded him.","The way his father treated him still gave him nightmares.","“The general even reprimands His Royal Highness when he sees fit!” Elder Helian reminded Feng Wu. “His Royal Highness always listens to him.”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. She didn’t know that.","Jun Linyuan wasn’t afraid of anybody. To make him listen, Northern Feng General had to have been really nice to him when he was little.","Elder Helian warned Feng Wu, “You must be extra careful. Don’t talk back, and don’t act cute...”","He gave Feng Wu a lot of instructions.","She was like a granddaughter to him, and he was genuinely worried about her.","Feng Wu patted Elder Helian on the shoulder. “Don’t worry about it. The general won’t scold me.”","Elder Helian rolled his eyes at her, not believing a word she said.","After some thought, he said, “I’ll go with you.”","However, Mr. Lu shook his head. “I’ll go with her.”","Elder Helian nodded.","With Mr. Lu there, the general would show Feng Wu some leniency.","An idea struck Elder Helian, and he told Feng Wu, “If the general looks like he wants to kill you, tell him your other skills! Remember that!”","Elder Helian thought the general would value her talent as a Semi-Divine medicine refiner and a Level 8 inscription master.","Mr. Xu glanced at Feng Wu and smirked. “I don’t have anything to do at the moment. I’ll go with you.”","Feng Wu looked at him. “Why?”","Mr. Xu smiled, but there was no emotion in his eyes.","Feng Wu knew he wanted to laugh at her defeat.","However, that wasn’t going to happen because the general was her godfather! Feng Wu was very confident, but deep down, she was a little worried.","The general held such a high position in the military.","He had Mr. Lu and Mr. Xu’s respect, and even Jun Linyuan would listen to him, not to mention all the elders. What kind of person was General Feng Xiangnan?","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead. If she had known this would happen, she would have talked with Feng Xun more about his father. She felt a little at a loss right now.","She couldn’t greet him by saying, “Hi, dad. I’m the goddaughter you’ve never met before.”","That sounded so embarrassing.","She didn’t even know if the general knew about his goddaughter.","As soon as Feng Wu and the two schoolmasters left, the others started talking.","Elder Dongfang glared at Elder Helian.","Elder Helian smirked. “What? Do you want to fight me?”"]},{"number":3189,"title":"Chapter 3189 Xiao Wu","paragraphs":["3189 Xiao Wu","Elder Helian smirked. “What? Do you want to fight me?”","Elder Dongfang looked from Elder Helian to the elders behind him.","She looked at each one of them in turn.","Mr. Xu had done exactly the same thing. He had looked at Elder Helian and each elder, and his face had darkened after that.","Elder Dongfang had the same look on her face now.","The elders of Imperial College had become stronger.","Elder Helian was satisfied. “You can see it, can’t you?”","The other elders behind Elder Helian laughed as well.","Having soaked in the all-purpose transformation liquid, the elders had improved significantly.","At first, Imperial College had fifteen junior Spiritual Overlords, seven intermediate ones, two senior ones, and one peak Spiritual Overlord.","Of the 25 elders from the Military Academy, ten were junior Spiritual Overlords, ten were intermediate ones, four were senior ones, and one was a peak Spiritual Overlord.","What about now?","Imperial College had no junior Spiritual Overlords, twenty intermediate ones, four senior ones, and a Spiritual Saint!","Yes, Elder Helian was a Spiritual Saint now.","The fortress had one more Spiritual Saint.","What about the Military Academy?","It had remained the same.","That was why Elder Helian wasn’t afraid of fighting.","Right now, the elders of Imperial College were as capable as those of the Military Academy.","When they finished absorbing the spiritual essence, the Military Academy wouldn’t be their match.","It felt great!","Elder Dongfang’s face darkened further when she saw how happy Elder Helian was.","Would the Military Academy become inferior to Imperial College again? She wouldn’t have it!","“Why are you gloating? Are you so sure Feng Wu will come back alive?”","Hearing this, the elders behind her all laughed.","That was right. Feng Wu had to face Northern Feng General, who was supposed to be a relentless and invincible man.","It was said that Northern Feng General wouldn’t even give in to His Majesty. How could a mere token stop him from doing what he wanted?","Feng Wu couldn’t talk her way out of this.","Elder Helian immediately lost all interest in quarreling with Elder Dongfang.","Feng Wu...","He threw a dirty look at Elder Dongfang and led his elders away. “Let’s go!”","He and the others would kneel outside the general’s residence to apologize for their offense.","Seeing Elder Helian and his people heading for the general’s residence, Elder Dongfang smirked and waved her hand. The others all followed her.","Although they had lost the all-purpose transformation liquid, seeing Feng Wu getting punished was the next best thing.","Meanwhile, in the main corridor, Feng Wu walked in the middle with Mr. Lu on her right and Mr. Xu on her left.","None of them spoke.","As soon as Mr. Lu opened his mouth, Mr. Xu smirked. “Lu, you can’t change anything now.”","Mr. Lu looked at him. “She’s a genius.”","Mr. Xu asked, “Is she a genius at quarreling?”","Mr. Lu asked, “Are you seriously going to argue with a girl?”","Mr. Xu smirked. So what if the answer was yes?","Feng Wu remained perfectly calm.","Seeing her like that, Mr. Lu sighed. “Xiao Wu, you...”"]},{"number":3190,"title":"Chapter 3190 It’s Me","paragraphs":["3190 It’s Me","Seeing her like that, Mr. Lu sighed. “Xiao Wu, you...”","“What?” Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment.","Mr. Lu said, “I guess ignorance does make one innocent.”","Feng Wu looked perplexed.","Mr. Lu said, “That’s it, then. Mr. Helian has told you everything you need to know. Just remember: Don’t keep anything from the general. He hates it when people lie to him.”","Feng Wu said, “I see.”","Mr. Lu couldn’t help but worry when he saw how indifferent Feng Wu was.","He was even more worried than the “culprit.”","They arrived at the general’s residence, which was an impressive establishment.","It took up thousands of square meters of land, but there was only one building at the center of the spacious square.","A pair of 10m-tall red lion sculptures were set outside the gate. They held their heads high and looked quite imposing.","The doors were vermilion and made of bronze.","Bronze nails on the doors glinted.","There were no guards at the gate.","It was as if the general was the only one in this residence.","As soon as they arrived, they heard the general’s distant voice.","“Come in.”","The two plain words were full of intimidation.","Mr. Xu and Mr. Lu had worked with the general for years and knew him well. Hearing the general’s voice, they immediately realized he was in a bad mood.","Mr. Xu glanced at Mr. Lu with a knowing look and a half-smile.","The general might not argue with a girl, but he could go after Mr. Lu.","Mr. Lu smiled bitterly, realizing he could be in trouble today.","Still, he had to defend Feng Wu.","Mr. Lu had asked Elder Helian about Jun Linyuan, but it just so happened that Jun Linyuan was in seclusion and couldn’t offer any help.","Mr. Lu could only summon up his courage and lead Feng Wu inside.","Behind the gate was the large square, and the sole building in the center of it.","They entered the building, and the general was inside.","The three of them hadn’t changed positions.","Feng Wu stood in the middle with Mr. Lu on her right and Mr. Xu on her left.","It was her first time meeting her godfather.","According to Feng Xun, he had only met his father a few times because the latter was too busy confronting the Dongsang Kingdom. He hadn’t returned to the imperial capital for ten years.","Feng Wu finally got to see the legendary Northern Feng General.","He alone had helped the Junwu Empire intimidate the Dongsang Kingdom.","Northern Feng General sat on a cushion with his legs crossed.","He seemed to be in his early thirties and had sculpted features and sharp eyes.","While Feng Wu was looking at him, he was studying her as well.","There was a letter in his pocket.","It had come from his wife a while ago.","She wrote excitedly that she had found them a goddaughter named Feng Wu and was sure he would like her when they met.","Impossible!","Northern Feng General wouldn’t believe her. He found his wife too soft-hearted. How could she take in a daughter just like that?","Apart from his wife, he didn’t care about any other woman, even if she was only a girl.","He now saw the girl that his wife had mentioned in the letter.","She was... Well, she indeed looked as delicate as his wife had said and was as pretty as a china doll.","She stood there, looking scared. She seemed to want to stay away from Mr. Xu. The general thought, “Did Mr. Xu bully her on her way here?!”","Northern Feng General frowned and was a little displeased.","“Little Feng Wu?” Northern Feng General kept his gaze on her.","“Yes, godfather. It’s me,” Feng Wu said sweetly."]},{"number":3191,"title":"Chapter 3191 Father","paragraphs":["3191 Father","Feng Wu beamed at the general. She was a beautiful girl, and her smile was more uplifting than a blossoming flower and brighter than the sunlight. Anyone who saw her smile would feel their mood lighten.","Northern Feng General felt as if sunlight had enveloped him, and was in a much better mood.","Godfather?","Mr. Xu and Mr. Lu thought their legs would give way when they heard this.","Godfather?","Godfather?!","Mr. Xu was so surprised that his eyes popped.","It had bothered him when Elder Dongfang told him that Feng Wu had some sort of relationship with the crown prince. And now, Feng Wu had suddenly become Northern Feng General’s goddaughter.","This couldn’t be happening!","Northern Feng General was too serious and impatient to be anyone’s godfather!","Mr. Xu stared at Northern Feng General in surprise and realized the latter hadn’t denied it.","However, Northern Feng General remained indifferent. He nodded and frowned.","He stared at Feng Wu. “I thought you’d forgotten who I am! Have you realized what you’ve done?!”","Very nice! Mr. Xu nodded.","Feng Wu loves to quarrel. Look at how she criticized me! She won’t take this lying down. I’m sure she’ll talk back to him.","Mr. Xu couldn’t wait to see the father and daughter shouting at each other, but to his surprise, when the disobedient girl heard what Northern Feng General said, she lowered her head and listened obediently.","When she wrung her hands together, she looked like a terrified puppy.","Mr. Xu was so angry that he almost laughed.","The girl was so arrogant when she argued with him earlier. She hadn’t been like this at all!","What a duplicitous kid!","Her voice had been so harsh before. What about now?","She was speaking in such a soft and sweet voice. She even sounded like an ordinary girl trying to butter her father up. “Father, I’m sorry...”","She even rubbed her hands together in a fluster as she spoke.","No, you’re not sorry at all! Mr. Xu wanted to kick the girl in the butt.","She’s pretending! Mr. Xu thought.","Northern Feng General was very observant!","Mr. Xu remembered that Northern Feng General could discover every little thing he wanted to keep to himself.","Northern Feng General didn’t believe in giving someone a break. Nothing could get past his sharp eyes.","Therefore, Mr. Xu was waiting for Northern Feng General to get angry, but what did he see?","Northern Feng General still kept a straight face as he scolded Feng Wu. “You’re sorry? Do you know what you’ve done?”","Feng Wu said, “I... I shouldn’t have broken your inscription...”","The Northern Feng General asked sternly, “What else?”","Feng Wu said, “I shouldn’t have built a new dome after breaking the previous one...”","Northern Feng General ground his teeth. “Keep talking!”","Mr. Xu frowned. That wasn’t an apology! Feng Wu was showing off!","No one could break Northern Feng General’s Level 8 inscription and build a new one. The father and daughter had to be putting on a show!","Feng Wu pretended to sob. “I shouldn’t have lied to them and told them you built it...”","Northern Feng General rubbed his temples.","Feng Wu was right. That was all she did. The elders of the Military Academy were simply stupid enough to be misguided."]},{"number":3192,"title":"Chapter 3192 What an Adorable Daughter","paragraphs":["3192 What an Adorable Daughter","Mr. Xu glared at Feng Wu.","He had never met someone like her before.","She was so irritable when confronting him, but she couldn’t apologize fast enough when facing her father.","He found Northern Feng General equally strange. How could a perceptive man like him not see this?","Mr. Xu felt a lump in his throat.","Quarreling with a girl was already humiliating, but to make it worse, he couldn’t win.","It would make him a laughingstock!","Of course, someone like Mr. Xu wouldn’t raise his voice. Instead, he remained perfectly calm.","So did Mr. Lu.","He rolled his eyes at Feng Wu.","“What else? Get to the point!” Northern Feng General stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “Well...”","Northern Feng General said, “Leniency to those who confess, severity to those who resist. Don’t you know that? Tell me the truth!”","Feng Wu lowered her head and mumbled something.","Her voice was so low that Northern Feng General couldn’t hear her.","“What was that?” Northern Feng General frowned.","Before Feng Wu said anything, Mr. Xu answered for her.","“She said ‘leniency and freedom to those who confess, severity and prison to those who resist’.”","Feng Wu glared at Mr. Xu. The general wasn’t asking him. What a nosy man.","Mr. Xu was pleased with himself.","Mr. Lu chuckled.","He couldn’t hold it anymore.","He immediately took a step back, hoping that no one would notice him.","Northern Feng General almost laughed.","“So, you know you can go to prison for this. Answer my question!” Northern Feng General put on a stern face again.","He was already impressed.","The girl was lovely and funny. How could such an adorable person exist? Where did his wife find her?","Feng Wu still spoke in that soft and timid voice. “I shouldn’t have let the people of Imperial College absorb all the all-purpose transformation liquid...”","Northern Feng General feigned an angry expression.","Feng Wu said, “But that’s because Mr. Xu took the liberty first! He said giving us 50% was showing us mercy. Otherwise, they would have taken 70%!”","Feng Wu’s eyes glowed as she told her side of the story. “Father, they crossed the line! Both schools made great sacrifices for the empire. Why is Imperial College always marginalized? Father, the elders of Imperial College weep for the blood they’ve shed!”","Mr. Xu was infuriated by what Feng Wu said, but Northern Feng General and Mr. Lu had different interpretations.","“Weep for the blood they’ve shed...” Northern Feng General recalled how Imperial College had defended the empire against the Dongsang Kingdom for the past decades. Countless members had been buried in Peace Grassland.","Northern Feng General was touched.","Why was his daughter so persuasive?","Mr. Lu also felt he had never adored Feng Wu so much.","Mr. Xu was furious.","What upset him more was he couldn’t find anyone good at quarreling in the Military Academy, and he had to do it himself.","“Didn’t the Military Academy make the same kind of sacrifices?”","“Of course you did,” Feng Wu said softly and gave him a pleading look. “But the elders of the Military Academy are already so powerful. Why do they want to take the all-purpose transformation liquid from Imperial College? Why can’t they give our elders more opportunities?”"]},{"number":3193,"title":"Chapter 3193 Serve Her Father Tea","paragraphs":["3193 Serve Her Father Tea","Mr. Xu didn’t know how to answer those questions.","He opened his mouth but suddenly realized he would walk into Feng Wu’s trap.","No matter what he said, it wouldn’t sound right.","The girl is so good at this, Mr. Xu thought in frustration.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was complaining to her father. “First of all, I won mine No. 3 from them. Elder Helian has the paperwork, and it shows that the mine belongs to Imperial College.”","Northern Feng General glanced at Mr. Lu, who nodded and confirmed that claim.","Feng Wu continued. “I fell into the all-purpose transformation liquid while making a breakthrough. It was my discovery!”","Mr. Xu wanted to speak, but Feng Wu wouldn’t give him the chance.","“Father, the Military Academy had that mine for so many years, but they never found the all-purpose transformation liquid. That means it was never meant for them to find. Since they never discovered it, they don’t have a right to use it!","“Father, do you think I’m right?” Feng Wu elongated the last syllable like a little girl buttering her father up.","Northern Feng General was lost in her sweet voice.","He only came back to his senses when Feng Wu finished.","Mr. Xu couldn’t hold back his anger anymore.","What did she mean by they didn’t have the right to use it? That was outrageous!","Northern Feng General said, “Even so, you shouldn’t have let Imperial College use it up. Give your neighbor a little.”","Hearing this, Mr. Xu was speechless.","Northern Feng General looked at Feng Wu. “Do you know your mistake now?”","Feng Wu nodded repeatedly. “Yes. I should have left a little for Mr. Xu.”","Northern Feng General was very pleased.","Daughters were the best.","What a humble girl.","Feng Xun, that stupid kid, would have screamed “I didn’t do anything wrong” even when Northern Feng General struck him with the thickest whip!","Northern Feng General liked Feng Wu even more.","Ahem!","He cleared his throat, indicating he was still angry.","Hearing that, the girl took a step back as if she was frightened.","Did he frighten her?","Seeing the concerned look on Northern Feng General’s face, Mr. Xu was so angry that he didn’t want to speak anymore.","They were right. He shouldn’t have relied on other people. Even Northern Feng General, the most reliable man, became unreliable when meeting Feng Wu. Mr. Xu felt he had been betrayed by the world.","Northern Feng General still had an expressionless face, but he no longer seemed so scary.","He said sternly, “If you know what your mistake is, do you know what you should do?”","Northern Feng General gestured at the teapot on the table.","Feng Wu was a clever girl and immediately took the hint.","She ran to the table and poured a cup of tea.","Mr. Xu smirked.","Does she want to serve me tea as an apology?","Does she want to do that now? Why didn’t she do so earlier? I won’t forgive her, Mr. Xu thought proudly.","However, Feng Wu didn’t serve the tea to Mr. Xu as an apology. Instead, she went up to Northern Feng General, who looked at her in bewilderment.","Feng Wu handed him the cup with both hands. “Father, you’ve been working on defeating the Dongsang Kingdom day and night. You must be very tired, but you still took the time to look after me. I promise I won’t make you worry about me again.”","Mr. Xu thought, What a sycophant!"]},{"number":3194,"title":"Chapter 3194 What Could He Do?","paragraphs":["3194 What Could He Do?","My daughter is so adorable! Northern Feng General’s heart suddenly softened.","“Father, you’ve been talking a lot. Have some tea. It’s good for your throat,” Feng Wu said gently with a sincere smile.","Northern Feng General wanted to rub her head, but on second thought, he realized it would look like he was taking her side.","Hence, he cleared his throat and straightened his face. “You’re a big girl now and should be able to tell right from wrong.”","He then turned to Mr. Xu. “Mr. Xu, she’s just a kid. I know she’s offended you, but please forgive her childish behavior. Xiao Wu, apologize to Mr. Xu.”","“Of course,” Feng Wu replied without hesitation. She ran to Mr. Xu’s side and bowed. “Mr. Xu, you’re a generous man. Please forgive an ignorant girl. How about this? When I find something nice next time, I’ll give you a little.”","Mr. Xu was speechless.","He had never heard such a ridiculous apology!","However, he realized Northern Feng General had taken the girl’s side, and there was nothing he could do. He could only cup his hands, give Northern Feng General a bow, and leave the hall.","Northern Feng General glanced at Feng Wu.","Was he asking Feng Wu to make Mr. Xu happier?","Those elders were still waiting outside the front gate.","Because of the barrier, they couldn’t hear what was going on inside, which was why they had all gathered here.","Led by Elder Helian, the elders of Imperial College knelt in front of the red stone lions outside the gate.","They sincerely wanted the general to forgive Feng Wu.","However, the elders of the Military Academy were all sitting on the ground with their legs crossed.","They were staring at the tightly shut gate.","After hearing the general’s voice earlier, they believed he wouldn’t forgive Feng Wu so easily.","But punishing Feng Wu wasn’t their goal. They wanted more benefits.","The general had a lot of resources, and if he could favor the Military Academy over Imperial College...","The elders of Imperial College had become more capable now and were even stronger than those of the Military Academy. The latter couldn’t live with that.","Although they were all sitting on the ground, they kept exchanging looks. When the general asked them to enter, they would all make their requests.","Just then, the gate opened, and three people came out.","Mr. Xu walked in the front, followed by Feng Wu. Mr. Lu was still in the rear.","Seeing Feng Wu come out without a scratch on her, the elders were all perplexed.","After what Feng Wu had done, how could she return in one piece?","Elder Helian immediately went up to her. “Xiao Wu, are you alright?”","Elder Dongfang also approached them. “Mr. Xu, how did it go?”","Meanwhile...","Feng Wu smiled at Mr. Xu and said, “Old Xu, you’re out of my league.”","Mr. Xu was furious.","What could he do?","He couldn’t physically attack her, and she was much better at quarreling than he was. If he reprimanded her, what if she cried? Her godfather would definitely come after him.","Mr. Xu glared at Feng Wu, snorted, and started walking in another direction.","Old Xu?","Elder Dongfang realized something was off.","When she finally caught up with Mr. Xu, he didn’t even look at her. With his hands behind his back, he walked as fast as he could.","It was as if he didn’t want to face her questions.","What was going on?"]},{"number":3195,"title":"Chapter 3195 Favorite Question","paragraphs":["3195 Favorite Question","The elders of the Military Academy were dumbfounded.","They looked at one another in bewilderment.","Elder Dongfang wouldn’t look at Feng Wu. Instead, she stared at Mr. Lu. “Mr. Lu, what...”","Mr. Lu felt that he was the biggest winner of the day.","!!","His school had successfully guarded the all-purpose transformation liquid, and his elders had all made some progress. Other than that, he had won this battle in front of the general. How could he not be in a good mood?","Mr. Lu glanced at Elder Dongfang and decided to shirk the responsibility. “You should talk to Mr. Xu.”","Elder Dongfang didn’t dare offend Mr. Lu, a Spiritual Saint, so she threw a dirty look at Feng Wu and ran after Mr. Xu.","Feng Wu had no idea why Elder Dongfang glared at her.","The other elders of the Military Academy all left with Elder Dongfang, and the crowd outside the gate was instantly reduced by half.","Elder Helian rubbed Feng Wu’s head. “What happened? Why was Mr. Xu so angry?”","Feng Wu shrugged. “I have no idea. I didn’t do anything to him, but he was as angry as a balloonfish. What a petty man.”","Elder Helian didn’t dare talk behind Mr. Xu’s back.","If a Spiritual Saint really wanted to get to the bottom of something, nothing could be kept from them.","Feng Wu looked at the elders. Because she wasn’t as capable as they were, she couldn’t tell if they had made any improvements. She had to ask Elder Helian about it.","Elder Helian had been waiting for that question.","“Of course they’ve made breakthroughs!” he said excitedly. “Some elders have just made some progress. I think we can expect more.","“Guess what? We now have twenty intermediate Spiritual Overlords and four senior ones!”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up, and she gave him the reaction he had been waiting for. “Wow! That’s awesome!”","Elder Helian said, “Right? It was all thanks to your all-purpose transformation liquid! Our elders have made significant progress. We’re as powerful as the Military Academy’s elders now! They can’t intimidate us anymore!”","Elder Helian made the announcement proudly.","Feng Wu nodded with a smile. “Of course. Wait. You’ve only mentioned 24 elders. There should be one more.”","This was Elder Helian’s favorite question.","He couldn’t stop beaming at her.","Feng Wu immediately got the hint.","“Oh my, Elder Helian. You’re not a Spiritual Saint, are you?”","Elder Helian awkwardly scratched his head.","Feng Wu was pleasantly surprised. “Really? Are you a Spiritual Saint now?”","Although the Spiritual Saint Stage had different levels, it was still on a totally different level from the Spiritual Overlord Stage.","The two stages were two worlds apart.","Elder Helian nodded with a smile.","Feng Wu said, “That’s worth celebrating! Your treat!”","One more Spiritual Saint was a great help to the Junwu Empire.","“Aren’t we supposed to reach an equilibrium with the Dongsang Kingdom? We have one more Spiritual Saint now. What will they do?” Feng Wu frowned.","That was beyond Elder Helian’s pay grade.","Mr. Lu said, “That’ll depend on the negotiation between the two sides. Either we’ll send an elder back, or they’ll send another one to the border. Spiritual Saints are so rare. I don’t think the Dongsang Kingdom can come up with a new one.”"]},{"number":3196,"title":"Chapter 3196 You’re Still Alive","paragraphs":["3196 You’re Still Alive","“You’ve contributed greatly to our progress.” Mr. Lu looked at Feng Wu. “Did you really think you could fool the general? He didn’t punish you because Elder Helian became a Spiritual Saint!”","Feng Wu stuck out her tongue at him.","Her godfather adored her. So what? Those people were only jealous of her.","Just then, they heard a voice. “Helian Li, come in!”","!!","The general wanted to see him, and Elder Helian was a little nervous.","Feng Wu patted him on the shoulder. “The general is a very amicable man.”","Elder Helian wanted to laugh at her.","According to Mr. Lu, Imperial College was now short of an ordinary elder and would probably send someone here.","“Are you familiar with Yang Zhihu?” An idea seemed to strike Mr. Lu.","Feng Wu said. “He’s pretty good.”","Mr. Lu nodded. “The colonels have made some significant progress this time. If Yang Zhihu is still a Level 9 Spiritual King, I don’t think he can lead the colonels anymore.”","Feng Wu frowned. “Is that an order? Is it the final decision?”","Mr. Lu said, “Yes, it is.”","After that, he patted Feng Wu’s head. “He’ll be replaced by one of the elders. Don’t worry. They won’t mistreat you.”","By now, the elders worshiped the ground she walked on.","However, Feng Wu couldn’t bring herself to see Yang Zhihu leave because he was a nice guy.","...","After bidding Elder Helian farewell, Feng Wu went to the colonels’ quarters.","As soon as she arrived, she found everybody scattered around the square.","Some of them had finished cultivating, and some were still in the process of making their breakthroughs.","Wang Zhaole opened his eyes to find Feng Wu a few steps away.","His eyes lit up.","“Feng Wu?!”","He ran toward her like a cannonball.","Hearing that name, many people opened their eyes.","They were all astonished to see her.","Feng Wu?","She was alive!","She was right here!","“You’re alive!” Yang Hong was thrilled. He rushed to Feng Wu’s side, ran around her, and asked in excitement, “You really are alive!”","Feng Wu rubbed her temple. What else could she be? Dead?","“Why can’t I be alive?” Feng Wu asked in resignation.","“But... you know...” She had shouted at Elder Dongfang as well as Mr. Xu, the schoolmaster of the Military Academy!","How could she come back in one piece after what she had done?","“Do you own this fortress?!”","Someone actually asked that question.","It was Yue Xiu, the first person who had found Feng Wu.","A few days ago, he had just thought that she was a delicate-looking girl. Therefore, he couldn’t figure out how she could have...","Wang Zhaole said, “I heard from Elder Mei that you specifically invited us to use the liquid?”","None of the colonels were stupid.","The senior colonels were more capable than they were, but why didn’t Feng Wu ask for them? It couldn’t be because she liked them more.","The suggestion must have come from someone high up in the chain of command.","Feng Wu nodded. “There was still some liquid left, and I didn’t want to waste it, so I told you guys to use it. It would be great if you could make some progress. Even if that isn’t the case, the liquid can still enhance your physical strength.”"]},{"number":3197,"title":"Chapter 3197 Young Lord Feng Is in Trouble","paragraphs":["3197 Young Lord Feng Is in Trouble","“I made two breakthroughs!” Wang Zhaole said solemnly. “I’m a Level 8 Spiritual King now.”","Feng Wu was surprised. “By that much?”","Wang Zhaole nodded solemnly. “I was already a peak Level 6 Spiritual King, and the breakthroughs have saved me years of cultivation. Feng Wu, I owe you one!”","Yang Hong also nodded solemnly. “I’m also a Level 8 Spiritual King now. Feng Wu, I’ll return this favor!”","!!","The other colonels all earnestly thanked Feng Wu.","They knew they had used the resources that even the Military Academy hadn’t gotten a chance to use.","That liquid was supposed to be saved for the elders.","It was all thanks to Feng Wu.","She awkwardly scratched her head, not used to everyone’s solemn tones.","She just hadn’t wanted to waste the all-purpose transformation liquid on the Military Academy’s elders.","Seeing how earnest the others were, even Feng Wu, who had seen many strange things, felt abashed.","She was good at getting back at people who mistreated her. When other people were kind to her, she felt rather shy.","“You’re holding your stomach. Are you hurt?” one of the girls asked.","“This is Jiang Li. She did all your paperwork when you came to the colonels’ quarters,” Wang Zhaole told Feng Wu with a smile.","Feng Wu nodded at Jiang Li and said earnestly, “I’m hungry.”","The others suddenly recalled how Feng Wu had eaten all the essence crystals in the colonels’ quarters.","Feng Wu had repaid them dozens or hundreds of times over.","Some of the colonels here had complained about Feng Wu using too many essence crystals. They all apologized to her now and asked for her forgiveness.","They wanted to take her to the restaurant and thank her properly.","Feng Wu was a little flustered.","She felt rather awkward when the others thanked her like this. As for the meal, she decided to turn it down.","Just then, someone rushed into the square.","She didn’t know the person, but the other colonels did.","“That’s Mu Nan!” Wang Zhaole told Feng Wu. “He went to the Dayless Woods with Young Lord Feng on a mission. Why is he back alone? Has something gone wrong with his team?”","Young Lord Feng?!","Feng Xun?!","Feng Wu grew uneasy.","Mu Nan ran into the crowd, holding his stomach. He panted and shouted, “Quickly! We must go to the arena on the border. Young Lord Feng is fighting with them!”","Huh?","Feng Wu immediately dashed off.","She rolled up her sleeves and was ready for a big battle.","The colonels were thrilled to see this.","Wang Zhaole raised his spear. “Guys, it’s time to show our strength! Let’s go!”","Everybody was as excited as he was.","They had just made breakthroughs, and someone was here to challenge them. What a great chance to test out their new abilities!","“Let’s go, everybody!”","“It’s only the intermediate arena, but even if it’s the senior arena, we still won’t back off!”","“Let’s go! Young Lord Feng might be in danger!”","Everybody rushed off at top speed."]},{"number":3198,"title":"Chapter 3198 Hurts","paragraphs":["3198 Hurts","However, they were dumbfounded when they got there.","Those people didn’t seem to be fighting.","They saw that the senior arena was surrounded by a large group of people.","Leading the colonels, Feng Wu squeezed through the crowd.","!!","“Excuse us.”","They were all colonels, and the spectators were mostly lieutenant colonels or majors, who backed away when they saw Feng Wu and her colleagues.","Here in Peace Grassland, the cultivators had a strict hierarchy.","That was why everybody was so astonished when they heard the way Feng Wu spoke to Elder Dongfang and Mr. Xu.","Feng Wu ran to the front of the team and soon saw Feng Xun and Xuan Yi.","What?","Something didn’t seem right.","The two sides in the arena didn’t seem to be fighting.","There were two tables in the arena, and each had a giant plate on it. On each plate was an entire roast sheep.","The skin was golden and crisp, and the aroma filled the air.","That wasn’t the strangest thing. What surprised Feng Wu was when she saw one man from the Junwu Empire and one man from the Dongsang Kingdom sitting at each table.","What was...","Feng Wu was perplexed.","She didn’t know who those people were, but neither one of them was Feng Xun.","She searched the audience and soon spotted Feng Xun.","When she found Feng Xun, he was lying on a soft-padded chair.","His face was injured, and blood was trickling down his fair cheek.","His hand was on his stomach, and he kept whining. The injury was obviously quite severe.","He sucked in a pained breath and waved his fist. “We can’t lose this time! Those five weapons all have inscriptions! I don’t care what it takes. We must win!”","Feng Wu stood behind him and patted him on the shoulder.","Feng Xun didn’t even look up. “Which b*stard is it? Touching my shoulder...”","He looked over his shoulder and saw Feng Wu.","“Ah!” He involuntarily tried to cover his face.","The injury on his face was pretty bad, and he didn’t want to scare his sister.","Feng Wu glared at him. “Put your hands down. I’ve seen everything!”","Feng Xun pouted and looked up at his fierce little sister.","Feng Wu said sternly, “Put your hands away.”","She couldn’t understand why the son of Northern Feng General didn’t care a little bit more about his appearance.","There was a deep cut on his cheek, but he was still bantering with others.","Feng Wu took a bottle of Semi-Divine coagulant ointment out of her storage space and carefully applied it on Feng Xun’s wound with a cotton swab.","The ointment was very effective and immediately stopped the bleeding.","She still couldn’t stand seeing such a scar on his handsome face.","“What happened?” Feng Wu pressed the edge of the wound when she put a clean cloth on it.","Ssss —","Feng Xun frowned and sucked in a breath. “That hurts!”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “So it does hurt. Why didn’t you treat your wound then, but let it bleed?”","Feng Xun looked at her like a scared puppy.","Feng Wu stared at him. “Your hand!”","Feng Xun immediately put his hand on hers.","Feng Wu focused on checking his pulse.","Meanwhile, around them..."]},{"number":3199,"title":"Chapter 3199 My Sister","paragraphs":["3199 My Sister","Meanwhile, everybody around them was staring at Feng Wu in astonishment, especially her fellow colonels.","Feng Wu?","Young Lord Feng?","Were they close?","!!","It seemed to be more than that since their relationship looked a little strange.","The colonels knew Feng Xun well. He was as capable as he was arrogant. Not only was he the general’s son, he was also the crown prince’s good friend.","All of that made the colonels afraid of him.","Because of his high social status, the others didn’t dare approach him.","They usually only talked about him in private but never dared speak to him in person. Only Yan Han was a little more familiar with him.","What was going on here?","The others had been secretly worried about Feng Wu. Yan Han had been left out when the others went to use the all-purpose transformation liquid. Would Yan Han hold a grudge against Feng Wu because of that? Would Yan Han get Feng Xun to go after Feng Wu? The other colonels thought that would happen, and decided to stay by Feng Wu’s side.","However, the result was beyond their expectations.","Feng Wu...","She...","She seemed so close to Young Lord Feng.","Wang Zhaole summoned up his courage and patted Feng Wu on the shoulder. “Feng Wu, I didn’t know you and Young Lord Feng were so close.”","Feng Wu looked at the hand on her shoulder.","So did Feng Xun.","Wang Zhaole felt uneasy. He did that because he saw Yang Zhihu pat Feng Wu on the shoulder before.","He immediately put his hand down.","Feng Xun looked at Wang Zhaole and thought, “Man, you’re very brave.”","Wang Zhaole was dumbfounded and wondered what he had done.","Feng Wu had finished checking Feng Xun’s pulse. She took out a pill and stuffed it into his mouth. “Swallow it.”","Feng Xun obediently did as he was told.","Feng Wu was used to seeing him so obedient, but other people weren’t.","Wang Zhaole was speechless, and so were Yang Hong and Yue Xiu.","They all looked at one another, thinking they had gone blind.","Wang Zhaole’s eyes lit up when an idea crossed his mind.","So, Feng Wu and Young Lord Feng were...","Feng Xun immediately saw what he was thinking.","He had been misunderstood so many times.","“She’s my sister!” Feng Xun took Feng Wu’s hand and showed her off. “My sister!”","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","Wow!","The general’s daughter?","Luckily, not many people dared approach Feng Xun. After the big announcement, no one made any loud noise. Instead, they only sucked in their breaths.","OMG! Feng Wu was so well-connected!","Many things were clear now.","Why was she bold enough to criticize Elder Dongfang? Why wouldn’t she follow Mr. Xu’s order? That was because she was the general’s daughter!","Many people recalled the previous argument between Feng Wu and Han Lu.","Back then, they had all been misled by Yan Han and thought Feng Wu had become a colonel through indecent means. There was nothing indecent! She was the general’s daughter!","Elder Yan was Yan Han’s connection, but Feng Wu’s connection was...","Everybody stared at Feng Wu and felt dazed by the frightening news."]},{"number":3200,"title":"Chapter 3200 Eating Competition","paragraphs":["3200 Eating Competition","Everybody looked at Feng Wu differently.","Feng Wu cast a dirty look at Feng Xun, knowing he had done it on purpose.","Feng Xun gloated.","So what?","He had such a pretty sister. The others couldn’t say the same. Why couldn’t he show her off?","Feng Wu rubbed her temples and couldn’t believe how childish Feng Xun was.","Just then, somebody cried out in surprise.","Feng Wu looked in the direction of the arena.","The food on the tables was mostly finished.","The contestant of the Junwu Empire was on the left, and the Dongsang Kingdom’s man was on the right.","They were having an eating contest.","The Junwu Empire’s contestant had eaten three roast sheep, but his opponent was even better. He had eaten three and a half.","“We only have five minutes left!” Feng Xun said nervously.","Feng Wu asked, “What’s going on?”","If that question had come from someone else, Feng Xun wouldn’t have had the patience to answer, but Feng Wu was a different story.","“It’s an eating competition,” said Feng Xun. “We had a conflict with the Dongsang assassins in the Dayless Woods. I won’t go into detail. Anyway, we finally decided to settle it with an eating competition.”","Feng Xun frowned. “Those Dongsang Kingdom assassins are so short. Who would have thought they would have the bloodline of giants? After accepting the challenge, they drank some potion and all became giants!","“Look. They’re about 2.5 meters tall, and some are even 3 meters! They’re huge!”","Feng Xun buried his head in his hands. “We didn’t know this was going to happen when we made that decision. They tricked us!”","Feng Wu gave him a strange look.","Feng Xun said bitterly, “Each side has five contestants. This is their first giant, but we’ve sent up three people already.”","Feng Xun pointed at his men. “They’ve all lost. Look at Xuan Yi...”","Right now, Xuan Yi, the proud swordsman, was vomiting a few steps away.","Feng Wu was speechless.","Feng Xun said nervously, “We’re definitely going to lose! I’m so stupid! How could I agree to their suggestion? They tricked us! I’m so angry!”","Feng Wu looked at him.","Feng Xun said, “Xiao Wu, please don’t look at me like that. They really tricked me! The Dongsang Kingdom is full of bad people! When I’m capable enough, I’ll kill all of them!”","Feng Wu said, “I’m pitying an idiot.”","Feng Xun was speechless but didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu asked, “What’s this competition about?”","Feng Xun said, “We found a sword grave in the Dayless Woods. There are five swords, but we don’t know who put them there.","“I wouldn’t be so nervous if they were some other swords, but those have inscriptions on them.”","Feng Xun said, “Xiao Wu, those swords have inscriptions, which can increase the power of an attack by 50%! All five of them!","“They’re suitable for peak Spiritual Kings!","“None of the five members of my team has a sword with inscriptions.”"]}]);
